  ('9cd76955-7c6c-4abe-8689-ce7b583e4523', 'batavia_ii', DATE '2025-08-21', 'Austin', 'delivery 8/21/25... 9/8/25.... 9/15/25 invoice 8920 Started Converting chemicals on 8/21/25. The old sealer and wax are still online.  '),
  ('9cb855c7-7f97-4b5e-9917-be085fcdcd9e', 'batavia_ii', DATE '2025-10-21', 'Austin', 'Delivery 10/10/25 invoice# 9020 Delivery 10/22/25 Invoice#9041... started conversions on 8/21/25. Quantities are from 8/21/25-10/21/25, while car counts are from 9/21/25-10/21/25. Usages will not be accurate yet.'),
  ('b1706ca3-3b23-4b89-b5cf-3b942382e3c4', 'batavia_ii', DATE '2025-10-29', 'Austin', 'Delivery 10/29/25 invoice#9063.. Delivery 11/25/25 invoice#9099... 10/29, prep gun performance high is set up and ready to go... mananger will convert when ready. Delivery 11/5/25... invoice#9080 Graphene installed 12/1/25. '),
  ('cd7e2dc0-e8fc-43ae-8969-ae18999f0f01', 'batavia_ii', DATE '2025-11-25', 'Austin', 'Delivery 10/29/25 invoice#9063.. Delivery 11/25/25 invoice#9099... 10/29, prep gun performance high is set up and ready to go... mananger will convert when ready. Delivery 11/5/25... invoice#9080 Graphene installed 12/1/25. '),
  ('870d6504-a6c9-490b-b340-639b6ee80fc0', 'batavia_ii', DATE '2025-12-18', 'Austin', ' Delivery 12/19/25 invoice#9145... The Ksticks for pre soak 1 performance high have not been functioning for several months now, managers have been aware. they fill with water but draw no soap. The Graphene, rust repel, Sensatons Red, Sensatons Blue, Sensatons Gold Are all set up and ready to be turned on. Cars look great.'),
  ('b6128244-422a-4808-97cd-bbb96f0f420b', 'batavia_ii', DATE '2026-01-21', 'Austin', ' Eeliver 1/23/26 invoice 9027.... Delivery 1/12/26 invoice 9184...  The Ksticks for pre soak 1 performance high have not been functioning for several months now, the foamers need to be cleaned or replaced. they fill with water but draw no soap. The Cta is not drawing chemical, spoke to noah, there is water in the air lines... The Graphene, rust repel, Sensatons Red, Sensatons Blue, Sensatons Gold Are all set up and ready to be turned on. Converted the sealer to protect Cars look great.'),
  ('62678d29-4c5e-4566-9ac5-bcc7dd89fcef', 'batavia_ii', DATE '2026-02-19', 'Austin', ' Delivery 2/12/26 invoice 9066... 2/20/26-9093 ... site was closed down at time of visit, could not run functions...2/2/26-Converted the sealer to protect and wax to flash wax... Cars look great. there was a leaky fitting in the bug remover that was causing it to run and draw chemical....'),
  ('511240db-7085-4db7-af4c-bf2029dca203', 'batavia_ii', DATE '2026-03-24', 'Austin', ' DCars look great. there is a leaky fitting in the bug remover that was causing it to run and draw chemical.... Adjusted performance high presoak 1, and the prep gun. adjusted peak low and flash wax... Delivery SB 03/10/26 Invoice #9132... Delivery 3/25/26 Invoice# 9163 SB'),
  ('1b7ef692-a131-4268-bdf4-92b7f32f2fab', 'batavia_ii', DATE '2026-04-22', 'Austin', 'Delivery 4/22/26 Invoice# 9218... Hardness=14 TDS=230 Conveyer=140... There is a problem with the water softener and/or the RO system, the water is extremely hard... causing build up in functions... There is a leaky fitting in the bug remover that was causing it to run and draw chemical.... The pre soak 1 kstick foamers and wrap foamer foamers are clogged with hard deposits and not allowing product to mix and spray, neither are functioning correctly. The sealer arch is clogged with hard depostits, causing the product to not flow through the arch. The stop valve for the prep gun water holding tank is not fully closing, causing water to flow back into the chemical, I installed a check valve on the chemical line. the stop valve needs to be fixed. The water reservoir for prep gun was filled with hard deposits, clogging the prep gun lines, and causing the chemical not to draw. I drained and cleaned the holding tank. it is working now but the stop valve needs to be replaced. We Converted the presoak 1 performance high to peak lo... Installed infusions fresh on the pre soak 2 lo phoam... the remaining performance high will be used on the prep gun... cleaned the nozzles on the rust repel sprayer, they were clogged with hard deposits...'),
  ('2405a012-784c-4b4f-916d-c17d213cdec6', 'batavia_ii', DATE '2026-05-14', 'Austin', ' Hardness=14 TDS=230 Conveyer=140... The tunnel was shut down time of visit. Chuck and Phil were installing a new mother board. Delivery SB 05/14/26 Invoice #9257'),
  ('d31ea2c3-1f9f-4d64-9888-6152fb01d060', 'batavia_ii', DATE '2026-06-17', 'Austin', ' Hardness=14 TDS=250 Conveyer=140... The Water tds is extremely high, and is affectiong the quiality of the wash. Delivery SB 05/14/26 Invoice #9257 Delivery 5/29/26 invoice # 9303... Delivery 6/12/26 invoice # 9337...  Delivery 6/16/26 invoice # 9344... The holding tank for the prep guns was dumped, and flooded both performance high reservoirs, usages will be off...Ceramix punch converted to slipstream ceramic x...'),
  ('4c10256c-b21c-431a-a989-91e867dd2b58', 'batavia_ii', DATE '2026-07-20', 'Austin', 'Delivery 7/20/26 Invoice #9257...  Delivery SB 07/07/26 Invoice #9383...Hardness=1 TDS=16/250 Conveyer=140... LO PHOAM ALSO GOES TO MATT ROOM SCRUB BRUSH - BABY RESERVOIR NEAR OFFICE...The holding tanks for the spot free water are being drained too fast so the spot free rinse is going back and forth between R.O. water and regular water, causing the TDS to be 16 on some cars and above 200 on others... tds goes from extremely high, and is affectiong the quiality of the wash. Ceramix punch converted to slipstream ceramic x on june 20th... usage is 7-8mls a car, usages will be correct next month.... Cta hws had a clogged versa dial usage will be off...Flash wax had a clogged versa dial usage will be off... infusions scent had the foot valve pulled off of the poly line, usage is off.... adjusted the triple foams down for a better rinse...Viper tire shine had a blown fitting and was leaking several gallons of viper per day... several nozzles are clogged on the omni rinse.... tire shine needs to be maintenanced... there are multiple leaky fittings....'),
  ('657a33c7-b2f2-4fca-8317-842ae0591121', 'batavia_liberty', DATE '2025-06-25', 'nh', 'first entry'),
  ('9ba6bae2-38f0-45be-879b-489d01654bdb', 'batavia_liberty', DATE '2025-08-22', 'Austin', 'Delivery 08/01/25  Invoice #8892... 8/20/25 invoice 8919... 8/25/25 invoice#8930 '),
  ('d2adbe26-4258-4a90-a8e8-8ab71d19d8cf', 'batavia_liberty', DATE '2025-09-23', 'Austin', 'Delivery 9/8/25 invoice 8962... Delivery 9/17/25 Invoice#8970... NOTE: Conversion on 9/16/25. Bay 1 is still using Lustra, to drain the reserviors. Bay 2 is fully converted, besides the drying agent, and 505 a maintenence order has been places to fix the drying agent on both bays. the tandem has not been converted yet. The tandem has no high pressure systems functioning, very VERY weak low pressures functions, no wheel scubbers or soap, VERY weak or no pre soaks functioning. it needs to be fixed before we can convert anything. Delivery SB 09/24/25 Invoice #8986'),
  ('8a78a671-e8ef-4b9c-85c1-359e60ef760b', 'batavia_liberty', DATE '2025-10-21', 'Austin', 'delivery 10/22/25 invoice#9043... usages will be inaccurate until both bays are fully converted. peak low had an issue with crystalization... We replaced the product, cleaned the reservoir and ran new chemical lines. everything is functioning properly now.'),
  ('b271cd0b-f550-4635-8aff-4c8ac2ce0b42', 'batavia_liberty', DATE '2025-11-25', 'Austin', 'Delivery SB 10/30/25 Invoice #9064 Delivery 11/25/25 Invoice#9101 Bay 2; There is a leak in the lines for the triple foams, in the track, on the passenger side. The plastic shroud on the passenger peddit arm is loose, and blocking the water and soap functions. Josh was on site to see the problems. Tipped down peak lo.'),
  ('a9a38469-0fd0-459e-904a-b5f1e2c125e6', 'batavia_liberty', DATE '2025-12-18', 'Austin', 'Delivery 12/18/25 Invoice#9144 Bay 2; Cleaned tips on red, gold and blue, Tipped down peak lo. 505 had broken tip. fixed. Bay 1; Unclogged underbody nozzles Tipped down peak lo.'),
  ('687f876e-3ef4-4aeb-85f1-8c60cf1e619f', 'batavia_liberty', DATE '2025-12-20', 'Austin', 'Delivery 1/21/26-9014...1/12/26 invoice 9183... both bays were closed at time of visit and delivery...'),
