  ('2ce26102-a8cd-469c-9a77-30436631bc6f', 'batavia_liberty', DATE '2026-01-19', 'Austin', 'Delivery 1/21/26-9014...1/12/26 invoice 9183... bay 1- No suction on presoak 2, side pedits. Bay 2- Cleaned tips for 3x foam Fully converted 421 to Bead up, 431 to Flash wax, 505 to HWS and both bays are fully converted to sonnys chemical. Site was shut down for over 2 weeks. '),
  ('fc6d6995-1565-4dae-bff3-6bb3a129603f', 'batavia_liberty', DATE '2026-02-19', 'Austin', 'Delivery 1/21/26-9014...2/12/26 invoice 9183... bay 1- No suction on presoak 2, side pedits. Bay 2- Cleaned tips for 3x foam Fully converted 421 to Bead up, 431 to Flash wax, 505 to HWS and both bays are fully converted to sonnys chemical. Site was shut down for over 2 weeks. '),
  ('493a9896-95d1-44fc-92a6-2bdce6b62322', 'batavia_liberty', DATE '2026-03-23', 'Austin', ' bay 1- No suction on presoak 2, side pedits. Usage numbers may be off as the last of the chemicals were all converted. BAY 1 has clogged water lines from the injector to the pedit, causing pre soak 2 not to draw. Adjusted flash wax, the dwell time on the function causes higher numbers. cars look great.... Delivery 3/25/26 Invoice#9160 SB'),
  ('6449c6fc-5696-4ee3-9c6a-31dc01272839', 'batavia_liberty', DATE '2026-04-21', 'Austin', 'Delivery 4/22/26 Invoice# 9217.... hardness=26 TDS=32 There is a problem with the water hardness. informed noah and managers of issues... BAY 1- No suction on presoak 2, side pedits, waterline is clogged solid... unplugged tips on presoak 1 top, sides, presoak 2 top, sides... unclogged and cleaned all 8 cta nozzles... BAY 2... no suction on blue triple foam... red triple foam line was pulled up out of the chemical in the reservoir eyesight and was not drawing... bead up not drawing... fixed... replaced diaphram on bead up... Adjusted flash wax, the dwell time on the function causes higher numbers. cars look great.... Usage numbers may be off as the last of the chemicals were all converted this month.  '),
  ('42c9e961-5a10-4b58-a278-f0c562a650d8', 'batavia_liberty', DATE '2026-05-13', 'Austin', 'Delivery SB 05/08/26 Invoice #9249.. hardness=  TDS=      I was unable to get car counts...Delivery SB 05/14/26 Invoice #9255  Delivery SB 05/22/26 Invoice #9285'),
  ('2a3dcd62-6b3f-474c-8130-0f5a6ccfe218', 'batavia_liberty', DATE '2026-05-18', 'Austin', 'Delivery SB 06/10/26 Invoice #9323. Delivery SB 05/08/26 Invoice #9249.. hardness=  TDS=   ...Delivery SB 05/14/26 Invoice #9255  Delivery SB 05/22/26 Invoice #9285 Delivery 5/30/26 invoice 9302...Delivery 6/3/26 invoice 9314... 12 gallons of bead of brought from vetts lasers.... Delivery 6/18/26 invoice#9355...'),
  ('aae0a992-a508-4a0a-a277-aa18c68e9e13', 'batavia_liberty', DATE '2026-07-20', 'Austin', 'Delivery 7/20/26 invoice#9404... hardness=9  TDS=200 June 1st, we came and titrated the presoaks and did a usage on all of the chemicals, and cleaned tips as nessesary.  12.5 gallons of Peak lo brought from vetts lasers... Bay 1 - Changed bad foot valve on peak lo and bead up. Tips were clogged on red and blue, causing weak suction and little usage. Replaced the 3 way connector for the peak lo pre soak 1 was bad, and allowing air into the lines. Bay 2 -  Changed bad foot valve on perf. high and bead up. Tips were clogged on red and blue, causing weak suction and little usage. Replaced the 3 way connector for the peak lo pre soak 1 that was bad, and allowing air into the lines. The bead up had a tan tip in the top function and a light blue tip in the side functions, and they should both be tan. this was corrected, usage will be lower next month...'),
  ('dadbe48e-db71-434b-9d08-3266abe74f24', 'batavia_veterans_iba', DATE '2025-08-22', 'austin', 'Delivery 08/01/25..  delivery 8/11/25 invoice 8893... Invoice #8875.. Delivery 8/14/25 invoice 8902.. 8/20/25 invoice 8918...  delivery 8/25/25 Bay 2- 421 leaking back. car counts will start at 1 because of the Grand total Car counts on the in bay system, and be closer next month and accurate the month after. Bay 1 Counts 1-37905 2-18328 3-17291 4-77 Bay 2- 1-41238 2-19695 3-18459 4-631'),
  ('9cd43783-7102-40fc-902e-eb242e3f1b92', 'batavia_veterans_iba', DATE '2025-09-23', 'austin', 'Delivery 9/17/25 Invoice#8971. NOTE: Conversion of non pre soaks on 9/17/25. Bay 1 is still using 427 and 400, to drain the reserviors both still have roughly 5 gallons. Leftover 341,342,343, from lasers are being used in the tunnel. The Drying agent on bay 2 had a broken diaphram assembly And is leaking and recieving no chemical. CAR COUNTS FOR REFERENCE Bay1- bb-38628 ub-18817 b- 18211 Bay2- bb-41463 ub-19791 b-18683.  Delivery SB 09/24/25 Invoice #8984'),
