  ('3bf2d71e-3bb7-4df6-b7f1-630414df69ac', 'batavia_veterans', DATE '2025-09-22', 'Austin', 'Leftover 341,342,343, from lasers are being used in the tunnel so the useges with be wrong. Several clogged nozzles on drying agent arch. Turned Protect dial setting from 16 to 14. Hws seems low but the cta''s are working great and look great. Delivery SB 09/24/25 Invoice #8985'),
