  ('70fa4f2b-f0d5-4ddf-a6c2-85543662f023', 'batavia_veterans', DATE '2025-11-24', 'Austin', 'Delivery 11/25/25 Invoice#9097... Hardness= 1 TDS=9 There is a cracked, leaking, Y shaped fitting on the water line for the CTA, Pre-soak HWS. Graphene fully installed 12/1/25'),
  ('a887f77b-f390-41b9-8605-1740d234ae6e', 'batavia_veterans', DATE '2025-12-18', 'Austin', 'Delivery 12/19/25 Invoice#9142... Hardness= 1 TDS=9 *There is a cracked, leaking, Y shaped fitting on the water line for the CTA, Pre-soak HWS. * Adjusted Flash wax, protect, x55, ceramic. Changing 461 Ceramic to Slipstream pro Ceramic. Tunnel and laser inventory is not being kept seperate by managers and it is difficult to keep track of usage forthe performance high. it is functioning properly and looks great. '),
  ('9da8c9e6-a346-4777-aa44-33f1508a1247', 'batavia_veterans', DATE '2026-01-21', 'Austin', 'delivery 1/23/26 9026...Delivery 12/19/25 Invoice#9142... Hardness= 1 TDS=9 Converted 461 to Slipstream pro ceramic. converted 540 to rust repel... adjusted performance high and hws and x55...'),
  ('64187398-26b6-4fb0-b833-fddc420296c1', 'batavia_veterans', DATE '2026-02-19', 'Austin', 'Delivery 2/20/26 Invoice#9096... Hardness= 1 TDS=9 Converted 461 to Slipstream pro ceramic. converted 540 to rust repel... CTA 1 HWS was leaking back badly from the injector, and was missing the versa dial and somhad a broken copper tip in the injector, the reservoir was diluted with water, numbers will be off... Changed versa dial filters for hws, flash wax, lo phoam pre soak 2 and '),
