  ('8787f6a1-9f63-42d1-ab21-9ae823382f0a', 'batavia_veterans', DATE '2026-05-13', 'SB', 'Delivery SB 06/01/26 Invoice #9304..Delivery 5/11/26 #9253...Site visit: Hardness=  TDS=  Conveyor=  Bug=  ...Delivery SB 05/14/26 Invoice #9256'),
  ('fe5c652e-55e5-483d-b41d-ef066bb0f133', 'batavia_veterans', DATE '2026-06-17', 'SB', 'Delivery SB 06/01/26 Invoice #9304..delivery 5/18/26 #9269Site visit: Hardness= 2 TDS=9  Conveyor=  Bug=  ...Delivery SB 05/14/26 Invoice #9256... delivery 6/16/26 #9342... Delivery 6/18/26 invoice#9342... Adjusted ceramic and graphex... 10 gallons of bug remover brought from liberty... Brought over chemicals from vets in bay, red, blue, gold, flash wax, performance high.... those will be added to tunnel reservoirs... Adjusted x55 and protect'),
  ('6920fb4b-3663-4712-b187-dad5a3a20adf', 'batavia_veterans', DATE '2026-07-20', 'Austin', 'Site visit: Hardness= 1 TDS=6  Conveyor=  Bug=  site is under construction... Adjusted x55 and protect... both products used too much because The x55 versa dial was on 25 , it should be on 16... drying agent arch needs the diaphrams replaced in the sprayer nozzles, and it was running constantly out of the very bottom sprayers on both sides causing chemical to be wasted... replaced diaphram for x55 on mizer board, stopped the leaking.... protect was turned up to 28, it should be on 16, the usage was extremely high... The versa dial for the hws CTA was clogged, cleaned it and cleaned the filter... manager is using prep gun instead of bug remover for some reason... bug remover usage is low.. rust repel chemical line was pulled out of the reservoir, someone moved it to work on something and never noticed that they pulled the line out...'),
