  ('5ac8516f-7bdb-438f-93f6-8a66abd195a2', 'hamburg', DATE '2025-10-20', 'Austin', 'Hardness=1 TDS=14 Changed bug remover down to red tip. Adjusted performance high and infusions. Converted 421 to Protect and 313 to Gold. Gold and Blue Triple Foamers were leaking from the caps, manager notified.'),
