  ('78316d1f-b2db-415c-88c2-b6d4cc3ea8f5', 'hamburg', DATE '2026-03-20', 'Austin', 'delivery 3/23/26 invoice#9153... 2/20/26- 9097... HARDNESS=1 TDS=13 CONVEYER=142... LO PHOAM ALSO RUNS TO MAT CLEANER *CTA 1 has used no chemical and does not appear to be turning on for any wash.*'),
  ('34186d6c-cfcb-4031-9927-052ff7b8d88b', 'hamburg', DATE '2026-04-17', 'Austin', 'delivery 4/20/26 invoice#9206.... HARDNESS=1 TDS=20 CONVEYER=142... LO PHOAM ALSO RUNS TO MAT CLEANER *CTA 1 has used no chemical and does not appear to be turning on for any wash.* TDS is high, manager informed...'),
  ('b37a64b6-6be3-4f5d-873d-3e4a4cefdb40', 'hamburg', DATE '2026-05-13', 'Nate', 'delivery 4/20/26 invoice#9206.... HARDNESS=1 TDS=20 CONVEYER=142... LO PHOAM ALSO RUNS TO MAT CLEANER *CTA 1 has used no chemical and does not appear to be turning on for any wash.* TDS is high, manager informed...Delivery SB 05/14/26 Invoice #9265'),
  ('8d42ac27-3cfc-419c-a0f5-961c55bac656', 'hamburg', DATE '2026-06-16', 'Nate', 'delivery 4/20/26 invoice#9206.... HARDNESS=1 TDS=25 CONVEYER=145... LO PHOAM ALSO RUNS TO MAT CLEANER *CTA 1 has used no chemical and does not appear to be turning on for any wash.* TDS is high, manager informed...Delivery SB 05/14/26 Invoice #9265.... Delivery 6/2/26 Invoice #9311... Delivery 6/18/25 Invoice #9350'),
  ('2c660ff1-a194-417e-aac0-8deb82a70ce8', 'hamburg', DATE '2026-07-16', 'Austin', 'delivery 7/21/26 invoice#9410.... HARDNESS=1 TDS=25 CONVEYER=145... LO PHOAM ALSO RUNS TO MAT CLEANER. Adjusted down the versa dial setting on the triple foams, and flash wax, and presoak 1 and adjusted the air. There are several functions that are not working with the according packages. The high pressure rinse between the triple foams and the drying agent/ sealer are not turning on for any package, so cars are coming out with soap. The presoak 2 lava bar is not turning on for the ultra bath wash, so the ultra bath wash is getting no presoak 2. The hot wax lava bar is turning on for the ultra bath wash causing way too much soap to be applied to the vehicle and since there is no overhead top brush on the ultra wash package and the rinse is not working on any package, some cars are coming out with soap on them. The hot wax should be on Bubble bath, ceramic, and as an ala cart only, not on ultra bath. there was a missing sprayer nozzle on the protect, manager had a spare, we replaced it.'),
  ('968d0d0e-0e94-41e1-8551-135a7ffc9dbc', 'williamsville', DATE '2025-07-21', 'nh', 'first entry: hardness=8 TDS=16 Conveyer=130  Bug Remover starting quantitiy is actually 53, usage is 23.25 gallons. inventory is disorganized, scattered and hidden througout the site. the quantity counts reflect this but are on track... 2 dryers are out. overhead high pressure sprayer has blown line. high pressure rinse has leak near the ceramic arch. hot wax is drawing chemical but not performing correctly at tunnel. The manager Nate has been informed.												'),
  ('79d7eb5a-4481-4883-bc34-ddc2f904e88e', 'williamsville', DATE '2025-08-21', 'SB', 'Site visit SB 08/21/25   Hardness=9  TDS=22 Conveyor=134. '),
  ('9d413d39-eba8-4515-8693-936eb58254d9', 'williamsville', DATE '2025-09-22', 'Austin', 'Delivery SB 08/22/25 Invoice #8925... Something is still wrong with the viper. showing no usage. switched over 260 and 500. new versadial and injector on pre soak 2 due to low suction, did not fix the issue. still has low suction. cta injector has low suction.'),
  ('aa0525df-ec79-4985-b06d-ee500f810545', 'williamsville', DATE '2025-10-20', 'Austin', 'Delivery 10/21/25 invoice 9021... Scent installed on10/13/25... Hardness=8 TDS=15 Adjusted gold, performance hi, infusions. Manager found a sensations red jug and several 500 buried that were not previously counted, usage shows off but it is within range. versa dial filter changed on drying agent and lo phoam pre soak 2.'),
  ('5214fd4d-431f-4700-ae34-aa08d7d02dee', 'williamsville', DATE '2025-11-20', 'Austin', 'Delivery 11/25/25 Invoice#9096... Hardness=9 Tds=14 Rust repel needs to be ran down before re filling. '),
  ('7c606329-06fc-4079-b361-3cd5d61ca66d', 'williamsville', DATE '2025-12-17', 'Austin', 'Delivery 12/18/25 Invoice#9132... Hardness=11 Tds=10 Conveyer= Rust repel needs to be ran down before re filling. Presoak 1 and 2 have several clogged nozzles. CTA 1 Has no suction at injector. The omni rinse sprayers have 1 clogged nozzle on driver, passenger, and top sides. presoak 1, presoak 2, lava, sealer, x55, rust repel adjusted. informed manager. 2 dryers are broken and turned off.'),
  ('a744234c-681f-4586-b9d7-f09878575f94', 'williamsville', DATE '2026-01-20', 'Austin', 'delivery 1/21/26 invoice 9012... Wash was down at time of visit... rtc controller is not functioning. '),
  ('5a1fb079-f259-4981-a767-4d1b97d39727', 'williamsville', DATE '2026-02-18', 'Austin', '2/20/26 invoice 9098... hardness=5 tds= 13 conveyer=135 Converted 431 to flash wax. converted 500 to hws. installed new versa dial on CTA. Wax bar has multiple leaks... omni sprayers on top, and sides are clogged... ceramic punch was left on for a time when the controller was replaced... reservoir was depleated adjusted the 3x foams, lo phoam, rust, and hot wax. attempted to clean but ultimatly changed the versa dial filters on cta 1, red, gold, blue, and lo phoam lava. Changed tips on lava.'),
  ('66f097ad-c759-48c4-9fc1-7bc6fd1fa0dc', 'williamsville', DATE '2026-03-20', 'Austin', '...3/19/26 Invoice#9151....Delivery SB 03/10/26 Invoice #9131... hardness=19 tds= 9 conveyer=135... omni sprayers on top, and sides are clogged... ceramic punch was left on for a time when the controller was replaced... reservoir was depleated adjusted the lo phoam, rust, and hot wax. fixed the lo phoam lava by adjusting the air..  Graphene numbers are off.. adjusted rust repel... will be back to adjust farther'),
  ('c0a5f2d6-4908-4e0b-bfb5-e8b80c127214', 'williamsville', DATE '2026-04-17', 'Austin', 'Delivery 04/20/26 Invoice #9206... hardness=22 tds=11 conveyer=135... There is a problem with the water hardness informed manager to put in a maintence order... omni sprayers on top, and sides are clogged.... completely filtered and cleaned the rust repel reservior and lines.... the hot wax bar with flash wax needs to be cleaned, there is not much hot wax landing on the vehicle, Adjusted flash wax down...'),
  ('e635703d-d890-4d94-ab0a-431e22ad3062', 'williamsville', DATE '2026-05-13', 'Nate', 'Delivery 5/11/26 #9254. water-hard=9 tds=40 High tested inbay and tank Vinnie maintX and contacted Scott....raised main air psi to 80psi the miners was at only 40psi which is to low to supply functions especially when multiple functions were on at one time...Delivery SB 05/14/26 Invoice #9264'),
  ('55a380dd-7259-4a3a-a4a6-9069f023f6f0', 'williamsville', DATE '2026-06-16', 'Austin', 'Delivery SB 06/08/26 Invoice #9321... ...Delivery SB 05/14/26 Invoice #9264... Delivery 5/11/26 #9254... Delivery 6/18/26 Invoice#9351... water-hard=18 tds=8 High tested inbay and tank Vinnie maintX and contacted Scott....raised main air psi to 80psi the miners was at only 40psi which is to low to supply functions especially when multiple functions were on at one time... A Water main leak caused 3 chemicals to overflow, ceramic punch, graphene, and infusions fresh... adjusted the diluted chemicals and will run down the reservoirs... Presoak 1 is clogged and causing water backpressure, causing no suction at injector...'),
  ('2e81e1ed-69f1-455a-beca-ffdf27f45eeb', 'williamsville', DATE '2026-07-16', 'Austin', 'Delivery 7/21/26 invoice#9409... water-hard=9 tds=11 A Water main leak caused 3 chemicals to overflow several weeks ago,  ceramic punch, graphene, and infusions fresh... adjusted the diluted chemicals and will run down the reservoirs before adding more chemical... Presoak 1 foamer is clogged and causing water backpressure, causing little to no suction at injector... performance high & infusions usage is very low.  7/16--presoak hws had a glitch in the system, the inventory from last month was not rolled over after submittion... usage numbers are off this month but the usage is good... Graphene usage was off, the dosatron would not shut off when i tried to get a usage, it needs to be looked at by a mechanic. adjusted the 3x foams down, they were way to high- now 2-3mls... adjusted flash wax down, now 7mls... Viper usage is low, could not find any leaks, but there was a kink in the chemical lines, and the computer will not stay on in order to make adjustments... Drivers side Cta foamer is visably clogged and not running, foamer needs to be cleaned.... someone mistook the flash wax versa dial for the infusions versa dial and the flash wax was turned up too high, usage was high, i adjusted it to 7mls per car'),
  ('aed1e3a1-df8d-4e18-88d4-693c18e378f2', 'leray', DATE '2025-07-23', 'nh', 'first submission'),
  ('8478b0a8-3044-4fae-8127-69c5c0e5ee93', 'leray', DATE '2025-08-19', 'SB', 'Delivery SB 08/19/28 Invoice #8911   Site visit SB 08/19/25 Hardness=1  TDS=6  Conveyor=155. Rocker Blasters are out of timing not coming on till after car has past. Janice is aware of the issue. Everything else looks good.'),
  ('f736e96e-165d-4b77-92a6-40d94d614244', 'leray', DATE '2025-09-22', 'SB', 'Delivery SB 08/20/25 Invoice #8915.. Delivery SB 09/22/25 Invoice #8976.. TDS=11  Conveyor=154.. Red usage was down. Someone had turned the dail down to 9. Should be at 16..Water is leaking out of the water supply line to the petit.  Delivery SB 09/23/25 Invoice #8981'),
  ('1aaa2521-efb2-43ed-ab05-7ebe209135d3', 'leray', DATE '2025-10-20', 'SB', 'Site visit: Hardness=1  TDS=12  Conveyor=153.. Water lily''s foot valve was pulled up out if the product, not sure for how long, so usage was down. Triple foamers were changed recently and looked a thick out in the tunnel. I checked the mls per car and they seemed to be right on. Everything else looked good.'),
  ('b626892c-7a38-4242-a3a1-9af542a62041', 'leray', DATE '2025-11-25', 'SB', 'Site visit: Hardness=1  TDS=12  Conveyor=153.. Water lily''s foot valve was pulled up out if the product, not sure for how long, so usage was down. Triple foamers were changed recently and looked a thick out in the tunnel. I checked the mls per car and they seemed to be right on. Everything else looked good.'),
  ('a791f1aa-78fd-41e1-8191-c7871cb72af6', 'leray', DATE '2025-12-17', 'SB', 'Site visit: Hardness=9 TDS=10 Conveyor=170...cleaned filters, per high, both Lo phoams, red & gold. Changed dial settings: Per high=21 usage 8-9 ml,  Red=18 usage 3, Wax=7 usage 6. Rain bars need to be cleaned. PS tire shine brush does not come out to the tire. Last top ps dryer out. Site was very busy and the cars look good.'),
  ('6603444b-69eb-4033-aa5a-1fd7c482d409', 'leray', DATE '2026-01-22', 'SB', 'Delivery 1/6/26 Invoive# 9178....Delivery 1/22/26 SB Invoice 9016'),
  ('958ac816-1b69-41bd-9341-b6382a8208c0', 'leray', DATE '2026-02-17', 'SB', 'Delivery SB 02/09/26 Invoice #9052..Site Visit: Hardness=1  TDS=15  Conveyor=190...Delivery SB 02/18/26 Invoice #9083'),
  ('07a2e912-4849-4342-9fca-abf7b88a7d7b', 'leray', DATE '2026-03-19', 'SB', 'Site Visit: Hardness=0  TDS=06  Conveyor=200...Cleaned tips: Both Lo pHoam, Red, HWS. The top of petit is spraying out only in the middle. Passenger side tire gloss brush does not come out to meet the tires. One nozzle on the last set of brushes needs to be replaced. I changed the tip from green to yellow in the bug remover. Catrs look good.  Delivery SB 03/20/26 Invoice #9147'),
  ('a733ec66-00a4-41e1-89a5-fdbed890aaac', 'leray', DATE '2026-04-16', 'SB', 'Site Visit: Hardness=0  TDS=13  Conveyor=202 Bug Remover=15...Delivery SB 04/02/26 Invoice #9193:    Cleaned versa dial filters: Performance high,Both Peak Lo, both Lo pHoam''s, HWS. Turned gold dial from 13 to 14. I can force on the cta1 and cta2, but does not come on during any washes. Delivery SB 04/20/26 Invoice #9196'),
  ('294af904-0920-4970-90c9-02e2a5c8550d', 'leray', DATE '2026-05-21', 'SB', 'Delivery SB 05/06/26 Invoice #9243... Site Visit: Hardness=0  TDS=6  Conveyor=202 Bug Remover=15..Cleaned filters: Protect, Peak Lo, HWS. This site is giving away free (Rust, Ceramic and Graphine) with every signup . Janice was able to fix the cta problem from last visit. There is a leak in the drying agent arch that Janice was going to fix. The 701''s were not wrapping around the back of cars. I did a mill check on Protect and it was using 6-7 mills. Cars look good. Deivery SB 5/21/26 Invoice #9281.   '),
  ('d79663af-2e8d-4473-8bc1-7c5159ded076', 'leray', DATE '2026-06-17', 'SB', 'Delivery SB 05/06/26 Invoice #9243... Site Visit: Hardness=0  TDS=3  Conveyor=188 Bug Remover=15..Cleaned filters:  HWS, both Lo pHoams and wax. The 701''s were not wrapping around the back of cars, there is already a work order for this. A couple nozzles leaking and city rinse rain bar should be cleaned. Janice said they will get done. Site looks good and cars look good as well. Delivery SB 06/18/26 Invoice #9347'),
  ('6180e103-6871-49dd-a7f2-45426286e2fc', 'leray', DATE '2026-07-17', 'SB', ' Site Visit: Hardness=0  TDS=3  Conveyor=185 Bug Remover=15..Cleaned filters:    Site looks good and cars look good as well...Delivery SB 07/20/26 Invoice #9393'),
  ('7ff6cb1a-cc0f-4375-9b55-edf17fbc58ea', 'oswego', DATE '2025-07-23', 'NH', 'First entry'),
  ('9328aaee-91b6-476a-b9c0-84e406e7ecaa', 'oswego', DATE '2025-08-25', 'SB', 'Delivery SB 08/08/25 Invoice #8836...Delivery SB 08/25/25  Invoice #8927...Driver side Wheel brush is not extending out to reach the tires. A couple of brush H2O nozzels are broke.Timing may be off a little. Functions seem to be coming on a little late on some functions.'),
  ('9ab932b7-9a72-4477-a636-016a018b3f3f', 'oswego', DATE '2025-09-22', 'SB', 'Delivery SB 08/25/25 Invoice #8931  Site visit:  TDS=7  Conveyor=147  Converted 313 over to Gold. Delivery SB 09/23/25 Invoice 8979 '),
  ('48b0bac3-2586-409f-b647-ef46b49555cd', 'oswego', DATE '2025-10-21', 'SB', 'Site visit: Hardness=0  TDS=10  Conveyor=147...Converted 312 over to sensation red. Driver side wheel brush is not coming ouit to meet the wheel. Tire shine, HWS and peak lo reservoirs were empty and sucking air (not sure for how long)  so numbers are going to be low. I blew out the versa dials on the triple foams, Lo phoam and X55, they seemed to be working a little slow.'),
  ('d65745bd-933e-4518-86de-f6e0a2adf843', 'oswego', DATE '2025-11-25', 'sb', 'Site visit: Hardness=0  TDS=10  Conveyor=147...Converted 312 over to sensation red. Driver side wheel brush is not coming ouit to meet the wheel. Tire shine, HWS and peak lo reservoirs were empty and sucking air (not sure for how long)  so numbers are going to be low. I blew out the versa dials on the triple foams, Lo phoam and X55, they seemed to be working a little slow.   Delivery SB 11/10/25 Invoice #9073'),
  ('fc59ab08-0712-4e00-b7ef-c619b1e77fe8', 'oswego', DATE '2025-12-17', 'SB', 'Site visit: Hardness=0 TDS=16 Conveyor=143..Someone hooked up the Graghine before it was fixed from last visit so it''s coming on every time the under spray goes on. Not sure if it was done for a spefcific reason so I''m leaving it hooked up with an empty reservoir...Delivery SB 12/18/25 Invoice #9141'),
  ('bcd10a50-c443-4a5b-8f56-7f4a8d5919c9', 'oswego', DATE '2026-01-23', 'SB', 'Delivery 1/15/26 invoice#9008 Site visit: Hardness=0  TDS=9 Conveyor=163 Delivery SB 01/23/25 Invoice #9023'),
  ('8f8f71c5-3227-4728-b0d3-f9c185b86047', 'oswego', DATE '2026-02-18', 'SB', ' Site visit: Hardness=0  TDS=15 Conveyor=163...Delivery SB 02/09/26 Invoice #9054...Performance high has no suction at the injector. Cleaned filters on Per hi, Peak Lo, both Lo Phoam, HWS,X55, Rust repel and Scent. A few nozzels are leaking through-out the tunnel..Delivery SB 02/18/26 Invoice #9085.'),
  ('5908aa9c-3ce6-4ab1-8ae3-f9036ab4143d', 'oswego', DATE '2026-03-18', 'SB', ' Site visit: Hardness=0  TDS=4  Conveyor=163...Cleaned tips: All colors, Lo pHoam, HWS, X55, Rust repel. Graphene foot valve was off the poly, so I replaced. A couple brush lube nozzels are broke but everything else looks pretty good out in the tunnel. Cars look good.  Delivery 03/20/26 Invoice #9146'),
  ('0ef3e82d-969e-45d4-a2dd-1184db5a8fee', 'oswego', DATE '2026-04-20', 'SB', ' Delivery SB 04/02/26 Invoice #9191...Site visit: Hardness=0  TDS=6  Conveyor=164...Cleaned tips: Performance high, Lo phoam, Red. Tip was broken off inside the 90 so I removed the tip and replaced with a yellow tip. Dumped around 3 gal. of bad rust repel and washed down the reservoir. Then replaced with new product. The foamer scrunchies are in need of cleaning and Bobbie Jo has it on her list. Everything else in the tunnel looks good and cars look good. Delivery SB 04/21/26 Invoice #9208.  '),
  ('ff83539b-4e13-414f-846e-d7c6da6ec91a', 'oswego', DATE '2026-05-20', 'SB', 'Delivery SB 05/05/26 Invoice #9241...Site visit: Hardness=0  TDS=3/6  Conveyor=164...Cleaned tips: Red and Lo pHoam. Ceramic inventory and res numbers are correct last visit and this one, so I''m not sure why it''s showing a negative. Tried to force it on but no chemical is going out to the tunnel. Going through a ton of tire shine the last few weeks. There is a leak on driver side. Management is aware and have already put in a Maintance X request. Everything else looks pretty good...Delivery SB 05/20/26 Invoice #9274'),
  ('c010ed56-be34-4b88-b0f9-2714daa53e35', 'oswego', DATE '2026-06-16', 'SB', 'Delivery SB 06/11/26 Invoice #9329...Site visit: Hardness=0  TDS=3/6  Conveyor=164...Cleaned tips: Delivery SB 06/17/26 Invoice #9346 '),
  ('0d19cc0b-b8b1-4596-b545-37595293d171', 'oswego', DATE '2026-07-17', 'SB', 'Site visit: Hardness=0  TDS=3/6  Conveyor=164...Changed the tip from yellow to green on the bug remover. Changed both foot valves and one versa dial on the peak low. Still not getting the usage out of the wrap 2. There is suction at the injectors so maybe the scrunchies need to be cleaned. Car wash was extremely busy at the time. Rust repel seems to have separated in the reservoir but the injectopr is not leaking back. I''ll keep an eye on it. . 1st set of tire brushes on the driver side is not coming out to meet the wheel.  A couple of brush nozzels are leaking. Cars look good...Delivery SB 07/20/26 Invoice #9394'),
  ('224d33ad-0417-451a-95ad-24fc719468ba', 'watertown', DATE '2025-07-23', 'nh', 'first entry'),
  ('03f9d243-06c6-4735-adf2-dce48285ff9a', 'watertown', DATE '2025-08-19', 'SB', 'Delivery SB 08/19/25 Invoice 8910. Site visit 08/19/25  Hard=4  TDS=12  Conveyor  65/63 Turned down the X55 dial to 15 in bay 1. Converted 311,421.    Bay 2 X55 was only on the express so it was added to all of them. Turned the dial down to 14 because it was using 22 mls per car. Now its between 9-11, Christina will keep an eye on the cars to make sure there still looking good. CTA in bay 2 does not turn on.'),
  ('c2815c12-82bd-4122-8d96-c4d8f76f9de0', 'watertown', DATE '2025-09-22', 'SB', 'Delivery SB 08/20/25 Invoice 8916   Delivery SB 09/22/25 Invoice #8978..Bay 1--Flash wax has leaky injector. Foot valve went bad so reservoir got contaminated with water. I changed the foot valve, didn''t have the injector. Ran my truck through on a bubble bath and it didn''t seem to get dry. It''s using around 15 mls per car and only one dryer out.  Bay 2..1st CTA is not coming on during any washes. Christina was checking the wash packages. Driver''s side tire shine looks good. Passenger side does''nt seem to be putting any chemical on.   Delivery SB 09/23/25 Invoice #8980'),
  ('fd498682-7879-48d0-bea9-b42f53b10719', 'watertown', DATE '2025-10-20', 'SB', 'Site visit: Hardness=3  TDS=9  Conveyor=65/63  '),
  ('2fe7f7b9-f15f-487a-a453-98bc1f4a3a55', 'watertown', DATE '2025-11-25', 'SB', 'Site visit: Hardness=3  TDS=9  Conveyor=65/63  '),
  ('ccc425b8-25dd-4d62-9785-1b20ccebd6f1', 'watertown', DATE '2025-12-17', 'SB', 'Site visit: Hardness=6 TDS=65 Conveyor=65/63...Delivery SB 12/18/25 Invoice #9140 '),
  ('884d7eb0-406b-446d-8bbf-edbb9b822311', 'watertown', DATE '2026-01-22', 'SB', 'Delivery 1/6/26 Invoice# 9177... Delivery SB 1/22/26 Invoice #9017'),
  ('2c7bc0cc-526b-4064-bf5c-442f069a1438', 'watertown', DATE '2026-02-17', 'SB', 'Delivery SB 02/09/26 Invoice #9054.. Site visit: Hardness=2  TDS=     Conveyor=65/64...    '),
  ('0dd9bfe2-5962-4844-8a7e-61ecab22a9c4', 'watertown', DATE '2026-03-19', 'SB', ' Site visit: Hardness=4  TDS= 40   Conveyor=64/64.. Bay 1: Changed the versa dial on the HWS. When forced on it works in the tunnel but does not come on when a car goes through on any package. Christina had to shut the bay down while I was here due to the side brush would not retract. Bay 2: PS CTA is not working. Bad leak in the water supply line the the spot free rinse.  Delivery SB 03/20/26 Invoice #9148.'),
  ('9c3bbc93-279f-4094-8641-8c10f84dfbab', 'watertown', DATE '2026-04-16', 'SB', 'Delivery SB 04/02/26 Invoice #9192 Site visit: Hardness=4  TDS= 40   Conveyor=64/64.. Bay 1: Same issues as last visit. cta1 not working in the packages. Bay 2 was down time of visit. I found a case of ceramic punch in the office being used as a desk which was not in the last inventory count.  Delivery SB 04/20/26 Invoice #9205 '),
  ('8d0b12d9-9220-4cb7-8db8-d6600cbbdd45', 'watertown', DATE '2026-05-21', 'SB', 'Delivery SB 05/06/26 Invoice #9242 Site visit: Hardness=3  TDS= 23   Conveyor=64/64.. Bay 1: Same issues as last visit. cta1 not working in the packages. There is a leak in the pre-soak arch. Bay 2: There is a leak in the main water line going the spot free arch. Cars look good.  Delivery SB 05/21/26 Invoice #9280 '),
  ('e89bf615-b067-41ea-b006-d77fccdcce57', 'watertown', DATE '2026-06-17', 'SB', 'Delivery AA 06/11/26 Invoice #9328 Site visit: Hardness=2  TDS=16   Conveyor=65/64 Cleaned filters: Per Hi and HWS.   Other than a couple of nozzles leaking everything in the tunnels looks good. Delivery SB 06/18/26 Invoice #9348'),
  ('90a61c66-570f-4eed-b64f-a7fa27a540ff', 'watertown', DATE '2026-07-17', 'SB', ' Site visit: Hardness=2  TDS=14  Conveyor=64/64 Cleaned filters:  Per hi and X55. I Converted over th 461 to ceramic X, using copper tip and getting 9mls per car....Delivery SB 7/20/26 Invoice #9395.'),
  ('1ad586b3-8bbb-4747-8044-1b2ddaf15bfa', 'brockport', DATE '2025-06-30', 'nh', 'first entry'),
  ('221b8110-9934-492d-8ca7-e0c2f64e72bc', 'brockport', DATE '2025-08-26', 'Austin', 'Delivery 8/28/25 Invoice 8949... 427 Leaking back on Both bays.... Car counts will start at 1 Beacause the computer keeps track of the counts as a Grand total. car counts will be accurate once we have information from this month.'),
  ('af29453c-869b-4431-a543-63b4a4a53242', 'brockport', DATE '2025-09-30', 'Austin', 'There are 4 or more gallons of 224 and 4 or more gallons of 235 that were previously uncounted... unsure where they came from, they are new, clean bottles, and they were in the wheelbarrow in the mechanical room. they were not there last month. the 427 is leaking back on both bays. '),
  ('196861a4-afcf-4aed-8ba9-f1e60d161ee5', 'brockport', DATE '2025-10-23', 'Austin', 'Site is setup for conversion on 10/8/25. Reservoirs are set up and lines are ran and ready... waiting on old chemical to run out... bay 1 and bay 2 were closed at the time of visit. numbers are not accurate... 427 reservoir was filled with water so it was changed at the time of conversion...'),
  ('cf707c28-60e0-4fd2-b066-36efd8e156da', 'brockport', DATE '2025-11-22', 'Austin', 'Delivery 10/28/25 Invoice#9061... Switched over the self serve to No-Freeze'),
  ('c78fbf10-5173-48cf-8920-55aea6751ec3', 'brockport', DATE '2025-12-17', 'Austin', 'Hardness=3 tds=153... Tandem and Laser 1 were down at time of visit. it appears the counter was reset for bay 1, the counts were 0, chuck was on site to confirm that the counters were recently reset. counts will be off... inventory numbers are off... We orginized the inventory and better seperated the self serve and tunnel inventory. next month will be more accurate...'),
  ('b8dc95ae-246b-4981-89fa-4c463bfae70b', 'brockport', DATE '2026-01-22', 'Austin', 'delivery 1/12/26 invoice 9187... Hardness=3 tds=153... Tandem and Laser 1 were down at time of visit. it appears the counter was reset for bay 1, the counts were 0, chuck was on site to confirm that the counters were recently reset. counts will be off... inventory numbers are off... We orginized the inventory and better seperated the self serve and tunnel inventory. next month will be more accurate... converted 205 to peak lo... bay one has no suction  on the injectors for red and blue 3x foam...'),
  ('2d16993b-8088-4cd5-bef1-db06efc80adb', 'brockport', DATE '2026-02-24', 'Austin ', 'delivery 2/24/26 invoice#9102.... several gallons of 235 were dumped into the 205 reservoir before we converted it to peak lo. The roadside bay was down at time of visit. The middle bay has a big leak on a high pressure hose, there is very little pressure in the bay for any functions.'),
  ('0c1d2c68-c39b-4a1b-a386-4ec9f8c50890', 'brockport', DATE '2026-03-24', 'Austin ', 'delivery 2/24/26 invoice#9102.... delivery 3/20/26 invoice#9152... several gallons of 235 were dumped into the 205 reservoir before we converted it to peak lo. The roadside bay was down at time of visit. The middle bay, there is very little soap making it onto the cars.'),
