  ('ad3428ea-dc19-4601-83d1-fa7027840cc4', 'brockport', DATE '2026-05-13', 'SB', 'HARDNESS=0 TDS=153... I was unable to get any car counts on any bays. Bay 1 and 2 shut down. Delivery SB 05/14/26 Invoice #9262'),
