  ('1e258852-31c7-4a84-aa93-80bc942689a0', 'brockport_ii', DATE '2025-11-25', 'Austin', 'Delivery 11/14/15 invoice#9078 delivery 11/25/25 invoice#9100...The divers side K sticks for ceramic had come loose and the k stick was freely blowing around, causing the lines at the top to break. . Secured it with a zip tie for now. rust repel and flash wax need to be ran down before refilling.'),
