  ('b7df2392-5d06-4be8-a327-6db79956985e', 'brockport_ii', DATE '2026-02-23', 'Austin', ' Delivery 2/11/26 invoice#9064...hardess=1 tds=5 conveyer=137 rust repel and needs to be ran down before refilling. Little to no suction on injector for x55... 1 blower dryer is not working. drivers side top... manager informed cleaned versa dial filters for peak lo, performance high, lo phoam, x55 and rust. pre soak 1 and lava are very watery....Delivery SB 02/24/26 Invoice #9103'),
  ('3429994a-937b-4fa1-870d-070d20a81408', 'brockport_ii', DATE '2026-03-24', 'Austin', '.hardess=2 tds=5 conveyer=130 No suction on injector for Pre soak 1 performance high, infusions. Little to no suction on injector for x55... cleaned versa dial filters for, performance high, x55...Delivery SB 02/24/26 Invoice #9103... Delivery 3/25/26 Invoice#9174 SB                                                                                                                                                                        '),
  ('a9547e81-0c5f-44c6-b6e8-3b505f5ddfd1', 'brockport_ii', DATE '2026-04-23', 'Austin', 'Delivery 4/23/26 Invoice#9223....hardess=2 tds=5 conveyer=131 No suction on injector for Pre soak 1 performance high, infusions there is a leak in the foamer and the nozzles are clogged... cleaned versa dial filters for, performance high, x55...rust repel and sensations gold had a mix up this month and were dumped, usages will be off... adjusted flash wax, the flash wax bar takes more product for a good show, manager will try to clean out the bar this month and see if it helps.                                                                    '),
