  ('401fe641-c2d4-42b0-aa01-8aba4ab79e15', 'brockport_ii', DATE '2026-07-23', 'AA', ' .hardess=9 tds=9 conveyer=132.... Softener was not regenertating for some reason, chuck restarted it, manager will keep an eyer on it in case there is a problem...  adjusted perf hi, lo phoam, peak low, 3x foams, x55, flash wax... Adjusted flash wax, dial was on 25, it should be on 4. There is a crack in the drivers side k stick for the ceramic, directly above the bottom nozzle.... the final rinse and spot free functions are reversed and the final rinse function is not working, chuck was on site, the pump starter and membrane for the final rinse system is bad. there is a dryer out drivers side top. there is a plugged nozzle on the performance high. plugged nozzle on drivers side top peddit... brought 12.5 gallons of performance hi, 2.5 gallons of peak lo and 2.5 gallons of red from brockport laser....Delivery SB 07/25/26 Invoice #9422'),
