  ('fd84653d-5583-4548-98a6-ca6527ad6518', 'cicero', DATE '2026-01-27', 'SB', 'Delivery 1/16/26 invoice#9010. Site visit: Hardness=   TDS=6  Conveyor=151.. Cleaned the following filters: Peak High, Peak Lo, HWS, Lo Phoams, Blue, Gold and Protect. Red injector is leaking bad. Foot valve is still holding but it has been leaking for a few months now. Two dryers (top driver side) out.  Delivery SB 04/28/26 Invoice #9033'),
  ('5c7e7c95-069a-4c8b-8a4b-776fb223872d', 'cicero', DATE '2026-02-19', 'SB', ' Site visit: Hardness=0   TDS=4  Conveyor=151.. Cleaned the following filters: Peak Lo Red injector is leaking bad. Foot valve is still holding but it has been leaking for a few months now. Two dryers (top driver side) out. Besides the dryers, everything in the tunnel looks good. Cars look really good.   Delivery SB 02/20/26 Invoice #9087.'),
  ('95a230e5-eb25-4a3d-8589-6b5834ea6a98', 'cicero', DATE '2026-03-23', 'SB', ' Site visit: Hardness=0   TDS=5  Conveyor=146.. Cleaned the following filters: Blue, Red, HWS. Red injector is leaking bad. Foot valve is still holding but it has been leaking for a few months now, John is putting in a maintain X request.. Two dryers (top driver side) out, John was working on it when I left. Besides the dryers, everything in the tunnel looks good. Cars look really good. Delivery SB 03/23/26 Invoice #9155'),
  ('deed187e-7f3b-4d79-be09-e0a9d5774840', 'cicero', DATE '2026-04-21', 'SB', ' Site visit: Hardness=0   TDS=5  Conveyor=152.. Cleaned the following filters: Blue, HWS, both lo phoam''s. Lava injector is starting to leak back.  1 dryer still out. John says it''s been fixed 3 times. Couple of brush nozzel''s not spraying. Cars look good. Delivery SB 04/22/26 Invoice #9215'),
  ('0d70384d-3564-4e08-bdf3-6108d2e727bb', 'cicero', DATE '2026-05-26', 'SB', ' Site visit: Hardness=0   TDS=10  Conveyor=152.. Cleaned the following filters: Blue, HWS, both lo phoam''s. Everything in the tunnel seems to be working well.  Cars look good. Delivery SB 05/26/26 Invoice #9293'),
  ('88dd84c2-e0a1-4939-8d92-eced05ffbdd0', 'cicero', DATE '2026-06-18', 'SB', ' Site visit: Hardness=0   TDS=9  Conveyor=157.. Cleaned the following filters:both lo phoam''s. Everything in the tunnel is working except one of the brushes which Phill was working on. Cars look good. Delivery SB 06/19/26 Invoice #9357'),
  ('2f4c8238-688d-4ea1-b95c-509c4a96388e', 'cicero', DATE '2026-07-20', 'SB', ' Site visit: Hardness=0   TDS=10  Conveyor=152.. Cleaned the following filters:both lo phoam''s. The water pump to the first panel went down while I was there. I called Scott and John was going to put in a work order.  Delivery SB 07/21/26 Invoice #9408.'),
  ('25c6844f-0f23-4ef5-a97d-f2797c3fab24', 'clay', DATE '2025-07-25', 'nh', 'first entry'),
  ('e459d866-c92c-415b-9f00-a0761bf6dd84', 'clay', DATE '2025-08-26', 'SB', 'Delivery 8/8/25 invoice 8888 Delivery SB 08/15/25 Invoice #8905  Delivery SB 08/26/25 Invoice #8932'),
  ('44d365ae-a66d-4c31-8dc8-42416ec88ece', 'clay', DATE '2025-09-29', 'SB', 'Delivery SB 08/26/25 Invoice #8937 Site visit--Hardness=5  TDS=5  Conveyor=133.. '),
  ('05af9ffd-381a-4c8f-bcd9-08df918e65d6', 'clay', DATE '2025-10-22', 'SB', 'Site visit: Hardness=5  TDS=5  Conveyor=135...Cleaned versa dial filters on red, blue and Lo phoam. Red''s injector is leaking back, foot valve is holding for now. Flash wax was at setting 16 using 28mls. I turned the dial down to 4, now its using around 10mls. Tire shine is a little low but looks good as of right now, Adam said he''ll keep an eye on it. Everything else looks good.   Delivery SB 10/23/25  Invoice #9046'),
  ('baf7620e-b489-4437-95e5-586bd8190f8c', 'clay', DATE '2025-11-25', 'SB', 'Site visit: Hardness=1  TDS=5  Conveyor=137...Converted Waterlily over to infusion. Peak Lo is usage is high because the reservoir had to be dumped.  Delivery SB 11/26/25 Invoice #9107'),
  ('65e357d2-7a34-46d7-ab46-e737cd17ebeb', 'clay', DATE '2025-12-22', 'SB', 'Site visit: Hardness=0 TDS=4 Conveyor=134...Cleaned filter on 894 and set dial at 18, usage is at 10. Turned down setting down to 13, usage at 4. Cleaned HWS filter. Cleaned filters on all colors. changed foot valve on the red, all using around 3-4mls. X55 has no suction. Noah is aware.  Delivery SB Invoice #9151'),
  ('2d6ddf41-76ad-4bc7-ad9e-49bb5cfa17d8', 'clay', DATE '2026-01-28', 'SB', 'Delivery 1/16/26 invoice#9009..Site visit:  Hardness=   TDS=5 Conveyor=142...Water lily usage is high due to Site workers forcing the funtion on trying to get rid of the pit smell. Cleaned following filters: Performance High, Both Lo Phoam, HWS, X55, all colors. No suction on Performance High. Turned X55 dial to 17, using 8-9mls now.  Delivery SB 01/29/26 Invoice #9040'),
  ('08251479-1cc7-4ca7-b4a6-ab08c7030ea5', 'clay', DATE '2026-02-20', 'SB', '..Site visit:  Hardness=0   TDS=6 Conveyor=168.. The water lily was forced on to combat the pit smell. I''m not sure how much was used. Reservoir is empty. Cleaned following filters: Performance high, both Lo phoams. Changed foot valve on eyesite Lo phoam. Delivery SB 02/20/26 Invoice #9099'),
  ('a4a95ad3-0fba-47cb-a9ab-52fa14e624ee', 'clay', DATE '2026-03-23', 'SB', '..Site visit:  Hardness=0   TDS=6 Conveyor=163.. The water lily was forced on to combat the pit smell again. I''m not sure how much was used. Tire shine usage is very low. Cleaned performance hi filter. Delivery SB 03/23/26 Invoice #9154. '),
  ('a90dc92f-154b-4611-a45b-95171699c510', 'clay', DATE '2026-04-21', 'SB', 'Delivery SB 04/02/26 Invoice 9190..Site visit:  Hardness=5   TDS=6  Conveyor=134  Bug Remover=13..Cleaned versa dial filters: Performance High, Both Lo pHoams, HWS, All colors. Changed tip on bug remover from green to blue. There is a bracket that came loose on the wall overtop of a few reservoirs. When that pipe is on it sprays the reservoirs with debri that makes its way into them. Everything in the tunnel looks good. Cars look good. Delivery SB 04/22/26 Invoice #9216'),
  ('e4fd6fee-819e-4a0e-96df-15572cbdaf3c', 'clay', DATE '2026-05-26', 'SB', '..Site visit:  Hardness=6   TDS=3  Conveyor=131  Bug Remover=11..Cleaned versa dial filters: Performance High, Both Lo pHoams, HWS, scent.There is a bracket that came loose on the wall overtop of a few reservoirs. When that pipe is on it sprays the reservoirs with debri that makes its way into them. That pipe has sprung a leak which fiiled the reservoir with water and debri. I had to dump the wax reservoir so inventory will be off this month. Changed X55 dial down to 19 from 22. Now it''s using around 10 mls per car. I changed the scent dial from 2 to 5. Now it''s using around 4mls per car.  The hardness has gone up to 6 drops from 5 last visit, managment is looking into it. Everything in the tunnel looks good. Cars look good but still look a little wet. Maybe due to the hard water...Delivery SB 05/26/26 Invoice #9292'),
  ('b61b0773-e39a-4de8-ba8c-efc2f45d94d6', 'clay', DATE '2026-06-22', 'SB', '..Site visit:  Hardness=6   TDS=6  Conveyor=162  Bug Remover=10..Cleaned versa dial filters: Both Lo pHoams, scent. Both Lo pHoams and the scent injectors are not pulling product. The tunnel looks good. It was raining the day of visit so I was unable to see any cars go through. Delivery SB 06/23/26 Invoice #9363'),
  ('f9481256-15d1-4584-8012-6f9200c4ad96', 'clay', DATE '2026-07-21', 'SB', 'Site visit:  Hardness=6   TDS=6  Conveyor=162  Bug Remover=11..Cleaned versa dial filters: Gold. Tire shine doesn''t seem to be coming out on the passenger side. Usage is low. Tunnel and cars look good. Delivery SB 07/22/26 Invoice #9412.'),
