  ('0b2b5b2e-b87d-473e-8827-5ec037614f0b', 'fayetteville', DATE '2025-10-23', 'SB', 'Delivery SB 10/18/25 Invoice #9030...Site visit: Hardness=0  TDS=6  Conveyor=127...Cleaned HWS Lo phoam versa dial''s. Tunnel and cars look good '),
