  ('0f218a8b-10fd-4d3c-bba2-6bb587e0eb52', 'fayetteville', DATE '2025-12-22', 'SB', 'Site visit: Hardness=0 TDS=3 Conveyor=133...Cleaned filter on the performance high and set dial at 20, usage is at 7-8mls and looks good in the tunnel. Cleaned both Lo phoam filters, both dials are set at 20. Cleaned HWS filter and set dial at 13, usage at 8mls. Cleand both red and blue filters and had to change the blue foot valve, usage is at 3.5. Clened filter on the rust repel and set dial at 2, usage at 1. Viper usage is down due to driver side brush not working. A couple of water nozzels not working but everything else look pretty good. Cars look good.  Delivery SB 12/23/25 Invoice #9152'),
  ('e4dd0fe8-3145-410c-91f9-dd3fa35b3515', 'fayetteville', DATE '2026-01-27', 'SB', 'Site visit: Hardness=0 TDS=6 Conveyor=170...Numbers are low due to site was shut down for a month. Wax manifold is leaking water into color reservoirs below. They still look good in the tunnel. Cleaned the following filters: Performance High, Low Phoam, HWS, All colors and Protect.  Delivery SB 01/28/26 Invoice #9032'),
  ('e3c4d83d-a0f7-4180-bcb1-fd4311b8a66a', 'fayetteville', DATE '2026-02-19', 'SB', 'Site visit: Hardness=0 TDS=6 Conveyor=160...Numbers are low due to site was shut down for a month. Wax manifold is still leaking water onto color reservoirs below. Around a gallon of Lo PHoam was poured into the Performance High Ph reservoir with around 10 gallons. It had to be dumped into the pit so those numbers will be off this month. Tire shine drum is empty but not sure for how long so numbers might be low because of that also the motor has been down for a few days. Cleaned the following filters: HWS, all the colors and wax.. Overall the tunnel and cars look good.  Delivery SB 02/13/26 Invoice #9074..Delivery SB 02/20/26 Invoice #9086.'),
  ('021ab767-9a57-4ce9-9230-a02e2aa1514a', 'fayetteville', DATE '2026-03-23', 'SB', 'Site visit: Hardness=0   TDS=6   Conveyor=152  ...Delivery SB 03/06/26 Invoice #9130.. Cleaned tips: HWS, Per Hi, Lo pHoam. Did mil checks on: Per hi, HWS, all colors, flash wax, X55, protect and infusion. Changed dial settings: HWS=20, Wax=9, Protect=17, X55=21. Tunnel looks good. Second cta can be forced on but is not coming on during wash because os possible programming issue. Tire shine usage is very low. Riley is aware and looking into it. Cars look good.  Delivery SB 03/23/26 Invoice #9156.'),
  ('a3082220-c98e-4bc7-9cd9-c752bd1aa9a6', 'fayetteville', DATE '2026-04-22', 'SB', 'Delivery SB 04/02/26 Invoice 9189...Site visit: Hardness=0   TDS=4   Conveyor=148  ...Cleaned filters: Performance High, both Lo pHoams. Changed tip on bug remover from white to blue. Changed Performance high dial size from 21 to 23. Driver side tire gloss brush not working. Both tunnel and cars looks great.  Delivery SB 04/22/26 Invoice #9219'),
  ('852303e8-428f-4619-b118-71d860141062', 'fayetteville', DATE '2026-05-22', 'SB', 'Site visit: Hardness=0   TDS=4   Conveyor=150  ...Cleaned filters: Delivery SB 05/22/26 Invoice #9284'),
  ('f737f284-eb32-4f6c-bc9d-91621f7381c3', 'fayetteville', DATE '2026-06-18', 'SB', 'Delivery SB 06/13/26 Invoice #9313...Site visit: Hardness=0   TDS=5   Conveyor=151  ...Cleaned filters:HWS. There was a few dryer''s down. Riely took care of them. The is a work order in for the shaft on driver side tire shine brush. Everything looks great here. Delivery SB 06/19/26 Invoice #9358.'),
  ('f72f43f1-760f-432a-a008-fa987d6d68ec', 'fayetteville', DATE '2026-07-20', 'SB', 'Site visit: Hardness=0   TDS=6   Conveyor=138  ...Cleaned filters. First set of wheel scrubers, driver side brush is not working. The is a work order in for the shaft on driver side tire shine brush because it broke again. Converted over to the ceramic X. Dial set at 21 using 9 mls per car. Everything looks great here. Delivery SB 07/21/26 Invoice #9403.'),
