  ('ad295122-394c-4d0d-8b83-4b6cf7d8ce2a', 'liverpool', DATE '2025-09-29', 'Austin', 'Delivery SB 08/27/25 Invoice #8940...   540 injector was clogged. changed injector in pre soak 1. dual injector for scent and lo phoam was clogged. tunnel inventrory keeps being used for the in bay. we created a space to seperate and organize the chemical and labeled everything, tunnel or in- bay. usages will be off this month. Delivery SB 09/30/25  Invoice #9007'),
  ('ac1881f9-886b-4a39-b835-272a744fb415', 'liverpool', DATE '2025-10-22', 'SB', 'Site visit: Hardness=0  TDS=29  Conveyor=139...Cleaned tip on 540. Converted 205 to Perfomance High. Cleaned HWS versa dial filter. '),
  ('b86a0cac-0fcc-474a-9a77-36b941da4fec', 'liverpool', DATE '2025-11-25', 'SB', 'Site visit: Hardness=0  TDS=29  Conveyor=139...Usage numbers will be off because new manager cleaned and did''nt know that chemicals were seperated for tunnel and razor.  Delivery SB 11/26/25 Invoice #9108.'),
  ('16cb7f5a-2e33-4483-bd4f-53bc2a0c6832', 'liverpool', DATE '2025-12-29', 'SB', 'Site visit: Hardness=0 TDS=27 Conveyor=142...Both the ceramic and the blue reservoirs are completely full of water. External leak has been fixed. Dumped water out of the ceramic reservoir down to good product. Looks ok out in the tunnel. Blue is still coming out with nice color so we''re going to leave it. Cleaned filter on the per high and check it, it''s using 8-10mls. Cleaned filters on the colors and they are using 3mls and look good.    Delivery SB 12/30/25 Invoice #9170'),
  ('e565d136-d5dd-4bae-98dd-17ed097bc74e', 'liverpool', DATE '2026-01-28', 'SB', 'Site visit: Hardness=   TDS=  Conveyor=142...Delivery SB 01/28/26 Invoice #9039'),
  ('cea4e457-1596-4c46-8b3a-b5fc3343d05f', 'liverpool', DATE '2026-02-25', 'SB', 'Site visit: Hardness= 0  TDS= 14 Conveyor=133..Cleaned filters on: Performance high, Lo pHoam, HWS, all the colors. No suction on the X55. Phil is here and is taking a look at it.  Delivery SB 02/25/26 Invoice #9108, '),
  ('d3c4b2b6-a9fa-498a-8c83-83aadd9d419d', 'liverpool', DATE '2026-03-24', 'SB', 'Site visit: Hardness= 0  TDS= 44 Conveyor=141..Cleaned filters on:  Lo pHoam. No suction on the rust/540. Adam is taking care of it. There is a leak in supply line on second rinse bar, Adam is aware of it. Everything else in tunnel looks good. Cars look good....Delivery SB 03/24/26 Invoice #9158.'),
  ('914e5b54-6859-4b7f-94f7-273b0bb0cb2f', 'liverpool', DATE '2026-04-22', 'SB', 'Site visit: Hardness= 0  TDS= 44 Conveyor=141..Cleaned filters on:  Lo pHoam.  There is a leak in supply line on second rinse bar, Adam is aware of it. Everything else in tunnel looks good. Cars look good...Delivery SB 04/22/26 Invoice #9221'),
  ('851170e0-22d5-43cf-91ee-531145821780', 'liverpool', DATE '2026-05-26', 'SB', 'Site visit: Hardness= 0  TDS= 5 Conveyor=141..Cleaned filters on:  Lo pHoam. Fayetteville took a case of X55 so there inventory will be over a case and the numbers for here will be off.  Everything in tunnel looks good. Cars look good...Delivery SB 05/26/26 Invoice #9291'),
  ('aa5ba3f9-1151-4027-bed3-ba93127e37fc', 'liverpool', DATE '2026-07-21', 'SB', 'Site visit: Hardness= 0  TDS= 5 Conveyor=140..Cleaned filters on: Red, Peak Lo and 540. Did ml checks on scent, protect, red and peak lo. 540 is turning on way before the cars get there then shuts off too early. Adam is aware and is fixing it. Other than a few plugged nozzels the tunnel and cars look good. Delivery SB 07/22/26 Invoice #9413'),
  ('00233fbf-ce1f-48e1-8863-5bece37e78de', 'auburn', DATE '2026-08-10', 'Austin', 'Delivery 6/30/26 Invoice# 9381... Delivery 7/27/26 Invoice# 9430...Delivery SB 08/03/26 Invoice #9427...Delivery SB 08/05/26 Invoice #9437...  TDS- 7 HARDNESS-1....  6/30/26 Converted the previous bug remover chemical to the sonnys bug remover, also converted the cta tire soap to NCS 500.... 7/27/26, converted the prep gun soap to NCS 222... 8/03/26, converted the presoak 1 and wrap foamers to NCS 205...  Converted tire shine to viper tire shine... The site still has a large inventory of the previos chemical... roughly 70gal of the previos wax, 47gal of hi ph detergent, 67 gallons of ceramic... we will be able to get an accurate usage and car count this coming month...'),
  ('a70624c7-0c30-4eac-a226-6fe54e2549df', 'canandaigua', DATE '2025-07-24', 'nh', null),
  ('4cb736ec-b23a-4d80-9fbe-0ffbefde8af7', 'canandaigua', DATE '2025-09-09', 'Nate', 'Delivery 9/9/25 Invoice#8963. Hardness=10 TDS=66 Car counts are 0 for now, due to only having crand total car wash counts available. Next months car counts will be accurate. Each Bay has its own reservoir and its own car counts. there are 5 bays and a self serve. We need a way to seperate and record this, to improve accuracy.'),
  ('479d3c71-7a44-4a3a-b2c2-0d98b9a50ece', 'canandaigua', DATE '2025-10-02', 'Shawn', 'Delivery SB 10/02/25 Invoice #9004'),
  ('73c85118-8729-4c9d-89d5-6bfaa8c76db6', 'canandaigua', DATE '2025-11-03', 'Austin', 'hardness=0 TDS=37Delivery 10/10/25 Invoice#9018...Delivery SB 10/30/25 Invoice #9065 ... Bay 3 3x Foam Blue no suction at injector. bead up is not drawing correctly. manager is already aware and working to solve the issue. Underbody is always either not turning on or only turning on for 2 seconds on both tandems. Delivery SB 11/03/25 Invoice #'),
  ('03be50cc-6720-441a-bbcc-39d97f8cef18', 'canandaigua', DATE '2025-12-05', 'SB', 'hardness=0 TDS=37: Bays 1 & 2 looks good. Bay 3 pre-soak looked a little week. Cleaned the tips and it looks good.'),
  ('f910fc02-94fa-4f03-ab0a-bbaf358e4e34', 'canandaigua', DATE '2026-01-03', 'Austin', 'delivery 12/23/25 invoice #9158.... delivery 1/2/26 invoice#9174...   Cleaned tips on bay 3 presoak 1 and 2, all triple foams... Bay 3 triple triple foams have no suction at injector... bay one no suction on injector for sensations blue... Manager is aware...'),
  ('ed9f47e7-b630-4a14-8eff-a12e5fae8667', 'canandaigua', DATE '2026-02-02', 'SB', 'Site visit: Hardness=  TDS=  ...Delivery SB 02/02/26 Invoice #9046.. Delivery SB 02/05/26 Invoice #9050'),
  ('dc589ceb-ec86-4111-98e7-d6adb4b4190f', 'canandaigua', DATE '2026-03-02', 'Austin Shawn', '.Delivery SB 02/23/26 Invoice #9100...Tandem 4: Tire sensors are off. They brush about a foot behind the wheels. Tandem 5: Driver side tire brush does not spin. No red ...Delivery SB 03/02/26 Invoice #9120.'),
  ('21e8220a-c8ea-46d9-97fe-0f8edd3d5fbb', 'canandaigua', DATE '2026-03-31', 'SB', 'delivery 3/19/26 invoice#9149... 3/4/26 invoice#9125... converted tandem chemicals to sonnys 3/4/26, 3/5/26, 3/8/26... Site visit: Hardness=1  TDS=8..   Bay 1: Side bars did not spray on soap 1 but did on soap 2. No red but I cleaned the tip and looks good now. Bay 2: All good. Bay 3: Both the triple foam and the wax didn''t start until almost the back tire. Everything looked good. Bay 4: Blue looks a little weak. There is a leak somewhere in the E-chain. Bay 5: Was down time of visit. I was unable to get the car counts for bay 5.  Delivery SB 03/31/26 Invoice #9185'),
  ('fa58d5a9-161c-4e4f-881b-5a04314115b2', 'canandaigua', DATE '2026-04-28', 'SB', 'delivery 3/19/26 invoice#9149... 3/4/26 invoice#9125... converted tandem chemicals to sonnys 3/4/26, 3/5/26, 3/8/26... Site visit: Hardness=0  TDS=5..   Bay 1: Side bars did not spray on soap 1 but did on soap 2. No red but I cleaned the tip and looks good now. Bay 2: All good. Bay 3: Both the triple foam and the wax didn''t start until almost the back tire. Everything looked good. Bay 4: Blue looks a little weak. There is a leak somewhere in the E-chain. Bay 5: Was down time of visit. I was unable to get the car counts for bay 5.  Delivery SB 03/31/26 Invoice #9185'),
  ('ee24c062-dd07-477c-80a5-36857abdc81e', 'canandaigua', DATE '2026-05-29', 'Shawn/Austin', ' Delivery SB Invoices: 9272, 9250, 9261...Hardness=6  TDS=27..   Bay 1: Side bars did not spray on soap 1 but did on soap 2. No red but I cleaned the tip and looks good now. Bay 2: All good. Bay 3: Both the triple foam and the wax didn''t start until almost the back tire. Everything looked good. Bay 4:Bead up sealer injector not drawing. Manager is aware.  SELF SERVE there is a leak in the line for the 222, and the spray nozzle is leaking, causing the function to costantly draw chemical...Delivery SB 05/29/26 Invoice #9300'),
  ('dcd900cb-b1e0-4d0f-8732-eb8e221696be', 'canandaigua', DATE '2026-06-26', 'Shawn/Austin', ' Delivery SB 06/24/26 Invoice 9322...Hardness=6  TDS=27..   Bay 1: all good... Bay 2: bay shuts down due to arm fault after flash wax function..... Bay 3: several water lines on the wall near the chain were leaking at the fitting, they were not seated properly, we pushed them into place. Everything else  looked good. Bay 4:Bead up sealer injector not drawing. Manager is aware.. Bay 5 Replaced foot valve for sensations blue... SELF SERVE there is a leak in the line for the 222, and the spray nozzle is leaking, causing the function to costantly draw chemical...Delivery SB 05/29/26 Invoice #9300'),
  ('31af09c5-f798-4d2b-b51a-294c2127104e', 'canandaigua', DATE '2026-07-27', 'SB', 'Delivery SB 06/24/26 Invoice 9322...Hardness=0 TDS=15.. Bay 1: Shut down time of visit. Bay 2: Everything looks good except no spot free rinse..... Bay 3  Looks goog.. Bay 4:Bead up sealer injector not drawing. Manager is aware.. Bay 5- I ran my truck through and the brush got stuck on my drop gate and wound not release. I drove out to let the functions go through and the bay went into maintanance mode and would not come out.  I went through the functions then tried to switch it to wash back and it says it does but screen still says bay is shut down....Delivery SB 07/27/26 Invoice #9428'),
  ('a0b7ea42-d24b-43f8-ad2b-df6f5d618739', 'fairport', DATE '2025-07-14', 'nh', null),
  ('3f455af1-268b-4bac-9a3f-901fb2b6ec02', 'fairport', DATE '2025-07-30', 'Austin Ames', 'Hardness=5 tts=16 Pre-soak 1 banana foamers arent functioning, possible dosatron malfunction. 2 nozzles not working on top and 2 nozzles not working on passenger side high pressure omni sprayers. The rainbar rinse after the last set of brushes and before the next arch is almost completely clogged. passenger side wrap dryer is not working manager has been notified.'),
  ('08c70b23-f655-426a-9d1c-68474d30edde', 'fairport', DATE '2025-09-02', 'SB', 'Site visit: Hardness=7  TDS=189  Conveyor=142.  2 nozzles on top and 2 on PS high pressure omni sprayers not working. First rainbar rinse is clogged. PS dryer out.'),
  ('224c2735-48c0-4dab-a442-2b5642c11773', 'fairport', DATE '2025-10-01', 'Shawn', 'Site visit--Hardness=8  TDS=200  Conveyor=139. Tunnel was down time of visit.  Delivery SB 10/01/25  Invoice #9013'),
  ('0496a9d2-1677-4172-a91b-94899ca3eff6', 'fairport', DATE '2025-10-28', 'SB', 'Graphene installed 10/14/25  Delivery invoice 9026....Site visit: Hardness=9  TDS=150  Conveyor=137...Bug remover was at 64:1 I turned it down to around 70:1 to see if we could get the mls down. More than a few hp omni''s not working. Front side dryer ps not working. Cleaned versa dial filters: HWS, Lo pHoam. Turned wax setting down to 7, using 4/5 mls now. Turn HWS tip to 23 from 20, now using 4ml.   Delivery SB 10/28/25 Invoice #9060'),
  ('3fc99ec9-9296-4258-8c70-55df86a68fef', 'fairport', DATE '2025-12-04', 'SB', 'Site visit: Hardness=8  TDS=170  Conveyor=142...Cleaned tip on the performance high and tip for infusion scent. Cleaned versa dial filters--HWS, X55 and Lo PHoam.  Changed setting on HWS up to 23, X55 up to 21 and Wax down to 5. Handful of the omni rockers are clogged. PS side dryer not working. Snowy day so not alot of cars during time of visit but the cars that did go through look good..Delivery SB 12/04/25 Invoice #9120'),
  ('601b0706-c471-40a2-a614-3c699c22dd4c', 'fairport', DATE '2026-01-02', 'Austin', 'delivery 1/3/26-9176... 12/26/26-9164... hardness=2 tds=156 flash wax was not drawing, worked the versa dial back and forth, and it started working, cleaned versa dial and filter. graphene was tied into another function and drained. issue was solved but the numbers will be off...'),
  ('59fc2fe0-6306-4036-8a96-7d0d323ed925', 'fairport', DATE '2026-01-30', 'Austin', 'delivery 1/30/206-9044... Hardness=2 TDS=150 presoak 1, infusions have an issue, they are drawing chemical but there is no pressure in the lines. '),
  ('7a880981-a7ab-4610-ac7b-a97434b2d93d', 'fairport', DATE '2026-02-27', 'Austin', 'delivery 2/26/26 9116 2/24/26-9101... 1/30/206-9044... Hardness=2 TDS=150 presoak 1, infusions have an issue, they are drawing chemical but there is no pressure in the lines....Delivery SB 02/27/26 Invoice #9118.'),
  ('3e70d03d-3aa1-44d9-a228-e42d1b3f131f', 'fairport', DATE '2026-03-27', 'Austin', 'Delivery SB 03/16/26 Invoice #9140... Delivery SB 03/30/26   Invoice #9180...HARDNESS=2 TDS=100 performance high was had no air to it, so it was not mixing up, i adjusted it down. 5 Gallons of bug remover on floor that cant be used...'),
  ('1e2a791b-2246-4a39-918b-190b6eda5aa2', 'fairport', DATE '2026-04-27', 'SB', 'HARDNESS=2 TDS=171  Bug Remover=10...    5 Gallons of bug remover on floor that cant be used...Lava bar is clogged in the middle. Little product is going on the top. H2O Nozzle is broke on the 2nd top brush. Tire shine brushes are not coming out to meet the tires... Cars look good...Delivery SB 04/27/26 Invoice #9233.'),
  ('79f21a36-6d61-480c-b128-c11f738390a9', 'fairport', DATE '2026-05-26', 'AA', 'HARDNESS=2 TDS=171  Bug Remover=10...    5 Gallons of bug remover on floor that cant be used...Tire shine brushes are not coming out to meet the tires... adjusted flash wax and x55 down... The timing on the cta is off, they are not hitting the tires, only the fender, they only turn on for a second, needs to be longer... ceramic is not drawing it appears that the k sticks are clogged, causing back pressure, no chemical draw, manager informed... Cars look good...Delivery SB 04/27/26 Invoice #9233.... delivery 5/6/26 invoice#9244.... '),
  ('0f514da5-543e-40b9-b405-68c814ce3636', 'fairport', DATE '2026-06-23', 'SB', 'HARDNESS=2 TDS=171  Bug Remover=10...    5 Gallons of bug remover on floor that cant be used...1st set of tire brushes are not coming out to meet the tires...ceramic is not drawing it appears that the k sticks are clogged, causing back pressure, no chemical draw, manager informed...Lava wall needs cleaning...Small leak in 90 top of arch on the drying agent... Cars look good...Delivery SB 06/23/26 Invoice #9370'),
  ('3e6651bf-77a0-4564-a7de-4ace1593bb92', 'fairport', DATE '2026-07-24', 'SB', 'Delivery SB 7/27/26 Invoice #9370.... HARDNESS=7 TDS=21  Bug Remover=9...    5 Gallons of bug remover on floor that cant be used...There was a jug of peak lo mixed up with the wax so the numbers will be off this visit..ceramic is not drawing it appears that the k sticks are clogged, causing back pressure, no chemical draw, manager informed..Lava wall needs to be cleaned...Small leak in 90 top of arch on the drying agent...A couple of brush nozzels leaking...Did ml checks on wax,X55,protect and graphene. All seem to be in range and look good in the tunnel. This site can not add graphene to packages, so to do the ml ckeck I had to force it on when a car was passing through. When I did that I was getting 7 mls a car. They had a car come through with a coupon for ceramic and graphene but the graphene did not come on during that wash. I had him go through again and had to force it on. Cars look good...'),
  ('8673406c-52be-4586-b5c8-f37561180833', 'farmington', DATE '2026-08-10', 'Austin', 'Delivery 6/30/26 Invoice# 9382... Delivery 7/24/26 Invoice# 9425...TDS- 9 HARDNESS- 1  6/30/26 Converted the previous bug remover chemical to the sonnys bug remover, also prepped everything for the cta tire soap to be converted to NCS 500.... 7/24/26 cta tire soap converted to NCS 500.... The site still has a large inventory of the previous chemical... we will be able to get an accurate usage and car count this coming month...'),
  ('69fe5c70-fe0c-4542-8d7e-42fe4c38e844', 'geneva_ii', DATE '2025-07-07', 'nh', 'first submission'),
  ('2ee5ef14-f6e7-43d3-bc30-887e370c0472', 'geneva_ii', DATE '2025-07-29', 'Austin', 'Hardness=1 TDS=5 Values for ceramic and extra packages still need to be implimented. Cer. pkg=318 Cer. ala=97 Hot Wax=349...Delivery 07/30/25 Invoice #8869'),
  ('14d403cf-7413-4ba4-b740-667e4f69c775', 'geneva_ii', DATE '2025-09-02', 'Austin', 'Delivery 8/29/25 invoice#8953 .... 9/3/25 invoice#8960... Injector for CTA1 is bad, needs to be replaced. injector for hot wax is going bad so manager unhooked 431, plugged in flash wax, as it is thinner and will perform better with the weak injector. Tire shine needs to be adjusted up. High pressure rinse after triple foams has several clogged nozzles on both sides as well as a shattered nozzle on passenger side, not rinsing properly and roughly half of the cars are leaving with visible soap and dirt left on the sides and wheel area. '),
  ('549bc9c8-4755-4d76-8154-2fa80d8905d2', 'geneva_ii', DATE '2025-10-01', 'Austin', 'Delivery 9/20/25 invoice#8977... Hardness=19 TDS=8 Softener is not regenerating properly, manager is aware. Tire Shine Flo jets are being replaced, usage is off. Adjusted the peak lo CTA 2. it was on 16, should be 4. Adjusted HWS. Several chemicals were switched over without changing the dial... Delivery SB 10/01/25 Invoice #9015'),
  ('eede127f-46cf-462e-8351-9ff4151c949e', 'geneva_ii', DATE '2025-10-27', 'Austin', 'Delivery 10/17/25     Delivery SB 10/27/25 Invoice #9055'),
  ('db31230d-e5c2-40e3-97df-562ca62c79b1', 'geneva_ii', DATE '2025-12-01', 'SB', 'Site visit: Hardness=0  TDS=16  Conveyor=147...First set of tire brushes ps does not come out to meet the tire. Second cta is not working.  Delivery SB 12/01/25  Invoice #9118'),
  ('c05d967d-ec00-4be5-8446-cfd34ecd502b', 'geneva_ii', DATE '2025-12-20', 'Austin', 'delivery 1/3/25 invoice#9175... tire shine is not drawing, manager is aware... according to manager, Graphene was turned on by mechanics and depleted. numbers will reflect.'),
  ('74911e19-f031-4a2d-ae1b-873a8d5a266e', 'geneva_ii', DATE '2026-01-29', 'SB', 'Site Visit: Hardness=   TDS=15  Conveyor=165...Cleaned the following filters: HWS, Red, Blue, Gold, Protect. Changed the poly line and foot valve on the 540. No suction on the Protect. Delivery SB 01/29/26 Invoice #9041 '),
  ('bbb5d1a7-161b-4e56-a5cb-7a7b775fdf27', 'geneva_ii', DATE '2026-02-26', 'SB', 'Site Visit: Hardness=1   TDS=6  Conveyor=163...No suction on Protect. I replaced the wieghts to two of the poly lines in the tire shine. Cleaned filters on Lo pHoam, all the colors. Cars look good but a little wet...Delivery SB 02/26/26 Invoice #9114.'),
  ('909c13dd-2082-4486-88e3-f9f6c53bf0b6', 'geneva_ii', DATE '2026-03-26', 'SB', 'Site Visit: Hardness=1  TDS=18   Conveyor=145..Delivery SB 03/22/26 Invoice #9126...Cleaned tips: Lo Phoam, all colors. Changed versa dial filter on the Wax. Sifted out most of the stuff growing in the rust repel. Tire shine is using around 29-30mls, so a little high but still looks good on the wheels.  Cars look good...Delivery SB 03/26/26 Invoice #9178'),
  ('08a2da49-06b0-4392-810a-0997cc21bff0', 'geneva_ii', DATE '2026-04-23', 'SB', 'Delivery SB 04/02/26 Invoice #9195..Delivery SB 04/20/26 Invoice #9209. Site Visit: Hardness=0  TDS=17   Conveyor=145...Cleaned tips: Peak Lo, HWS, Lo Phoams, all colors. Peak Lo cta, changed dial from 3 to 6. HWS injector is leaking back. 1 dryer out.  Cars look good...Delivery SB 04/24/26 Invoice #9225'),
  ('586963bd-3196-4805-aefc-6e3cbfd3e727', 'geneva_ii', DATE '2026-05-28', 'SB', 'Delivery SB 05/18/26 Invoice #9270...Delivery 5/21/26 #9283 Site Visit: Hardness=0  TDS=14/17   Conveyor=167...Cleaned tips:  Lo Phoams, all colors. This site is going through a lot of tire shine but the mls per car are not that high. They are very top heavy wash here. Everything in the tunnel looks good...Delivery SB 05/28/26 Invoice #9297'),
  ('5ce51b7c-54c7-4c89-ac0e-b7b90e1db1ab', 'geneva_ii', DATE '2026-06-25', 'SB', '.Delivery SB 05/28/26 Invoice #9297... .Delivery 6/25/26 Invoice #9376 Site Visit: Hardness=6 TDS=13   Conveyor=167... Ceramic punch converted to Slipstream Ceramic x on 6/15/26... Everything in the tunnel looks good..  Checked graphene usage, it is running 8 mls, but the usage looks higher because of the difference in mils in the jug...'),
  ('a9ffaa65-82be-4c33-80be-e9729460ca1f', 'geneva_ii', DATE '2026-07-23', 'SB', 'Delivery 7/20/26 #9406...Site visit: Hardness=1  TDS=13/14  Conveyor=127  Bug=20. I changed the tip from yellow to green on the bug remover. There were a few nozzels clogged in the tunnel. Mike was aware and was planning on cleaning that day. I did a mill check on both the protect and the wax. Both seem to be in range...Delivery SB 07/23/26 Invoice #9420'),
  ('49f9a31c-3b84-4e45-a45b-4ff03928dab7', 'newark', DATE '2025-07-23', 'nh', 'first sub'),
  ('3ed27eff-a405-4c4a-a106-a322427d9b8a', 'newark', DATE '2025-07-29', 'austin', 'hardness=7 tds=12 several chemicals were just switched over. packages need valies. Cer. pkg=1 Cer. ala=180 Hot=26....Delivery on 07/30/25 Invoice #8868'),
  ('86877573-dfff-48c5-8b89-54a01676fd97', 'newark', DATE '2025-09-02', 'SB', 'Site Visit: Hardness=11  TDS=35  Conveyor=138.   '),
  ('9a0324c9-42da-4e36-b0c9-0450300b3696', 'newark', DATE '2025-10-01', 'Austin', 'Hardness=11  TDS=35 Pre soak 1 has a leaking fitting under the injector. pre soak 2 has bad, plastic fitting under injector and is broken and leaking. Deleted old cleancut 360 from package setup in order to have room on the chart for Ceramic punch. usage for ceramic punch will be incorrect this month.'),
  ('41be708e-f06a-45f2-8cb5-5c7019914442', 'newark', DATE '2025-10-28', 'SB', 'Scent installed 10/14/25 ... Delivery invoice 9035: Site visit: Hardness=10  TDS=19  Conveyor=137...Cleaned wax versa dial filter, using 6ml. Couple of hp omni not working. Water leaking on supply line to side brush. Cars look good.'),
  ('0637eb69-3f9d-47ea-9704-4775288e09f5', 'newark', DATE '2025-12-03', 'SB', ' Site visit: Hardness=11 TDS=4  Conveyor=133...Delivery SB 12/04/25 Invoice #9119'),
  ('5963210d-8a58-44e2-975f-26fa9a5bc042', 'newark', DATE '2025-12-31', 'SB', 'Site visit: Hardness=9  TDS=29  Conveyor=137...Changed the filter on the Protect now it''s using 5-6mls. Cleaned filters on the X55 and Wax. Moved the setting to 20 on the X55, usage is at 10mls. Moved setting on the wax to 10. still only getting 4-5 mls but it looks good out in the tunnel. Top rocker supply line is leaking at the 90. Delivery SB 12/31/25 Invoice #9173.'),
  ('05d3cdf9-0b4a-4538-b2cc-a0dacd75de59', 'newark', DATE '2026-01-30', 'SB', 'Site visit: Hardness=9  TDS=29  Conveyor=137...Changed the filter on the Protect now it''s using 5-6mls. Cleaned filters on the X55 and Wax. Top rocker supply line is leaking at the 90. No suction on injectors for 500 and rust repel     Delivery SB 01/30/26 Invoice #9043'),
  ('1b5623e9-f680-4218-b26f-1ba3fa408cd5', 'newark', DATE '2026-02-27', 'SB', 'Site visit: Hardness=7  TDS=6  Conveyor=132...Cleanded filters on: Pre soak 1, Lo pHoam, HWS. Performance high pre-soak injector leaking back. Foot valve holding for now. No suction at the injector on 500 and 540. Eddie said he had changed them both last month. There is a small leak in the supply line for the HP nozzles. A few of the water nozzels for the brushes are leaking. Cars look good...Delivery SB 02/27/26 Invoice #9117.'),
  ('2d91af81-9fb9-4444-83a0-e2b77b33f346', 'newark', DATE '2026-03-31', 'SB', 'Delivery 3/24/26 Invoice#9165... Site visit: Hardness=7  TDS=11  Conveyor=130...Cleanded filters on: Blue and Red. Converted 540 over to rust repel. 500 still didn''t have suction at the injector. Eddie said he was going to change it again. Moved the dial on the protect from 14 to 16. Now getting 6 mls per car. Right injector is not working on the lava. Cleaned tip and changed the foot valve on the perfoformance hi spray gun. Sifted out the rust repel.      Cars look good. Delivery SB 03/31/26 Invoice #9186'),
  ('0a11d48f-2cb2-4299-ae14-5bb22afa55a0', 'newark', DATE '2026-04-27', 'SB', ' Site visit: Hardness=7  TDS=12  Conveyor=131..Cleanded filters on: Blue and Red, Lo phoams and X55. There is a leak at the 90 in the supply line to the HP sprayers passenger side. CTA is barely working on the driver side.  500 still didn''t have suction at the injector.  Cars look good....Delivery SB 04/27/26 Invoice #9232.'),
  ('927ea38b-d9e7-4c12-be66-e9b347e49f14', 'newark', DATE '2026-05-29', 'SB', ' Site visit: Hardness=7  TDS=12  Conveyor=131..Cleanded filters on: Blue and Red, Lo phoams and X55. There is a leak at the 90 in the supply line to the HP sprayers passenger side. CTA is barely working on the driver side.  500 still didn''t have suction at the injector.  Cars look good....Delivery SB 04/27/26 Invoice #9232... Deliver 5/29/26 invoice#9295'),
  ('d45890e3-83e1-451a-b530-285f66ec328c', 'newark', DATE '2026-06-23', 'SB', ' Site visit: Hardness=7  TDS=20  Conveyor=137..Cleanded filters on:Both Per Hi and both Lo pHoam. Protect has no suction at the injector. A few of the HP rinse nozzel''s are clogged. Tire shine numbers are not to bad but most of the product looks like it is coming out the driver side because that brush is not coming out to meet the tire.  Cars look good. Delivery SB 06/23/26 Invoice #9367'),
  ('5b1cbc12-6c12-44cf-9a74-650c13d8907e', 'newark', DATE '2026-07-24', 'SB', ' Site visit: Hardness=7  TDS=21  Conveyor=138..Cleanded filters on:Both Per Hi and both Lo pHoam. Protect has no suction at the injector. Eddie has stated he has changed that injector and selonoids numorous times but still loses pressure at the injector. A few leaks in brush nozzels. There is a pin hole leak in the fitting going into the top omni. Cars look good...Delivery SB 07/27/26 Invoice #9429'),
  ('d11e9492-0d6e-4677-b8c2-f25910a187bd', 'seneca_falls_iba', DATE '2025-06-27', 'nh', 'first sub'),
  ('992cdc76-3509-4500-9547-11ee7e96d30f', 'seneca_falls_iba', DATE '2025-09-02', 'Austin', 'delivery 8/16/25 invoice 8907... 9/3/25 invoice# 8958.. 9/15/25 invoice 8967... Bay 3- 312 is leaking back. multiple high preassure hose leaks. Broken hoses and leaks in the bay for high pressure functions. Bay 2- 222 is leaking back badly, 343 leaking back, 342 not drawing. 1 dryer out. Bay 3- not able to enter maintanance mode, cannot run functions. Flash wax usage is wrong. Starting quantity should be 0. peak lo usage is wrong. starting quantity should be 45. performance high usage is wrong. starting quantity should be 0. all 3x foam usages are wrong. starting quantity should be 0. 222 and 421 usage is wrong, injectors were leaking back. We will be converting this week within the week. car counts will start at 1 because of the frand total  and and be closer next month and accurate the month after.'),
  ('49620a87-2b54-4247-8b12-ea77b5d65959', 'seneca_falls_iba', DATE '2025-09-30', 'Austin', 'NOTE: 9/3/25 Bay 1 and 2 Pre soaks converted on... Delivery 9/3/25 invoice# 8958... Delivery 9/18/25 invoice# 8972...  Delivery 10/1/25 invoice# 8996.. NOTE: 9/19/25 Bay 3 pre soaks converted. All non pre soaks are in place and ready to be hooked up on. Waiting on repairs and chemical depleation... will be fully converting at least one bay after site visits. The car counts on bay 3 are lower than they were last month, unsure if the board was reset or why. car counts may be off'),
  ('02e6ad11-db5b-4814-8336-0dbd223c870b', 'seneca_falls_iba', DATE '2025-10-28', 'Austin', 'Bay 1 was shut down at time of visit.... bay 2- little to no suction on 3X foams. manager is aware. Switched over bay 2, 400, 421 to Bead Up.'),
  ('31fb7459-b378-4156-86f9-33313eded925', 'seneca_falls_iba', DATE '2025-12-01', 'SB', null),
  ('847f83bf-8915-4e93-886b-e04c7ffdd6e9', 'seneca_falls_iba', DATE '2025-12-30', 'SB', 'Bay 1: Down time of visit.  Bay 2: Presoak 1 and 2 has 2 nozzels not working on the arch.  No suction on any of the 3x foam.  Bay 3: Driver side dryer not working. Red has no suction at the injector. Unclogged several underbody nozzles.  '),
  ('97b99f86-4b28-486f-ad56-2dd2135ad93b', 'seneca_falls_iba', DATE '2026-01-30', 'SB', 'All bays down during time of visit.'),
  ('58f40af2-43bc-4c3f-b8dd-224de8fa2ffc', 'seneca_falls_iba', DATE '2026-02-26', 'SB', 'Site visit: Hardness=   TDS=240    ...Car counts will be off due to I was unable to get the counts from bay 1. Bay 1: Down. Bay #2: No suction on the triple foams. Cleaned nozzels on under spray. cars look good. Bay #3: Arm is going back to far and not getting much chemical or water on back of vehicle. No suction on red. Driver side dryer is out. Cars look alright but still a little dirty from the back...Delivery SB 02/26/26 Invoice #9112'),
  ('2d764a9a-e6e0-4369-be27-701cce1a6655', 'seneca_falls_iba', DATE '2026-03-27', 'SB', 'Site visit: Hardness=   TDS=240 tunnel inventory was used in in bay numbers will be off. Bay 1: leak in bridge no suction on red or blue injectors. Bay #2: No suction on the triple foams. leak in bridge on low pressure functions, leak in water lines coming into bay. Cleaned nozzels on under spray. cars look good. Bay #3: Arm is going back to far and not getting much chemical or water on back of vehicle. No suction on red. Driver side dryer is out. Cars look alright but still a little dirty from the back... chemical from the tunnel and ibas have been mixed up again.. usages are off... Delivery SB 02/26/26 Invoice #9112.... Delivery SB 03/27/26 Invoice #9175'),
