  ('eb7b3988-0d88-4e1a-960e-efa4213566e3', 'seneca_falls', DATE '2026-06-25', 'SB', 'Site visit: Hardness=7  TDS=13 Conveyor=151.. 3 dryers is out. There are leaks in the tire shine so usage is high this month, Josh is putting in a work order. The HWS injector leaking back into reservoir. Josh is here and is changing it. Wax foot valve was pulled all the way to the top, out of the chemical. The CTA''s stay on the length of the vehical, not sure if it''s designed to do that. Everything else looks good...DElivery SB 06/25/26 Invoice #9377'),
