  ('2762cd76-723d-4625-ac51-4f312d634da5', 'bridgeport', DATE '2025-07-24', null, 'Drying agent has blue tip but changed to orange tip. Cars are coming out pretty dry. Wanted minimal drop off this week. '),
  ('dc0463c5-d031-4bb6-ad5d-ec896f923e86', 'bridgeport', DATE '2025-08-04', null, 'Will be switching Peak Lo to Lo Phoam because it was burning on hot days. Daniel also asked about a $5,000 invoice that he was told it was chemical. I confirmed it was not a chemical invoice from us. '),
  ('a34e3107-1e94-42b3-830f-b05c25103f28', 'bridgeport', DATE '2025-08-20', null, 'Taking off the Peak Lo. Had issues. Replaced it with the lo Phoam. Lo Phoam usage read high last week because the quantity delivered was not updated. Changed HWS tip from light brown to Orange to lower usage. '),
  ('ba4afe0e-efe6-4e3a-b893-34e6447a7301', 'bridgeport', DATE '2025-09-05', null, 'Having issues with the tire shine. Very sporadic when it applies. Daniel is hand applying if customer is asking for more. Lo Phoam is high because it''s in the prep gun and buckets. Changed X55 to green tip. '),
  ('01f616b0-c23b-4caf-b535-235da1590c8f', 'bridgeport', DATE '2025-09-17', null, 'Changed X55 tip from green to light brown to higher the usage. Everything else was running well. Still using a lot of slipstream products to get rid of them. '),
  ('41a2e7a6-511c-4862-95c4-6fc817c2fced', 'bridgeport', DATE '2025-09-29', null, 'Daniel wanted to tip up lo Phoam. It''s used on multiple functions. Drying agent is working a lot better beading up on the cars. '),
  ('1949f9f9-8540-4d15-b885-017b65c0a830', 'bridgeport', DATE '2025-10-15', null, 'We added the infusions to the lo Phoam with a pink tip. Everything is running smoothly. Daniel already set up the Graphene and had 15 gallons on site. No drop off needed. '),
  ('d05549b3-40c3-4d44-af2c-8406a1c4c86f', 'bridgeport', DATE '2025-10-28', null, 'Changed the X55 tip up from tan to blue. Because of the colder weather we need to up the usage to get better results. Everything else is pretty good. Daniel questioned quality of the Graphene. The show on it is very good but told him to keep me updated if there''s any issues. '),
  ('789eb690-1230-4040-8d73-010ac83632fa', 'bridgeport', DATE '2025-11-12', null, 'Put the Graphene into a reservoir and it was 5.75 gallons so that''s the change. Tipped up the infusions from pink to purple. I''m not going to touch the X55. It''s beading cars up nicely. Usage may go up. '),
  ('b0639f32-f272-4352-8fb3-3cf6fef5da3f', 'bridgeport', DATE '2025-11-25', null, 'Changed tip down on infusions from purple to pink. Changed tip up on X55 from blue to white. Started using the protect again. '),
  ('283864c0-9bc8-4aa0-8037-0904c833759a', 'bridgeport', DATE '2025-12-10', null, 'Dosatron for the protect isn''t working well. Dropped off new dosatron and Daniel will install it. HWS is not being used on the thumb guns because the line is freezing. Cars are beading up pretty good. Daniel wants as little drop off as possible to make it till the next visit. I always suggest dropping off more product. '),
  ('0fa24ac7-23b4-448f-a0a6-fb01de0931f6', 'bridgeport', DATE '2025-12-22', null, 'Very busy here. Washed 3200 cars. X55 was lower but no issues with drying off the car. Daniel wants to add a banana foamer to the first foamers. Also, the protect isnt turning on consistently. Dosatron was just changed as well. They want drop off to be as light as possible. '),
  ('cb5362ce-6d40-4bbc-af77-1d01b189ecee', 'bridgeport', DATE '2026-01-08', null, 'Changed the diaphram on the X55 because it wasn''t working well. Is pulling chemical now but told Daniel to keep an eye on it. Everything else looked pretty good. Still using slipstream for the colors. '),
  ('54d84f4a-1391-465e-8043-7b81c5dac5ce', 'bridgeport', DATE '2026-01-20', null, 'Turned down sealer wax due to high usage. Drying agent is working better and beading up. Usage is low because Daniel told me someone disconnected the line to the dema. HWS usage isn''t high as well because the line keeps getting frozen with the cold weather. '),
  ('f5c63656-6d85-4dc4-a414-55927ebee954', 'bridgeport', DATE '2026-02-01', null, 'HWS thumb gun line is frozen so not being used. Protect there was another box I didn''t see last visit so the count was incorrect. Changed X55 tip down from white to blue because it was high usage and it doesn''t need to be that high. It was working well with the blue tip. Also, had lines freezing and not working when I was there. '),
  ('ff7fc4fb-327f-4ad6-b481-2ef945a28f41', 'bridgeport', DATE '2026-02-18', null, 'The have a lot of Slipstream ceramic and Daniel will use for sealer wax. Haven''t been using HWS because of the cold and the line freezing. Turned down flash wax because live pull was 10 mls. Daniel said he turned it down but may have mistakenly turned it up. He is running low on the slipstream colors so we will be adding those within the next couple of visits. '),
  ('71a2db46-a2cf-43b7-8876-2745899fbe3a', 'bridgeport', DATE '2026-03-03', null, 'Usage for lo Phoam and flash wax is not accurate because someone dumped lo Phoam into the flash wax. Still not using HWS, they did have issues with the line freezing before. '),
  ('f2c328d2-6265-4f3e-823d-b3f7f3a6f5b4', 'bridgeport', DATE '2026-03-19', null, 'Didn''t add quantity for Graphene last time. Using the lo Phoam on 4 different functions. Might start using the colors next visit. Still had slipstream left. He will start using the slipstream ceramic for the protect because he has a lot of it left. Turned down hot wax and protect. Not using the HWS thumb gun just using the pressure washer. '),
  ('c1525afa-a1cc-4965-90ab-b5e2f76513ff', 'bridgeport', DATE '2026-04-02', null, 'Set up the Red and Blue. Red is online, they still have some slipstream blue to run through. Yellow still is good as well. Not using the HWS at all.'),
  ('df1d52c7-be23-45b8-85d8-06c531b6ccdb', 'bridgeport', DATE '2026-04-14', null, 'Changed the foot valve and eductor for the x55 because it wasn''t pulling well. It started pulling a lot better after making those changes. Set up the Gold but still using slipstream for gold and blue. '),
  ('18bea70a-78c7-41b1-8a36-5f808cf6b99e', 'bridgeport', DATE '2026-04-27', null, 'Not using the HWS currently. They use lo Phoam in buckets and don''t use thumb gun near enough. There was red dumped into flash wax which is causing the usage to look off. Still using the slipstream blue and gold but they are running real low. Should be switching over shortly'),
  ('e0e6483b-1c07-4ce1-9ae0-926b9d3d4deb', 'bridgeport', DATE '2026-05-12', null, 'Eyesight for the HWS stopped working so the readings had been incorrect before. Changed tips on gold and blue down from pink to light purple because it was leaving too much soap on the cars. Put new foot valves on the lines in X55 hydrominder tank. '),
  ('5a019554-4936-42ee-afec-e03545c27168', 'bridgeport', DATE '2026-05-29', null, 'Dema injector for X55 isn''t pulling chemical so the drying agent isn''t working well. Daniel switched it and it doesn''t have any suction. Diaphragm in the valve was bad and was replaced. '),
  ('1cfc1580-9409-437a-b1ec-b9f0affa7ab8', 'bridgeport', DATE '2026-06-09', null, 'Drying agent is working great now that the dema diaphragm was fixed. Tipped down from white to orange. They are switching to Total Shine instead of Perfect Shine. They already have a drum and I''ve added the amount in the report. '),
  ('b086cbb6-a639-478b-aeb7-0401b6ce4b7b', 'bridgeport', DATE '2026-06-23', null, 'Changed the tip in X55 from orange to green to increase usage. Added a check valve on the blue because it kept running back into the line. Everything else is working well. '),
  ('e5bd2ffd-7528-4140-aa1f-805b2a6e933a', 'bridgeport', DATE '2026-07-21', null, 'Drying agent is working, beading up on cars nicely. Will monitor usage next visit. '),
  ('6e30a641-af2f-437e-bdd9-8f0a424fff35', 'bridgeport', DATE '2026-08-04', null, 'Red polish was backflowing into the container so I changed the diaphram (it looked real beat up) on the hydrominder to stop that from happening. Lo phoam is on 4 functions so thats the reason for the higher usage. Started using the sealer wax (Protect) again as well because they ran out of the other ceramic he had. '),
  ('8239187e-6d10-487d-b218-27183bc9efee', 'cherry_hill', DATE '2026-05-19', null, null),
  ('8f405cc9-ebfd-466e-adde-53c82b490eb7', 'cherry_hill', DATE '2026-06-02', null, null),
  ('2bb6e44c-5047-4576-9f85-fdb7bfe848fb', 'cherry_hill', DATE '2026-06-26', null, null),
  ('78b2b1a1-c6c6-4c3e-948e-20e3766c2dfa', 'cherry_hill', DATE '2026-07-22', null, null),
  ('1acf5c22-f414-4f92-b894-28810bfcf55a', 'cherry_hill', DATE '2026-08-13', null, null),
  ('61c5db2b-e32d-43dd-b442-126c37b24fa9', 'cheshire', DATE '2025-06-05', null, 'Starting Quantities'),
  ('5eed9ba3-f461-4f26-99e6-80f604549725', 'cheshire', DATE '2025-06-12', null, 'Turned down lo Phoam to 1:2500. Used 1 (around) gallon in prep buckets. Not sure how to incorporate into actual usage. Live pulls were about 15 ml after lowering'),
  ('303e19bf-2622-46a0-995c-2a649c912c6a', 'cheshire', DATE '2025-06-24', null, 'Lo Phoam is getting used in buckets in the tunnel (will always be higher because of it). Perfect Shine wasn''t shut off after mechanics were here, Jose said customers are complaining about stuff on their cars. '),
  ('60d3509d-134d-4dea-a0bb-af324076c933', 'cheshire', DATE '2025-07-01', null, 'Jose was not here. Switched to Sensations Blue & Red today. Everything was running good. '),
  ('a1f1f47d-602c-4428-aacd-880353cc0bfb', 'cheshire', DATE '2025-07-16', null, 'Lo Phoam is high because they are putting it in buckets as well. Jose said it was probably 5-7 gals used. Live pulls for the foaminator was 12 ml'),
  ('300adb92-e269-47a0-8b70-c2e5d928f099', 'cheshire', DATE '2025-07-30', null, 'Protect isn''t pulling into the tunnel. It''s getting into the dosatron but not out into the tunnel. Jose is will get maintenance to look at it. Lo Phoam is getting used for buckets as well that''s why usage is high. Did not add in delivered to ending quantity last report. Only delivered 15 gals this delivery'),
  ('d3c26ec3-466d-4515-9a24-101f24c261c8', 'cheshire', DATE '2025-08-13', null, 'Lo Phoam is used in the tunnel and prep gun. Flash wax is having an issue turning off. Maintenance was notified of this issue. The function never turns off, water and maybe a little chemical is leaking out. '),
  ('00b57c48-59b0-432e-922a-069646807e83', 'cheshire', DATE '2025-08-27', null, 'Tire shine was leaking. It was shut off and then turned back on. Jose is keeping an eye out. Protect function was turned off manually it''s pulling 5 ml on live pulls (4 cars tested). Flash wax was pulling 7 ml on live pulls (4 cars tested). Maybe those chemicals were miscounted last visit? I will check usage again next visit to confirm it''s working well. '),
  ('d9d09472-0d0b-4f89-91d1-19a8d3afac5d', 'cheshire', DATE '2025-09-11', null, 'One trigger for the HWS was broken. Hand applied. Lo Phoam is used in prep buckets as well. Protect Dosatron is leaking and was turned off for most of the day. I believe the water leaking out was getting into the reservoir. (Dropped off new dosatron - did not install)'),
  ('4f18a232-eb7c-414a-9452-d37100cd9024', 'cheshire', DATE '2025-09-26', null, 'Tire shine machine is leaking/spitting out excess product so Jose shut it off. Gold looks good and foamy. Cars are coming out fairly dry water is beading up good. '),
  ('d0232ef7-f1d9-4004-a199-2cbf63e598cb', 'cheshire', DATE '2025-10-10', null, 'Solenoid on flash wax doesn''t work and won''t turn off. Anniba knows and they will be fixing it. Have to manually turn off and on. Dropped off Graphene and hooked it up. Turned up protect two spins on dosatron'),
  ('8e6abd24-07b1-46d8-8058-22b861763ad3', 'cheshire', DATE '2025-10-23', null, 'Protect dosatron will sporadically spit water out and it''s going into the protect chemical. Reservoir is not going down. Jose said he will change. HWS thumb guns are have good chemical but are not being used much. That''s why usage is so low. Changed the tip on the red up from purple to aqua and on the blue up from pink to purple'),
  ('917dcbf2-0f93-48e1-86cb-1c338c6e027c', 'cheshire', DATE '2025-11-05', null, 'Flash wax live pull got 8 ml per car for a 3 cars. Not sure if the function is not turning on all the time but is pulling chemical. Turned protect up to 0.25 because the chemical in the reservoir is so diluted but new dosatron was put in. Will monitor the colors. HWS thumb guns are not being used frequently '),
  ('447d43f4-8733-4f9d-8748-c614a433c61b', 'cheshire', DATE '2025-11-19', null, 'Turned up dosatron on drying agent because of colder weather (above 1000 line). Bug looks good - not used on every car. Turned up protect to line under 0.25. It''s giving a watered down product currently. Tipped up blue and gold from purple to aqua, tipped up red from aqua to yellow. '),
  ('9cf402cb-cafc-4cab-9faa-948c044abe46', 'cheshire', DATE '2025-12-03', null, 'Graphene change was so small and such few cars it''s hard to see actual usage. Turned hot wax down (above 640) because of high usage. Not using the HWS thumb guns on any cars that I''ve seen. Water dripping from a pipe into the gold that''s why usage is low. Will visit again next week. '),
  ('81d93233-ef1b-4e84-8daa-460ed6b83843', 'cheshire', DATE '2025-12-11', null, 'Graphene usage is off because of the small amount that was used was too hard to record. Have had issues with the track all week. '),
  ('43d41973-a6fc-4bb5-9008-81d1cfcef743', 'cheshire', DATE '2026-01-07', null, 'Turned up X55 because it wasn''t beading on the car much. They aren''t using the HWS much (thumb gun) but lines were frozen. It looks good when it comes out so no changes necessary. Flash wax was turned off manually so nothing happened when the function turned on.'),
  ('77f41d9c-3ab5-4ba1-9f52-87977039c74f', 'cheshire', DATE '2026-01-21', null, 'Took off second check valve on flash wax and now it''s pulling 8 mls a car. Jose didn''t want tire shine this time. '),
  ('05ae1708-5591-4fb4-87f3-193c3d502935', 'cheshire', DATE '2026-02-03', null, 'Everything is working pretty good. I will monitor the triple foam but the show looks good. Turned up the flash wax and protect a little bit to get better usage. Also shortened the lines on both of those because they were way too long. '),
  ('0621b7d4-e5a1-4dc5-8577-f3fd80daa3fe', 'cheshire', DATE '2026-02-16', null, 'There is a leaking pipe above the flash wax and protect that got into the reservoirs causing it to look like no usage. Graphene show looks good. With only 5 add ons it''s impossible to show actual usage. Hot wax wasn''t turning off so they switched the fuse on it. '),
  ('37bc6224-99fb-4dc9-9c8e-2714bf722afc', 'cheshire', DATE '2026-03-05', null, 'Turned protect up on the dosatron trying to clear out the leakage into it. The red doesn''t work because of the flojet not pumping. Changed the diaphragm on the red hydrominder because it was overflowing. '),
  ('2ea1f4f6-d74a-4c98-81fb-6e397c9683c6', 'cheshire', DATE '2026-03-17', null, 'Protect dosatron was installed backwards causing it not work. Replaced the check valve on flash wax because it was not pulling the dosatron but it''s pulling well now. Had a leak into the Flash Wax. Graphene is pulling 10 mls live pulls. With it going down such a small amount in these reservoirs it''s hard to track it exactly. '),
  ('59d029bc-f4dd-4a5c-babc-96b2d97d5ed7', 'cheshire', DATE '2026-04-02', null, 'Turned up the protect and added a foot valve. Turned the hot wax and the air down to get a much better show. Told Jose it''s clogged in the middle of the rain bar. Everything else was working well. '),
  ('2f49af65-fffb-4e3d-8b27-1c6e17e7f5de', 'cheshire', DATE '2026-04-16', null, 'Graphene just small usages so it''s hard to be super precise. Turned up the flash wax and protect a little bit. '),
  ('973a104f-9876-4aaf-aa01-68fe02fea705', 'cheshire', DATE '2026-04-30', null, 'Everything is working pretty well. No complaints from Jose on anything. '),
  ('9720cc5b-e4ed-4202-9116-389e933bcdae', 'cheshire', DATE '2026-05-14', null, 'Protect dosatron didn''t have a check valve. So it was causing back flow and overflowing the reservoir. I added a check valve and stopped the back flow so it should be working well now. Replaced the tip and foot valve for the high pressure gun for prep because it wasn''t pulling. Lowered the air pressure on the tire shine to lower usage a little bit. '),
  ('57dc6e60-9cee-4ceb-8a0c-7f3aa189e57a', 'cheshire', DATE '2026-05-28', null, 'Red wasn''t pulling and the tank was overflowing so I replaced the diaphram and the foot valve. We also had to replace the flojet for the red. X55 wasn''t pulling at all. The dosatron plunger was broken and bent so a replacement was needed. Gold generator needs to be cleaned because its clogged. '),
  ('5a04c363-866d-4086-87b8-6fe3c3ce941f', 'cheshire', DATE '2026-06-07', null, 'Turned up the hot wax for a better show. Rain bar needs to be cleaned. '),
  ('0cdace04-b72f-49cd-a18c-10396197c04f', 'cheshire', DATE '2026-06-26', null, 'HWS isn''t pumping into the thumb gun into the tunnel. New hydrominder, flojet, foot valve. Cars are coming out dry. Everything else seems to be working well. '),
  ('9e11bf7c-6aea-4769-a25a-0edc223a227e', 'cheshire', DATE '2026-07-09', null, 'No car counts because it was just a drop off. '),
  ('03d884ad-38d5-4ca6-8f9a-b70fa483b3db', 'cheshire', DATE '2026-07-22', null, 'Sealer wax isn''t pulling. It''s a new dosatron and the check valve and foot valve were changed. Jack put it in a maintenance request because they didn''t want a new dosatron. '),
  ('5987494b-548b-42a7-ba43-60e2b0f39b22', 'cheshire', DATE '2026-08-03', null, 'Had to replace flojet and other pieces because it stopped working. Will check usage next visit. Lophoam dosatron wasn''t working so I replaced it. New dosatron on protect and usage is high because it''s turned up due to water mixing in the tank (told them to not add new product until it''s empty then we will turn it down). '),
