  ('67141228-8861-44ce-92be-a9acf6b66ca7', 'coscob', DATE '2025-05-15', null, 'All containers are on sight and ready to be connected. Offline: Tripple Colors, Ceramic. Online: Foam, Thumb guns Wheel cleaner, Wax, Sealant, Drying Agent, bug remover. Bug remover thumb gun install was completed today and I finished chemical connection and tested. Bug remover thumb guns are up and running. - LN'),
  ('dfc621b8-3d5c-49bb-90f5-a64e83e3da1b', 'coscob', DATE '2025-05-29', null, 'Hot Wax: Lowered Versadial to 8 ot lower usage. Usage at 8-9mls. Thumb guns (HWS): Usage was very high. F'),
  ('7708b535-9e1d-4755-af38-253413706876', 'coscob', DATE '2025-06-05', null, null),
  ('d762dd42-bce0-4e8f-9d70-53b083f4839d', 'coscob', DATE '2025-06-18', null, 'Thumb gun (Wheel cleaner)- Increased usage slightly. Manager mentioned the wheels weren''t cleaning as well. '),
  ('d991a41f-396e-4cc4-8bbb-afd039f5b7af', 'coscob', DATE '2025-07-01', null, null),
  ('a2b965ce-5107-498c-9944-61e92397eb8d', 'coscob', DATE '2025-07-18', null, 'Thumb guns (wheel cleaner): Customer mentioned guns were watery. Dosatron was turned on 1:55 on arrival. Both passenger and driver side guns were working normally. The line was not working properly the last week or so causing no chemical to be used. On test everything is working normally. Planning to stay in touch with Ramero to make sure issue doesn''t arise again. '),
  ('81de76f0-d107-4922-bf17-a741924b4986', 'coscob', DATE '2025-07-29', null, null),
