  ('9776d05c-1f24-4b9d-9ed7-55f6a73e40ce', 'coscob', DATE '2025-09-09', null, 'Protect: VD set at 20 on arrival. High usage. Reduced VD to 10'),
  ('3805f1c0-26ae-41db-8915-8e59a715b180', 'coscob', DATE '2025-09-23', null, 'Drying Agent

Lowered VD from 18 → 14.

Testing usage at 10 mls.

Wheel Cleaner

Manager noted wheels not cleaning well and application inconsistent.

Swapped dosatrons between Bug Prep and Wheel Guns to test if this resolves issue.

Bug Prep gun sees very little use.

Triple Shine

Usage is high.

Low car count makes chemical measurement difficult.

Sealant

Function not dispensing.

Possible MAM valve replacement needed.'),
  ('8f71ba47-67d8-4d10-8ce1-7ef77c64eaf5', 'coscob', DATE '2025-10-20', null, 'Wax: On arrival, the line was inserted into a Lopofoam container because FWW was low. Drained and refilled the Bubblizer container. Set Versadial to 28. Pull usage is 8 mL.

Yellow Polish: Found a hole in the chemical line causing product leakage. Replaced the line and reset Versadial to 14. Current usage is 5 mL.

Protect: MAM valve was not opening. Replaced MAM valve and spring. Set Versadial to 12. Usage is 4 mL.'),
