  ('34086a9e-5506-46aa-83ae-2a94f1d5a741', 'coscob', DATE '2026-06-04', null, 'FWW: High usage. '),
  ('48fc17de-575b-4517-9ef4-9faa2ec5650b', 'coscob', DATE '2026-06-20', null, null),
  ('d32bd615-31c2-41fa-b48e-d0039a817dbc', 'coscob', DATE '2026-07-03', null, null),
  ('37743ffc-2e3b-4196-b990-7f18b331890b', 'coscob', DATE '2026-07-17', null, 'Hot Wax- High usage. Lowered VD from 7 to 5. Usage at 15mls after test. '),
  ('5b99db0a-7e19-4219-9584-245894b26402', 'coscob', DATE '2026-07-31', null, null),
  ('e40ae944-e191-4248-9a83-eb6abf01a1c1', 'cromwell', DATE '2025-06-06', null, 'Switched triple foam over to Sonnys. Pulling about 5ml for each. '),
  ('8bfa318d-3078-4770-8120-2a540fa42a16', 'cromwell', DATE '2025-06-24', null, 'Usage on X55 and Total Shine are low. Jack expected the total shine to be low. Cars are coming out pretty dry as well - no complaints there. CPC is lower because some products aren''t online as of yet. Switched he 240 (dropped another line into the Lo Phoam). '),
  ('c35b8613-c22c-4f22-851c-319186f20e1e', 'cromwell', DATE '2025-07-01', null, null),
  ('2bd984f4-a97a-42e3-8929-d1e869bf0aa0', 'cromwell', DATE '2025-07-16', null, 'Everything was good chemical wise. HWS has a leak in it Jack will be fixing.    '),
  ('658b9541-847f-4f2a-92bf-bb8f838839de', 'cromwell', DATE '2025-07-30', null, 'Miscounted bug remover by 2.5 gal - had it separated from others and didn''t see it. The red color tip was clogged. Changed to a red tip and coming out foamy'),
  ('93858f02-bec8-46a9-b516-5ee7cec2f1a7', 'cromwell', DATE '2025-08-13', null, 'Lo Phoam is used in prep buckets and prep guns. That''s why usage is high. Changed the red from red tip to light blue. Tire shine was not working. It is fixed as of now. Also, fixed the leaks in the check valve on blue. '),
  ('0366b1d7-7c4f-4f14-878b-380be8915ab0', 'cromwell', DATE '2025-08-27', null, 'Jack had to change the check valves on red and blue. Changed the Red tip from light blue to pink. Also set up the flash wax. Tests were pulling 8 ml '),
  ('b1da3fa5-95af-4196-8459-3e35fa461960', 'cromwell', DATE '2025-09-11', null, 'Changed the red from a pink tip to a tan tip. Lo Phoam is used in prep buckets and prep gun. Blue is low but there''s an issue with the pump, so Jack will talk to Anniba to figure out a resolution'),
  ('762ec861-ec4b-4ea2-9904-1d5a04d87ec3', 'cromwell', DATE '2025-09-26', null, 'Tipping up the blue from tan to orange. Tipping down the red from tan to burgundy. Turning up dosatron to .05 for flash wax. Switched bug remover (222) and lo Phoam (260) in the in bay dropped off 1 box of each'),
  ('500497ac-19dc-4b2f-9e0c-e1eedd722bfc', 'cromwell', DATE '2025-10-10', null, 'Turned up flash wax on dosatron to first line under 0.05. Changed HWS from orange tip to dark brown. Changed blue from Orange to Tan. Added Graphene set up reservoir and tested chemical to the tunnel. '),
  ('d694549d-252f-44db-948f-f2b1ad950000', 'cromwell', DATE '2025-10-22', null, 'Flash wax was not pulling up the line. Changed the foot valve and check valve and it''s now pulling chemical. Not going to turn it up. Tire shine is being used. Incorrect entry on the ending quantity. Changed the check valve on the ceramic because it was not pulling and now it''s pulling correctly. '),
  ('b81cc6e6-1f36-49e4-b86e-3f99e1ca3bed', 'cromwell', DATE '2025-11-05', null, 'Turned flash wax up from 0.06 to 0.08. Changed tip down on HWS from Dark Brown to Yellow. '),
  ('9adcbd18-a66e-4c99-9b57-73ed52aee36c', 'cromwell', DATE '2025-11-19', null, 'Graphene needs to be turned on manually when it''s given to a customer for free to try out. Function stays on longer than normal. Turned down flash wax from 0.08 to 0.07 on dosatron for lower usage. Tipping down the blue from tan to lime. Red has burgundy. Gold has pumpkin '),
  ('6cd6ca9e-acd7-477a-9712-c2d777cf14e2', 'cromwell', DATE '2025-12-03', null, 'Starter for X55 is not working so that''s why it''s low usage. Installed the infusions into the lo Phoam had to turn up Lo Phoam a lot to 640 on dosatron. Turned down the Graphene. Changed blue tip down from lime to burgundy. '),
  ('23b5b046-569f-402a-a1f4-77b3423af18c', 'cromwell', DATE '2025-12-11', null, 'Graphene usage was such a small amount usage won''t be correct. Infusions working well, can smell it in the tunnel. '),
  ('2f8f014e-4afb-414a-901b-4554808a9cda', 'cromwell', DATE '2025-12-23', null, 'Flash wax was left on for 30+ minutes. Graphene is always going to be high because of manual turn on and off and hard to track for that small of use. Missed a 2.5 gal of bug last inventory count. '),
  ('af983a00-9c94-4a79-b7d0-61ad621cd3de', 'cromwell', DATE '2026-01-05', null, 'Tire shine they need to replace the cylinder in the tunnel because it''s not working. They ordered the it but waiting for it to come in. Everything else is working well. Not using much bug remover because of the winter and Lo Phoam is high but it needs to be for the show and to get coverage on the car. '),
  ('1b18d2a4-c5ab-4c70-b79e-22b41e7a63cf', 'cromwell', DATE '2026-01-21', null, 'Started using slipstream ceramic. Infusions isn''t pulling much. Very faint smell but if I change the tip it doesn''t pull the lo Phoam. Changed the X55 tip from pink to purple'),
  ('f60dd067-9092-4dc9-9ba2-52c2eb5b8754', 'cromwell', DATE '2026-02-01', null, 'Tire shine isn''t working currently. Javi said he will try to fix it. Tipped X55 down from purple to pink. Usage was very high, will monitor it next visit'),
  ('f2ad078e-f14e-4b6b-a5f8-f5f2d58a2caa', 'cromwell', DATE '2026-02-16', null, 'Ceramic and Graphene are hard to count with such small usages. Product looks good on the show. Drying agent and protect were switched for a couple of days because the motor went on the drying agent. So the usages are a little messed up. Will keep an eye on it. Drying agent is working well. '),
  ('4f265955-79aa-4b50-bc3d-a844ddd855c2', 'cromwell', DATE '2026-03-05', null, 'Protect and X55 were switched for a short time because the pump for x55 wasn''t working when it got fixed they were switched back and the protect wasn''t tipped back down so usage was really high. Almost impossible to track on these reservoirs with the ceramic and Graphene for such low usage but they both have a good show. Will keep an eye on HWS. Usage has been good for a while. Jack said ceramic turns on for some customers even when they don''t add it. Bug remover had some water spill into it so usages are low. Live pulls of Protect are at 5 mls. '),
  ('18fdb107-7f63-4210-b8a7-b582ad2c15c3', 'cromwell', DATE '2026-03-17', null, 'Changed the tip up for X55 from pink to purple. Live pulls were around 11 mls. When I arrived cars weren''t drying great. Flash wax turns on about 4-5 seconds prior to car arriving. HWS isn''t being used on every car, that''s why usage is low. '),
  ('4d9a9c72-745f-4578-b592-5287964350cb', 'cromwell', DATE '2026-04-02', null, 'Had issues with the tire shine machine and are fixing it. '),
  ('98cfd506-ff79-4b25-bf23-3ca1cd2d8122', 'cromwell', DATE '2026-04-16', null, 'Tire machine isn''t extending correctly so it''s using some tire shine but isn''t hitting the tires consistently. Graphene is turning on for works and works plus. Jack reached out to Anniba. Told him to put in put in a request with maintenance or IT to resolve. Flash wax wasn''t working coming out as water. Jack and I fixed it and got it working good again '),
  ('4fe9351f-a296-4cb4-b877-4b2826aaa2b9', 'cromwell', DATE '2026-04-30', null, 'Flash wax wasn''t working again upon arrival. I switched the line and am using a dosatron foot valve and it pulled right up and is working again. Changed the tip on X55 from purple to pink. Not using the bug or HWS on every car so usages are low.  Triple foam looks good. Will keep an eye on the blue for more usage. '),
  ('d5b7f1ce-6b3d-495a-bdba-ac2a67fc487b', 'cromwell', DATE '2026-05-14', null, 'Turned up flash wax. Drying agent was really high last time. I will monitor. Jack says cars are coming out dry, site was down during the visit. Not using bug remover really more just using the high pressure gun right now. Jack is happy how the chemicals are working. Just having issues with the tunnel and things breaking. '),
  ('009fb488-a7e4-401e-b7a1-7f0bb6c5dc83', 'cromwell', DATE '2026-05-28', null, 'Changed the tip in the blue because it was clogged and the changed the check valve. It looks a lot better now. Also tipped up the X55 from pink to purple tip. To increase usage'),
  ('7cd61eaf-ac9f-4f5e-9fea-8255ba0bd7c0', 'cromwell', DATE '2026-06-11', null, 'Drying agent isn''t going into the tunnel. The pump isn''t working. Anniba is reaching out to maintenance to come look at it. Turned down the flash wax. '),
  ('ef2cd750-7dd2-4fac-b249-498d65de5d6c', 'cromwell', DATE '2026-06-26', null, 'Turned down the hot wax. They aren''t using much bug remover. Pump for X55 was worked on but is still not working, I let Anniba know. I will tip up X55 from purple to aqua. Lo Phoam is being used for foaminator, buckets in the tunnel and the pressure washer. Graphene has to be turned on manually so usage will be a little higher. '),
  ('fde65716-5d7e-4786-adfd-a763cd93ff2c', 'cromwell', DATE '2026-07-09', null, 'No car counts because Kevin wasn''t there. Will do them next visit. '),
  ('980d731c-b781-41c8-adfc-b6b475ab8391', 'cromwell', DATE '2026-07-22', null, 'Wash is looking good. Colors weren''t used much will monitor. Had issues with drying agent prior so no adjustments made. If it continues high we will make adjustments. '),
  ('13aed71b-10c0-43bd-b365-3193824418e7', 'cromwell', DATE '2026-08-03', null, 'Lo Phoam is high because of buckets in tunnel and the self serve bays. '),
  ('2b84b794-0b10-4253-972a-89c47179fcab', 'darien', DATE '2025-06-05', null, null),
  ('bb308f0e-5641-4bbd-8dfb-e07c44e8b4a0', 'darien', DATE '2025-07-03', null, null),
  ('5898a6b0-b16b-4c4e-9850-ec7ee3671527', 'darien', DATE '2025-07-18', null, 'Hot Wax: High usage. Lowered versadial to 8. Using 10mls. First Foamer: High usage. Product is also being used for the self serve bays. Lowered Versadial from 26 to 22. Usage at 10mls. Application looks good. '),
  ('3a49b7f6-7e6d-4f81-b829-a12e40475ec7', 'darien', DATE '2025-08-01', null, null),
  ('c8212656-f47a-47f3-8d74-50c6ebd907ef', 'darien', DATE '2025-08-12', null, 'Self Serve Bays 1 and 2 foaming brushes were leaking; pulled chemical (lophoam) and emptied chemical container because of Solenoid failure. Manager said solenoid replacements are happening on Thursday. Temporarily removed chemical lines to prevent further waste. Refilled container. Usages will appear higher on report because of this issue.'),
  ('9ea98704-2ccb-4a7c-9503-6516ff6ec587', 'darien', DATE '2025-08-26', null, null),
  ('ee1e0f8a-f39b-4894-b5b5-c70b7ff1818e', 'darien', DATE '2025-09-09', null, 'Connected Sonny''s Triple foam. '),
  ('e2c22546-5719-4277-9c71-a2ed83c9c779', 'darien', DATE '2025-09-22', null, null),
  ('3ad246b6-6677-45c0-8628-b7bce18fb265', 'darien', DATE '2025-10-14', null, null),
