  ('d1da6890-e131-4f49-8a48-3fe955f55a55', 'darien', DATE '2026-05-06', null, null),
  ('50834fe0-8920-4737-88d7-469c337ecdbf', 'darien', DATE '2026-06-04', null, null),
  ('25c98120-3c47-49e7-bbb8-28aca7eebaaa', 'darien', DATE '2026-06-20', null, null),
  ('a39ade6f-7ee5-4929-b00f-291dbd24eb10', 'darien', DATE '2026-07-03', null, 'Thumb Guns: Retaped leaking dosatron fittings. Self Serve: Emptied contents in the container for Wax application. Product was mixed with water and other chemicals. Replaced with FWW. Installed new line and foot valve and hydro minder tip insert. (Pink tip)  Drying Agent: Lowered VD from 21 to 18. '),
  ('bee6962e-7167-45aa-a10c-db3f36aec6c0', 'darien', DATE '2026-07-17', null, 'Foamer and drying agent were running constantly on loop for a few days because of an electrical issues. Excessive amount of chemical was used because of this.'),
  ('00831ec8-314b-4b1a-9d7e-472dc2508056', 'darien', DATE '2026-07-31', null, null),
  ('08c249c4-ae1f-45d3-977a-ded503264fa6', 'derby', DATE '2025-05-13', null, null),
  ('3c7751f6-ad02-406a-acfb-5eac7e56b871', 'derby', DATE '2025-06-11', null, 'Starting quantity was entered from wrong dates. Dropped products after. Quantity delivered will be inaccurate to adjust starting quantity. Changed infusions, VD was set to 8 and it was pulling less than 1 ml. Now it''s pulling around 3-4 ml and you can smell it in the tunnel. '),
  ('9805956a-e02b-4d4d-9e7b-6a73c0c7bdfe', 'derby', DATE '2025-06-19', null, 'Still trying to dial in the usage numbers. Everything is fairly close some are a little low. Not using Flash Wax yet. Will be within a week. Soaps in the tunnel are working well cars are coming out dry. '),
  ('8c81443f-cf3b-42c3-bd09-e269c0b2606a', 'derby', DATE '2025-06-27', null, 'Numbers are pretty close. Protect is low because it''s only on 1 function. Will change to 2 once reflection is gone. '),
  ('5b85eb33-d916-4c74-9267-5d3c3151226a', 'derby', DATE '2025-07-02', null, 'Performance Hi was extremely high. Changed VD back to 12 (extra line- was at 18) and 15 or 6 ml(eye sight line - was at 21)'),
  ('b7e2aef9-1c46-4592-8ed5-0c4e61ccfcf3', 'derby', DATE '2025-07-15', null, 'In the closet they had buried a Blue 2.5 gallon that was missed. Flash Wax VD was turned up to 17 (was on 8) switched back to 8 and it pulled around 7 ml (billing for 4 flash wax - borrowed 1 from Milford. Kept off Milford Invoice) '),
  ('aaec9965-166f-4cdc-b0e4-6bc2ed4af486', 'derby', DATE '2025-07-24', null, 'Live pulls of Lo Phoam were 7.5 VD 25. Changed VD to 23 and it was pulling 5 ml '),
  ('5715a47c-acfa-412e-9fa4-125fe471ec44', 'derby', DATE '2025-08-04', null, 'Live pulls on lo Phoam were at 6 ml. Pedro was not here Sondra did not know of any issues. Will keep an eye on it. Will monitor HWS but live pulls were around 3 ml (VD 25) '),
  ('6e0d191b-a275-4da6-93c7-cc943c8f1c71', 'derby', DATE '2025-08-20', null, 'Tire shine usage is very high. It was adjusted not by Pedro. Turned the flash wax VD from 8 to 7 - usage is still a little high. HWS is pulling low but the function isn''t staying on. Pedro cleaned the generator think there must be a break in the line '),
  ('2c9d23c9-e372-4a4b-bc05-2c017f3a9286', 'derby', DATE '2025-09-05', null, 'Tire shine usage is extremely high. It was leaking under the brushes. '),
  ('7c85d7b4-f010-47af-a4a6-c057ee639eb6', 'derby', DATE '2025-09-18', null, 'There was a hole in one of the Red 2.5 gals and it spilled out. Usage is good. Cars are coming out good. No issues. '),
  ('4b93ac2d-6637-42d0-99cb-5b93a7275022', 'derby', DATE '2025-09-29', null, null),
  ('c649b7cb-5574-4aee-9d77-d399f8d1b639', 'derby', DATE '2025-10-15', null, 'Lo Phoam was turned up but it was turned back and now pulling 5 mls on live pulls. Site already has Graphene and infusions. '),
  ('c5803ca3-9ed1-49dd-a16c-b7d1ffbd6635', 'derby', DATE '2025-10-29', null, 'Tire shine usage was turned down. Infusions is being used, will monitor usage (may have been miscounted). Turned bug remover up (being used but maybe not every car). Everything was cleaned. Turned up Red Blue and Yellow up 1 on VD to get a little more color.  '),
  ('ab077cde-133d-43cf-8b4c-0ab69699e2ef', 'derby', DATE '2025-11-12', null, 'Turned up VD on Red and Gold from 11 to 12. Turned up protect from 12 to 13. Turned up infusions 27 to 28. '),
  ('d31d38b2-250a-4f0a-9e3a-3ba22743fad9', 'derby', DATE '2025-11-25', null, 'Turned performance from 15 up to 17 for more foam.  Turned up red and blue from 12 to 14. Turned flash wax up from 7 to 8. Infusions is not turning on every car. Pedro will reach out to maintenance '),
  ('0677b413-34d0-4b2b-8a4e-0e14dd665241', 'derby', DATE '2025-12-10', null, 'Put a new injector on protect. It wasn''t sucking up chemical. Turned Triple Foam up 1 on VD. '),
  ('cda35de8-c9c4-4b18-b4e0-cdc5a0657307', 'derby', DATE '2025-12-22', null, 'Used a repair kit on the Mam valve for the infusions because it wasn''t pulling, smell was gone from the tunnel. You could start to smell it after. Mac Track was down so the numbers were entered in after the visit so no adjustments were made to anything else. '),
  ('7c5c45a9-699e-4fe7-af51-edee3b583284', 'derby', DATE '2026-01-08', null, 'Turned the scent down from 28 to 22. Pulling 3 mls per car. Turned flash wax up from 7 to 8 on VD.'),
  ('606b355e-fa07-4f0c-979c-e97c8bbe9503', 'derby', DATE '2026-01-20', null, 'Turned triple foam up 1 on VD. Cars are beading up well. Bug remover looks good out of the thumb gun, no changes necessary. Pedro will clean out the rain bar for the triple foam. '),
  ('b8b34df8-975f-44e5-82e3-51fadeb98779', 'derby', DATE '2026-02-03', null, 'Cleaned out VD on HWS and Flash Wax and both are pulling targets. Lo Phoam live pull was 6 mls. Do have it hooked up to the mat room as well. Performance is on Presoak 1 and 2. Show looks good. Drying agent working well. Turned up the peak from 14 to 15 on VD. '),
  ('6901d8a0-e239-44c2-be0c-80a373cd30e4', 'derby', DATE '2026-02-18', null, 'Lo Phoam was pulling high last time so this will even it out. Turned up X55 from 21 to 22. Having issues with performance to stay on too long or not turning on. Turned peak lo up from 15 to 19 because it wasn''t washing the sides of the car well enough. '),
  ('3fac7250-4cb7-47b6-aaf2-0bef85d08e16', 'derby', DATE '2026-03-03', null, 'Show looks pretty good. Usages are all good. Bug is low but comes out strong. Tire shine if turned down does not stick on the tires. It needs to be higher usage for any kind of show. I want to keep them pretty stocked up because they had multiple days over 1000 cars. '),
  ('ed7bd97f-5a75-48f0-be55-765020c59585', 'derby', DATE '2026-03-19', null, 'Had issues with HWS. Pedro changed the pad and is turning on but it''s staying on way after the car passes. Tried replacing the check valve after the injector. Pedro will change the mam valve to see if the problem persists. Turned up the X55 on VD to 23 to increase usage. '),
  ('f82e85d0-cde7-4600-9190-c2482a439fc9', 'derby', DATE '2026-04-01', null, 'Flash wax was turned up to 22 on VD (20 mls live) turned it down to 11 on VD. Bug remover is being used. Cars are drying well. Protect was turned up to 18. Turned it down to 13. '),
  ('97c9b970-9c00-4838-a413-e8ab62836f18', 'derby', DATE '2026-04-14', null, 'Performance is pulling 5 mls live. May have miscounted flash wax for performance in the closet last time. Flash wax live pull is around 10 mls. Everything was working well. '),
  ('d3bddb4a-835f-4f88-a767-59c48306a2bf', 'derby', DATE '2026-04-27', null, 'Turned down the protect from 13 to 12 on VD. Show looks good. Cars are coming out dry.'),
  ('84385ae5-0510-429e-8fcc-77f333500769', 'derby', DATE '2026-05-12', null, 'The HWS isn''t turning on for the first tire and turns on late for the second, I let Pedro know. '),
  ('c9a52905-d7a2-41e8-9cd4-917641dc0fef', 'derby', DATE '2026-05-29', null, 'Turned down the hot wax from 12 to 11 on VD, do need it a little higher for the show. HWS is still not working correctly. Had a blower down so cars weren''t coming out as dry as before but x55 was working and beading up on cars. '),
  ('9d0cffcb-8142-429a-89b4-95cf4803efd4', 'derby', DATE '2026-06-07', null, 'Wash was looking good. No adjustments are needed. '),
  ('3e4e9dfc-a38e-4405-a812-8a0b2e2a0830', 'derby', DATE '2026-06-23', null, 'Pedro turned up the Performance because it wasn''t cleaning cars completely. Lo phoam is also being used in the mat room, no adjustments needed. Cars are coming out shiny and dry. '),
  ('42e9854f-811d-4f21-b26d-960b0b634334', 'derby', DATE '2026-07-08', null, null),
  ('ee6a124a-8515-4ec0-9be8-f57dee639f35', 'derby', DATE '2026-07-21', null, 'Replaced 2 check valves on for the siphon breaks because they were leaking. Also added 3 foot valves for the tire shine because they didn''t have them. Turned down flash wax a little. '),
  ('feb3ba55-80a8-4cef-b0a0-d6488a1f1d22', 'derby', DATE '2026-08-04', null, 'Flojet for the tire shine wasn''t working. Pedro cleaned it out and now its working again. Injector for the infusions broke but Pedro ordered so I didn''t drop off or replace. Wash is looking great, just in slow season. '),
  ('dcce4591-3b42-40c7-8469-fb161cffd79c', 'easthaven', DATE '2025-06-04', null, 'Outshine will need to be changed. Frank thinks the seals are bad again already (2 months). Changed the X55 from 21 (16 ml) to 17 (11 ml). Changed Red, Blue, Gold to VD 6 was at 3 still pulling no more than 2 ml. Not staying on cars which was the concern. '),
  ('10fb54fd-14f5-4902-86f2-8b8b03ffb04e', 'easthaven', DATE '2025-06-10', null, 'Asked me not to change any of the versadials. Told them Lo Phoam and Performance was low usage. '),
  ('eb67705f-e019-4b4f-bb94-d4b08f039ae4', 'easthaven', DATE '2025-06-18', null, null),
  ('b2029c26-098b-4db3-9bfc-7d89bb153d2d', 'easthaven', DATE '2025-06-26', null, 'Cars are coming out dry. everything seems to be working well. No complaints from the site. Some usages are high/low but will keep monitoring them. Had to switch to Total Shine on MacTrack (reason for 58 gal delivered) '),
  ('50db4c91-6611-4d26-b269-12c6a58efb00', 'easthaven', DATE '2025-07-03', null, null),
  ('10ea395c-a389-4fbb-bc28-29539d5ee766', 'easthaven', DATE '2025-07-14', null, 'Turned the Gold VD to 12 (was 14). Some cars are coming out a little soapy. '),
  ('ceb10d33-de7b-4823-9bff-57cb8fb242ed', 'easthaven', DATE '2025-07-29', null, 'Let frank know about the tire shine usage and he said there was leaks that were just changed. Also, HWS was not pulling. Eye sight is broken and not filling up on reservoir dropped the line directly into the reservoir and it was pulling. Built spare reservoir and they will switch it when it''s empty. '),
  ('422b444d-cbc0-405d-ab23-1fbb55f3d46f', 'easthaven', DATE '2025-08-11', null, 'Want to start using the infusions (scent) in their tunnel. Going to change the arch from bug remover to infusions. '),
  ('473decd5-73d9-4a2f-8f29-8ad87fbf3a0c', 'easthaven', DATE '2025-08-25', null, 'Micrologics was down on the visit. Tried reaching out for numbers and got them from Frank. Usage looks pretty good for everything. I''ve added the Ceramic and Hot wax packages to the MacTrack.'),
  ('8fc7483c-e9f0-462f-a5c5-f84c80dc4c2c', 'easthaven', DATE '2025-09-09', null, 'Presoak (Performance Hi) VD was changed from 25 to 16. Also, added check valves to banana foamers in tunnel for low front. Turned protect VD down from 16 to 13 (live pull was 5 ml). Live pulls on red were 3 ml'),
  ('f98fa486-d824-43f4-bc3c-5bdd9db6f387', 'easthaven', DATE '2025-09-15', null, 'Travis visited with to straighten some things out. Will be going over the reports when run with Frank. Peformance front foamers VD was turned down from 16 to 14 for live pulls of 5 ml. '),
  ('83afe08d-c9fa-4064-86c0-730bf53352c8', 'easthaven', DATE '2025-09-24', null, 'Live pulls of red were 5 ml. I turned VD from 18 to 16 for live pulls of 3 ml'),
  ('440700af-f89e-4e3c-a5c2-d4fde39e2da9', 'easthaven', DATE '2025-10-09', null, 'Turned Gold VD from 11 to 10. Changed Red and Blue VD from 11 to 13. All pulling 3-4 ml live. Turned down infusions from 16 to 13 on VD. Let Frank know the hot wax rain bar needs to be cleaned. '),
  ('2f85c5e4-2b68-4a45-8ccb-535b5606cb36', 'easthaven', DATE '2025-10-21', null, 'Changed Peak lo VD from 13 (3 ml) to 19 (10  ml). Turned up the low front and low rear up from 10 to 12 on VD (4 ml). Flash wax was pulling around 15 ml but it''s higher for a better show. Protect turned up from 13 to 14 VD for pulls of 6 ml. Track speed was pushed up. So that''s why some things are pulling lower. '),
  ('6895ef7e-149d-43b5-b689-9d76605fb461', 'easthaven', DATE '2025-11-03', null, 'Red function seems to stay on for a long time after the car is passed by. Changed the check valve in the tunnel and no more issue. Frank wants hot wax higher for the show. Tire shine had issues and they went through a lot more than normal (took 8 gal from Milford). Will make sure usage is good next week. Turned Graphene down a little bit because of high usage (Around 1500 on dosatron). Turned peak from 13 to 17 on VD '),
  ('144dbb11-4a11-41f6-99c2-aa0175e17d82', 'easthaven', DATE '2025-11-18', null, 'Performance Hi Ph was starting to chunk up. It wasn''t working for the front or rear banana foamers just basically water coming out. Replaced old Performance Hi Ph with brand new.  Frank cleaned out all of the check valves and versadial. '),
  ('c30e65e0-a976-4f90-a1f4-be447cf51b1d', 'easthaven', DATE '2025-12-02', null, 'Turned down gold from 18 to 17. Turned up red from 18 to 19. Turned peak lo from 13 to 15. Turned up lo Phoam from 26 to 27. Frank was doing some work in the tunnel and wanted to put check valves on the lo phoam thinking it might work better. Will keep an eye on it going forward. '),
  ('fadc0bb2-bdf1-4a9b-8e6d-66a56327fc76', 'easthaven', DATE '2025-12-16', null, 'Track was sped up so some things are not pulling as much. Such small differences in Graphene will be hard to track. Show is good. Frank wants to make small adjustments. Spoke about the report and usages'),
  ('b6f821f2-bef5-4cad-be22-c689f5eebc85', 'easthaven', DATE '2025-12-29', null, 'Can''t raise the colors due to the cars still having soap on them when they leave the tunnel. Show is still pretty good. Graphene hard to tell with such a small amount of cars. Had an issue with the air regulator for the wrap (peak lo). Frank put in a temporary fix but adjusted the VD from 13 to 16'),
  ('c8730601-6797-4dc0-ac7f-75747c361f98', 'easthaven', DATE '2026-01-13', null, 'Peak lo live pulls are 5 mls. Had issues with air regulator so that''s the reason for lower amount. X55 live pull is 12 mls Everything else is running well and smooth. '),
  ('9e1bf10a-6675-4035-9899-377d0c24eeb6', 'easthaven', DATE '2026-01-27', null, 'Cleaned the VD filter and X55 is pulling at 12 mls per car. Infusions eye sight seems to be crystalizing. In the reservoir, it looks fine with no issues so I put the line in the reservoir directly. HWS is pulling around 7 mls per car. Flash wax is high for the show. '),
  ('6d7778a3-422f-4e4c-9660-ec9ea2df61f8', 'easthaven', DATE '2026-02-10', null, 'Graphene had such small amount of cars. Live pull was 10 ml. Peak can''t be higher because it leaves soap on the car. Live pull was 7 mls. Flash Wax is needed higher for the show. Gold will be monitored but the live pull was only 3 mls. '),
  ('c10c6e91-de85-4b15-a916-a54b15d81d57', 'easthaven', DATE '2026-02-20', null, 'Everything was working pretty well. Tire shine usage is always high here. Show looks good here but was only able to watch a couple cars because of the rain. Will be back early next week. '),
  ('f2086038-92bd-4980-9283-71d8ba952762', 'easthaven', DATE '2026-03-10', null, 'Show looks good. Everything is working well. They fixed one of the wraps so soap isn''t staying on the cars nearly as much. Will monitor the colors but show looks pretty good. Can''t turn them up too high because it won''t rinse off well. '),
  ('4b76e1ce-2883-4eeb-8fad-3f735da2964e', 'easthaven', DATE '2026-03-24', null, 'Turned up drying agent from 21 to 22 on VD. Was only 8 mls per car and cars were coming out wet. Everything else looked good. Can''t turn the peak lo up because it won''t wash off well. Bug was very high, Frank thought some was taken from the site but hadn''t been there to know for sure. '),
  ('72576364-a445-45b6-8f58-59fa61431836', 'easthaven', DATE '2026-04-07', null, 'All usage is low except for the bug. Track speed has been changed a lot. But the show looks good. '),
  ('896f3179-db59-45b7-b18f-42cf99142d9a', 'easthaven', DATE '2026-04-21', null, 'Touch screen in the tunnel wasn''t working so about 1000 cars went through with works plus so tire shine is extra high. Everything is looking good. Usage for performance came down a lot recently but still a good show. Couple of items need a lower usage to ensure it washes off. '),
  ('3197e88a-964f-4d3d-bb3d-ceeeda382977', 'easthaven', DATE '2026-05-05', null, 'Everything was working well. Don''t want to put soaps up too high because they have issues washing them off. The last two blowers weren''t working well upon arrival and I let Tylor know and he said he would look into it. '),
  ('45822c22-a4a2-45ab-8814-12fde0524cdf', 'easthaven', DATE '2026-05-19', null, 'Everything is running well. Tire shine needs to be higher for Frank. Turned some of the soaps down because they weren''t washing off. '),
  ('449dd184-a18d-414a-9924-31e0c8b19897', 'easthaven', DATE '2026-06-03', null, 'Dials were changed and being messed with a little bit. The show looks good. They know stuff is low but turning up the soaps makes it hard for them to wash off, so that''s the reason for the low usage. '),
  ('1762ef5b-7417-4dd4-8550-cac0dc406def', 'easthaven', DATE '2026-06-15', null, 'Tip in bug remover line slowed it down drastically. Peak lo looks really good even with lower pulls. Don''t want to have colors too high because they don''t wash off and leave a soapy car. '),
  ('09147f74-7fc0-4193-8801-c0c59dc76cda', 'easthaven', DATE '2026-07-01', null, 'Ceramic didn''t pull anything. I changed the line and foot valve and it pulled up with no problems. '),
  ('220153c2-5827-430e-8652-7a6bf9068f76', 'easthaven', DATE '2026-07-14', null, 'Everything is working well. Car has good coverage, washing off no soap left on the cars. Had issues with the wrap it was taking off some of the back wipers, Tylor knows and they will have maintenance look at it to figure out the issues.'),
  ('5c566038-3592-4fa5-a535-a02c5f86a12b', 'easthaven', DATE '2026-07-29', null, 'Wash is looking great. Great coverage drying pretty well. No issues with the smell. They didn''t have any customer complaints'),
  ('13386a42-29c6-40e3-bef7-a58939ba2d8d', 'easthaven', DATE '2026-08-12', null, 'Show looks great. Final rinse was clogging a little bit but Tylor cleaned it out and it was working better. Functions are working well. '),
