  ('afba91d7-dcf5-4fd6-a23c-b0ad02ced374', 'fairfield', DATE '2025-05-20', null, null),
  ('7411de95-2414-491c-96a9-23e05643224d', 'fairfield', DATE '2025-06-03', null, null),
  ('31d5eeab-ea27-4577-93ae-4a18b78286ab', 'fairfield', DATE '2025-06-20', null, null),
  ('20b5bc6c-2985-4728-a46f-8fe47421340c', 'fairfield', DATE '2025-07-03', null, null),
  ('d666a7a7-ac4d-46ae-9aa3-81512880c5ef', 'fairfield', DATE '2025-07-18', null, null),
  ('ddf640e5-c6c5-4252-878f-333002d0acc3', 'fairfield', DATE '2025-08-01', null, 'Tire shine usage is high. This product is also used for detail. '),
  ('c16e4dd2-2429-42de-accb-51969cd449b1', 'fairfield', DATE '2025-08-14', null, 'Mangaer mentioned functions needed to be left on continueos loop because of an error in the system for a brief time, likely causing a chemical usage increase for this report. '),
  ('5dfe7fb6-1bc1-4b54-87d8-127154723961', 'fairfield', DATE '2025-08-28', null, null),
  ('3d5fa87f-e19d-492d-b39d-e32f5a5feedd', 'fairfield', DATE '2025-09-12', null, null),
  ('cce02221-b39b-47b5-a99c-6b4e70e684bf', 'fairfield', DATE '2025-09-25', null, null),
  ('17658563-c640-4bfc-b753-2ec0ebb49658', 'fairfield', DATE '2025-10-14', null, null),
  ('68bbfb49-d5a2-4958-941f-b11c57f5c4f7', 'fairfield', DATE '2025-11-07', null, 'Polish: Increased VD setting for the Blue (VD16). Lowered Vd for Yellow (VD14). Hot Wax: Function is turning on at the beggining of the wash and remains on until car is through the wax function. Mechanic is sceduled to address this issues. - High usage because of this. '),
  ('2b2932be-9177-4868-a41f-8477bac2ca74', 'fairfield', DATE '2025-11-21', null, null),
  ('40fdf3cc-c7cb-42e0-98c9-6d28b6272d0d', 'fairfield', DATE '2025-12-05', null, null),
  ('793cd84d-6d6b-419f-ab97-3a123d74e009', 'fairfield', DATE '2025-12-18', null, 'The blue was is evening out from last visit where it showed 0 usage. Turned protect up from 10 to 11 on VD'),
  ('ac01b42f-882e-4cda-976b-6556a06f07d1', 'fairfield', DATE '2025-12-30', null, 'Doesn''t want a drop off because he will be over budget. Show looks pretty good. Won''t change the colors because it was such a small amount of cars it''s almost impossible to track in those reservoirs. '),
  ('3e2bd53a-ae27-4c3a-a37f-27c4b78a8e76', 'fairfield', DATE '2026-01-15', null, 'Not using HWS on every car. Live pulls of Lo Phoam were 11 mls. No other issues. Cars were beading up nicely. '),
  ('1e913478-e75c-44fb-aaa1-39b7e38ec465', 'fairfield', DATE '2026-01-29', null, 'With such small usages for blue and gold it''s hard to be exact with these reservoirs. Cleaned out the VD filters for lo Phoam and x55 and turned up VD on X55 from 17 to 19. '),
  ('2c0a6520-3eab-49ea-9f1f-5c0bf2119e1a', 'fairfield', DATE '2026-02-12', null, 'Turned VD from 19 to 21 on x55 for 10 mls per car. Lo Phoam was pulling 10 mls per car when tested. Hot wax looks good. Turned sealer wax up from 11 to 13 on VD. Colors look good. Live pull was only about 5 mls with such small usage it''s hard to track in these reservoirs. Also dropped 5 gal of SaltX'),
  ('0f376bb8-1047-4748-ba48-c36fa008ecd3', 'fairfield', DATE '2026-02-26', null, 'Show was good. Cars were coming out a little wet so I turned up the X55 up to 23 on VD. Pullling 10 mls per car. Also, fixed the kids guns going into the blue, new foot valve and line. '),
  ('ad310b18-1a39-45a5-8c76-91b02f9495ba', 'fairfield', DATE '2026-03-12', null, 'Not using the wheel cleaner on every car. It was also basically empty cleared line when I arrived. X55 is low but that ran out for 2 days when Oscar wasn''t around. No cars when I was here but it was drying cars well according to Oscar. '),
  ('81ad6940-7e44-48ea-a2d7-5e232c96319d', 'fairfield', DATE '2026-03-26', null, 'Will replace the ceramic with Slipstream in reservoir, it was really thick and not pulling. Colors are working. I live tested them and they look good but with only 95 washes it won''t move anything visibly in the reservoir. Tire usage was high but everything is done by hand '),
  ('9aacf600-a79d-48fe-b404-acc240c9296d', 'fairfield', DATE '2026-04-10', null, 'Sealer wax is low because when I arrived the line was disconnected. Tire shine is high but all hand applied and it goes on all details which are not accounted for. Cars are coming out dry '),
  ('00dc0d50-5117-42a9-b447-63574685beb5', 'fairfield', DATE '2026-04-23', null, 'Everything was good. The report had the wrong starting quantities so all the usages look way off. '),
  ('dda8c1e3-2fba-4b9d-b9f2-403aa4b5fa8f', 'fairfield', DATE '2026-05-07', null, 'Colors look good. Aren''t pulling that high but they only used .25 gallons. Will monitor the drying agent and lophoam as it starts to get warmer. '),
  ('98e9ba63-94ea-451d-9302-dc778540b2f2', 'fairfield', DATE '2026-05-21', null, 'Turned down the drying agent to 21 on VD and lo Phoam to 31 because of high pulls. Flash wax is low but it looked good and pulled around 8 mls on live tests after turning down the air. '),
  ('f4d19b3c-03e1-4e64-a215-0357fc4a10e3', 'fairfield', DATE '2026-06-03', null, 'Wash was looking good. Turned up the flash wax on the dosatron a little bit to increase the show. Cars were coming out pretty dry with lower X55 usage. '),
  ('c0a3b88b-91f6-43a4-9ca9-39db831e204b', 'fairfield', DATE '2026-06-18', null, 'Drying agent was pulling high. I turned it down from 21 to 19 on VD. Cars are still coming out dry. Will monitor usage on the drying agent. '),
  ('769420a4-fc2b-4ada-ae2f-ae888ac4592e', 'fairfield', DATE '2026-07-02', null, 'Tire shine is higher because they are doing more details. All hand applied. Turned up the flash wax a little bit. Colors are good such small numbers is hard to track. Cars are coming out dry and shiny'),
  ('bfb649cb-4edc-4907-9017-5e15d9883278', 'fairfield', DATE '2026-07-16', null, 'Turned down the flash wax and x55 because of higher usage. Details have picked up so tire shine usage is a lot higher,  all applied by hand '),
  ('140fd8f4-5d4a-4f64-9136-5a1186864779', 'fairfield', DATE '2026-07-30', null, 'Tire shine all hand applied and it goes on details. Usage always shows high. Turned down the protect and drying agent a little on VDs. Lophoam is also used in the tunnel for prep. '),
  ('e0b6e690-6193-451a-bca9-8039f66e4d98', 'fairfield', DATE '2026-08-13', null, 'Turned down the X55, lo phoam and protect a little bit because of the usage being a little high. Show looks good. Oscar said they were staying busy. '),
  ('e8664e70-141d-4332-a965-f753142d8870', 'southeast', DATE '2025-06-02', null, null),
  ('b96db700-260b-439e-ac8c-039c3d2b5122', 'southeast', DATE '2025-06-17', null, null),
  ('0f8ba91c-c025-4454-865e-3da2812a59a2', 'southeast', DATE '2025-07-15', null, null),
  ('aee0ecb7-6623-4256-95c7-715e02a669e1', 'southeast', DATE '2025-07-29', null, 'CTA remains out of commission. Usages are higher but all applications look better then ever, especially the wax. Cars are drying well. '),
  ('6914f3f7-dc4e-4a19-95ca-fb3f29fbd16b', 'southeast', DATE '2025-08-12', null, null),
  ('51c015a4-6b6b-47d9-b3a3-6182ece45364', 'southeast', DATE '2025-08-26', null, null),
  ('d7af8f42-bade-489c-8d55-503f01838fab', 'southeast', DATE '2025-09-09', null, null),
  ('0ab2761a-946a-4f10-8da3-1b860c6fca7a', 'southeast', DATE '2025-09-22', null, null),
  ('75f3f24b-b627-4d19-8e76-11f9e673deb6', 'southeast', DATE '2025-10-09', null, null),
  ('2a1929ea-81b0-486f-9cae-d67db8301e9c', 'southeast', DATE '2025-10-20', null, 'Changed out Sonny''s Graphene for Slip Stream.'),
  ('d148b6c2-1b09-4987-a098-941da61fa45d', 'southeast', DATE '2025-11-04', null, null),
  ('04955dd9-4ea2-4bc5-810a-bda0b1d6ecbc', 'southeast', DATE '2025-11-18', null, 'Cleaned generators for Triple polishes and Hot Wax. Reminded Manager to do routine cleaning heading into the winter months. Build up happens quickly for functions connected to the reclaim. '),
  ('66a2b04d-2157-4094-8396-518fe03d2748', 'southeast', DATE '2025-12-02', null, null),
  ('3c3678eb-f785-48f6-9a77-a238df9fda87', 'southeast', DATE '2025-12-16', null, null),
  ('e10c57f9-b34a-4b39-8fd9-3f8db13a8f5e', 'southeast', DATE '2026-01-05', null, null),
  ('630b8f54-33b6-4503-bc37-be7307d17c85', 'southeast', DATE '2026-01-20', null, null),
  ('353dbe8a-ea88-4a37-9781-7d8ba3c45a77', 'southeast', DATE '2026-02-17', null, null),
  ('54d8d6ba-e811-4955-9dee-56327b18c4bf', 'southeast', DATE '2026-03-02', null, 'Maintenance & Adjustments Summary

Drying Agent

Cleaned drying agent nozzles

Cleaned VersaDial tips and adjusted parameters

Sealant and drying agent both set to 10 mL

Fragrance Line

Line was not submerged in the container

No chemical was being used

Presoak

Cleaned clogged nozzles

Increased VersaDial to 22, bringing usage closer to target

CTA

Increased VersaDial to 18, bringing usage closer to target

Tire Shine

Usage was high

Adjusted application to every 2 cars'),
  ('324e1510-9983-43ce-bb96-93a88f27c51c', 'southeast', DATE '2026-03-17', null, 'Scent: High usage. Reduced VD from 20 to 11. Pull usage at 4mls.  CTA: Replaced broken nozzle and increased VD to 24 to bring usage closer to target. First foam: Reduced VD to 22 from 31 going into the spring- less chemical needed without sal t residue in the water. Increased air to 45psi. These changes improved applicaton. '),
  ('86636a67-389d-4ae5-96b0-f63160861fdb', 'southeast', DATE '2026-03-30', null, null),
  ('576c45a1-d0e6-444f-8509-3d9c9d121d65', 'southeast', DATE '2026-01-13', null, null),
  ('db4cc9cd-0d44-4caf-a5a9-554228d94519', 'southeast', DATE '2026-04-27', null, 'Hi ph- Bumped VD to 19. Reduced to hit target usage. FWW- high usage. Lowered VD to 10. Notifies manager that wax bar needs cleaned. Tireshine- high usage. Manager  as not in to discuss details. PLC was set to every day care at .5sec. Possible solenoid issue caused the high usage. Tunnel- Noticed tunnel had a strong odor at times. We will monitor smell in the next weeks as weather warms.'),
  ('12c06780-ab08-4208-9527-d34c0b62c4dd', 'southeast', DATE '2026-05-08', null, 'Wax: Removed and cleaned Wax bar and generators, including Yellow polish banana foamer attached to the bar. Adj. presoak nozzles'),
  ('0694574e-6bf7-45ba-8efb-0676ec858c2e', 'southeast', DATE '2026-05-21', null, 'Notified Management that Drying agent, rinse and polish were turning on 7 seconds to late, beginning at the windsheild of vehicles. IT was on site to address this problem. '),
  ('2b72c775-d590-455c-a69f-74a8f7694315', 'southeast', DATE '2026-06-04', null, null),
  ('b80fcbee-0490-4081-8af3-abf4e533c901', 'southeast', DATE '2026-06-17', null, 'Cleaned a few clogged nozzle for rinse and drying agent arch. Scent: Turned up VD from 9 to 11. Usage is closer to target. Tire Shine: High usage. Dwell time: .5 and .6 sec. Skip count: 2 cars..  PSI: Lowered from 70 to 50 psi to reduce amount of product being applied. Triple polish: Cleaned generatos. '),
  ('af119ad1-424b-491b-8feb-30559eb5b5a8', 'southeast', DATE '2026-07-01', null, null),
  ('46cd1eed-35f4-47cf-9568-e621da867dba', 'southeast', DATE '2026-07-15', null, 'Adj. direction and cleaned presoak nozzles'),
  ('6702f6cf-6f87-4ac3-a19e-d9f3b0613ce2', 'southeast', DATE '2026-07-29', null, null),
  ('978c5698-2f7c-4343-96ab-c99b9e77c15f', 'southeast', DATE '2026-08-12', null, 'Drying Agent: Reduced Vd to 23. Pull shows usage at 14mls, cars are breaking well. Presoak: High usage. Lowered Vd from 17 to 12. Pull shows usage at 6mls. First Foamer: Weak applicaiton. Injector was clogged with debries. Cleaned and returned to service. Lowered PSI to 25. Application is much better. '),
  ('9ecdc90e-77d7-4cfd-b527-b57e8a0e02c0', 'greenwich', DATE '2025-05-26', null, null),
  ('0fd09c0c-c0b7-42b2-9529-13fae6cd378f', 'greenwich', DATE '2025-06-05', null, null),
  ('667e0f8a-d3b6-45bb-90e2-b331b0182935', 'greenwich', DATE '2025-06-18', null, null),
  ('00d85a06-c734-46f4-b764-b0f9f6bc196f', 'greenwich', DATE '2025-06-28', null, null),
  ('11210b22-2657-4c2d-a5ec-e0e20cf9a691', 'greenwich', DATE '2025-07-12', null, null),
  ('221d4dbb-8afa-4df7-8fe5-03de237a84cc', 'greenwich', DATE '2025-07-30', null, 'HWS: Express Tuneel CTA and Hand Wash Thumb guns tip size was changed to White. Usage is higher on this report.'),
  ('17165172-15b6-43e1-a77c-1219a1bed273', 'greenwich', DATE '2025-08-11', null, 'Manager (Leo) reported a single customer complaint about the wheel cleaner dulling plastic on a vehicle. As a precaution, washers are now instructed to avoid spraying mirrors and window trim. Both CTA and thumb guns are equipped with white tips, and Leo confirmed wheel cleaning performance is good at the current dilution.

Wax: Increased wax for hand wash — previous application was watery. Set VD to 9. Lowered express side wax from 10 to 9 to balance the change.'),
  ('4bf6190e-088e-4c53-b827-3a561ab95d45', 'greenwich', DATE '2025-08-22', null, 'Express Wash – Lava Foamer

Reduced injector size from 12 GPM to 8 GPM. No major difference in application noted, but the smaller injector helps reduce water usage.

Increased VD to 31; current usage is approximately 13 mL.

Installed a new foot valve and added a check valve in the chemical line to prevent siphoning. (Siphoning was causing air gaps in the chemical line, which affected application performance.)

Application performance has improved and is now more consistent.'),
  ('2e921778-565f-40a6-a46a-6eba616b5bac', 'greenwich', DATE '2025-09-10', null, null),
  ('b1068489-36f5-442c-ab9e-920c68b75e44', 'greenwich', DATE '2025-09-23', null, 'Leo noticed algae growth at the exit of the tunnels. Told him to clean surface with chlorine based product and pressure wash and then check the results. Cloudy days and nice weather may be a likely contributer to this. '),
  ('c6439fc5-cdff-49c9-8dfb-11fe07c1cae9', 'greenwich', DATE '2025-10-08', null, null),
  ('370d5edb-3016-4333-8742-df3b1178bbaf', 'greenwich', DATE '2025-10-22', null, 'Express: Wax Bar was clogged — removed and cleaned the bar and generators. Function is now applying normally.
Foamer: Increased Versadial to 30 to improve foaming application; product was applying watery at 27.'),
  ('28755104-96e1-4966-9e56-e90a5017ca84', 'greenwich', DATE '2025-11-05', null, 'Express Tunnel- Wax: Usage remains high. Lowered Versadial (Vd) setting from 11 to 9 to bring us closer to target.

First Foamer: Function was only dispensing 5 ml. Swapped out Versadials—now dispensing 9 ml, with improved application.

Foaminator Air Valves: Manager is ordering air valves to be installed before each Foaminator generator. This will allow better air-flow control and improve product application.

Scent: Reached out to Noah regarding the service request to install a scent shot in the express tunnel.'),
  ('d6b2f67c-a858-4e4c-8116-a73a3d9906c4', 'greenwich', DATE '2025-11-19', null, null),
  ('8a4f8d34-e3e4-496b-99cf-2e9513f10f69', 'greenwich', DATE '2025-12-03', null, null),
  ('fbbf669a-460c-4474-b93c-c02db7aa2b0f', 'greenwich', DATE '2025-12-18', null, 'Express: Manager disconnected scent because Foaminator wasn''t working properly. Scent valve was shut off. Reconnected scent to Foamer and  increased tip size to ultra pink. Function is working normally again.'),
  ('c75ba6a4-b65f-4c37-99a2-7114270626f4', 'greenwich', DATE '2026-01-05', null, null),
  ('a0fac09a-37d6-4156-be41-6d27dbb32aee', 'greenwich', DATE '2026-01-14', null, null),
  ('a41bfbc1-f86c-424e-8d20-9ccfa05569d7', 'greenwich', DATE '2026-01-27', null, null),
  ('c392fdc9-76aa-4fa0-a11a-eb822351c4e6', 'greenwich', DATE '2026-02-17', null, null),
  ('53b976fb-ec67-4a31-9380-4943d55d00de', 'greenwich', DATE '2026-03-02', null, null),
  ('a2ac0fbf-9190-470e-8992-d95289bbd766', 'greenwich', DATE '2026-03-12', null, 'Protect: Leo (manager) mentioned the cars dont come out as shiny as before. Recommended turning up Protect, since this chemical has low usage and would help the protect and shine the car. Increased Vd for both tunnels from 9 to 12. '),
  ('8a57e18b-8d99-4922-98c0-572184afb355', 'greenwich', DATE '2026-03-26', null, null),
  ('b9bc787c-30a2-4a72-9e17-6989d56a0fc3', 'greenwich', DATE '2026-04-08', null, 'Hand Wash: Tire cleaner: Testing "Results" as possible replacement for HWS. Using Blue tip. Express: Using HWS on Red tip.'),
  ('72aa4a62-e568-4ec6-b522-d34107d78903', 'greenwich', DATE '2026-04-21', null, null),
  ('6da5a908-7a06-4f42-9753-a4a884bdf647', 'greenwich', DATE '2026-05-04', null, 'Hand wash: Polish- Reduced yellow to 12. Usage is closer to target. Protect: Increased VD to 16. Brings usage closer to target. Express: Wheel boss was not extending far enough to impact tires. Increased psi 35psi. Brush is making contact. Gloss boss. Increased dwell time to 1sec for better tire shine application. Repleced a couple 3/8 couplings that were leaking, preventing proper tire shine application. Scent: line was disconnected from first foamer. Reconnected line.'),
  ('8e87b744-b335-4960-b6ea-736ba6c72a67', 'greenwich', DATE '2026-05-18', null, 'Scent: Cleaned clogged tip. Product is applying after cleaning. Prep thumb guns: Hand wash- Tan tip.  Express Wash: Light Blue. Customer does not consider new product "Result" satisfactory and wants to explore other wheel cleaning options. '),
  ('3f5c5a26-0713-406a-a45e-5d5376e0d86d', 'greenwich', DATE '2026-06-03', null, null),
  ('0d3374fc-35ec-458d-a8e3-0af161ad6030', 'greenwich', DATE '2026-06-20', null, 'Polish Red: Found a missing box, tweeking CPC a bit. Fww: Pumped down VD for both express and hand wash. Ceramic: Product was empty. Someone turnd up Vd for express side to 32. Causing excessive use of chemical.  '),
  ('8a286f3b-aa0d-402c-8cef-43db5a83ba9b', 'greenwich', DATE '2026-07-01', null, 'Installed Container for Graphene. Notified Leo Hot Wax and Ceramic bar need cleaned for both tunnels on a rainy day or after hours. Tire Shine: Lowered application time from1 sec. to .7 to reduce usage. '),
  ('fea69a96-f940-4070-8416-5a34894db2c7', 'greenwich', DATE '2026-07-15', null, 'FWW: Lowered Vd for both tunnels. HW- to 12 EW-7.    Lava: Lowered VD slightly for both.  Drying agent: Lowered VD slightly for both Tunnels.'),
  ('18479393-51c3-4d32-a917-99231415d0c3', 'greenwich', DATE '2026-07-29', null, ' Express Tunnel Wax - Removed and cleaned wax bar and inserts,  wax bar is watery, does not foam well. Tested Water: 2 tests showed 6 grains of hardness. This is high. Planning to test again on next visit. Protect (sealant)- High usage. Found VD at 16 on arrival for both sites. Lowered VD to 11 for both. Increased Drying agent to VD20 for both tunnels.'),
  ('5eb00aac-c256-4a43-9e42-97dc01321c06', 'greenwich', DATE '2026-08-12', null, null),
  ('7f97c918-3b6f-4dc2-89b1-1bc0771b770f', 'hamden', DATE '2025-06-10', null, 'Put on Protect. Triple foam still had inventory so not using yet. '),
  ('940bb046-077b-400c-91db-27bc9a55139e', 'hamden', DATE '2025-06-18', null, 'Set up the Bug Remover for 222. Hydrominder was not working. Changed the diaphram and it started working again and pulling chemical. Orange tip in the bug remover. '),
  ('04a8e644-f282-4060-afe6-e4719468cd78', 'hamden', DATE '2025-06-26', null, 'Drying agent usage is low. Live pulls were 7.5 mls and the water was beading up good. '),
  ('716045e8-c306-45d2-9461-a3d2ce0f50af', 'hamden', DATE '2025-07-02', null, 'X55 turned VD up 1 to  19. Dosatron for Salt X was leaking water bc of bad elbow - Carlos knew about it and is trying to replace'),
  ('d617223f-a55b-400a-971a-f8c58821ac9c', 'hamden', DATE '2025-07-14', null, 'Need to double check formula on flash wax. Only pulled 6 ml on live pull. Double check next week. '),
  ('92beafc8-8c25-4b31-86fb-51751b8f270f', 'hamden', DATE '2025-07-29', null, 'Tire shine was very thick like jelly. I put the new drum on and added foot valves to all lines. Carlos will keep an eye on it'),
  ('3055df84-5146-4472-9cf1-79a0d4c9c3f8', 'hamden', DATE '2025-08-14', null, 'Carlos was not here but I did get the numbers. Spoke to him on the phone and he said everything was running good. Everything looked good in the tunnel as well. '),
  ('746f3bdf-eb50-48c6-8444-7044bbb1afbe', 'hamden', DATE '2025-08-27', null, 'The flash wax was not coming out in the middle. Spoke to Carlos and he said they would clean it. Everything else is working well. '),
  ('cdebe6a2-1d30-4720-88db-409fb7d61c42', 'hamden', DATE '2025-09-09', null, 'Live pulls of Red were 2-3 mls (probably miss counted a jug last visit) Lo Phoam is being used in prep buckets as well. '),
  ('f3e29958-0364-4bb9-ad8f-78ec94431bfb', 'hamden', DATE '2025-09-24', null, 'Changed VD on gold from 15 to 13. To get 3 ml '),
  ('583a9308-ea88-4d96-a47a-77e4a3f4a6c6', 'hamden', DATE '2025-10-09', null, 'Dropped off infusions and Graphene. No dual injector to install infusions. Everything in the tunnel is running well. '),
  ('62ab902d-04e1-4816-97c7-0a92ed2eaece', 'hamden', DATE '2025-10-22', null, 'X55 : was 19 turned to 21 (10 ml). Blue : was 13 turned to 14. Protect : was 13 turned to 15 (6 ml). Changed bug remover to orange tip. Carlos did say it was broken. I do see guys not using the thumb gun when prepping cars and let Carlos know. Set up Graphene. Lo Phoam was turned up to15 ml to get the sheet.'),
  ('13737096-34c0-4a29-83f2-04a40c21232a', 'hamden', DATE '2025-11-03', null, 'Using bug remover but still very sparingly. It''s a quick like 1-2 second application. Protect went up a little but changing VD from 15 to 17. Turned red up from 13 to 14 and blue up from 14 to 15 to get more color. '),
  ('66261ecd-3cc0-44a2-9346-c669ec7f7752', 'hamden', DATE '2025-11-18', null, 'Turned blue up from 15 to 16 on VD. Turned up flash wax two spins (short of 1000). Tried to get a full sheet back but it seems very difficult with this product. Will bring a bigger injector to try next time. Nothing to connect infusions with. '),
  ('941c1c33-014d-4586-b046-28ac89e9b8de', 'hamden', DATE '2025-12-02', null, 'Lo Phoam is being used for buckets as well as higher usage trying to get a sheet. Turned flash wax to 1000 and turned red from 14 to 15. Turned X55 up from 21 to 23. Installed the infusions with a pink tip dual into the lo Phoam. '),
  ('08e5d9f1-a236-411c-a7e8-65f7a3cb6e8b', 'hamden', DATE '2025-12-16', null, 'Added lo Phoam to the prep gun per Anniba''s request. They don''t use the bug remover (thumb gun) much. Booster pump was not working for the hydro flex board. Turned up red gold and blue 1 on the VD '),
  ('86273097-9dbd-4d32-b825-d575127ea83c', 'hamden', DATE '2026-01-03', null, 'Turned Red up from 16 to 17 to get higher usage. Turned protect from 17 to 16 to lower usage. Jose said they just changed everything on HWS because it wasn''t working. Will look for usage to be back to normal. Lo Phoam is high because of using it for the prep gun. '),
  ('764ada3c-0b81-4bf8-a4b3-ef532ed584af', 'hamden', DATE '2026-01-13', null, 'Turned the air down on ceramic and changed the injector to a 3.5gpm from a 5.5gpm. Also, told Carlos to clean the generator and rain bar for the ceramic. Everything else seems to be working well with no issues. Lo phoam is even higher than before because its being used for the pressure washer. '),
  ('81394b19-d8a5-4d22-bd2f-8ab15035e9c9', 'hamden', DATE '2026-01-27', null, 'Not really using the bug remover. Cleaned out the VD filter on the blue and is working better with more color and cleaned out the filter for the drying agent as well. Turned up the hot wax a little. '),
  ('2c03b525-3fab-4434-bc24-bfb6f6e4e7c3', 'hamden', DATE '2026-02-10', null, 'Show looks good. Cars are drying off well. No issues. Carlos took out the line for the prep gun. Also, the infusions was bone dry. So the usage is low because no one filled it up. '),
  ('7eeed12f-fd41-4226-8983-667f2ecc5c16', 'hamden', DATE '2026-02-25', null, 'Only using bug for the mats nothing else. Still have 461 for ceramic. Protect pulled 5-6 mls on live pulls. May have used 1 box for something else. Live pull of x55 was 8-9 mls and it was beading up nicely. '),
  ('1afd7fa6-69c4-4925-bd35-86e333606bc4', 'hamden', DATE '2026-03-10', null, 'HWS generator in the tunnel isn''t working. Needs to be replaced. Carlos knows and ordered one to replace it. Bug remover usage will probably increase if the weather stays warmer. Cleaned out the filter on the lo Phoam. Cars are beading up nicely '),
  ('bb8aba06-648c-4dbe-a321-0bc3ce44ba91', 'hamden', DATE '2026-03-24', null, 'Talking about wanting to replace the wraps because they are barely touching the cars and causing some streaks. All the chemicals look good. They aren''t using the bug remover really. Very sparsely. '),
  ('23f20470-9f32-49ea-a2c0-f78c0a81c736', 'hamden', DATE '2026-04-07', null, 'Show looks good. No issues with anything chemical wise. They thought about turning up the Tire Shine because they want a better show on it but wanted to see usage first. Cars are drying well. Want to have them stocked for a good 2 weeks because lots of sun. '),
  ('2a39ce53-65d4-4b01-ba09-542f3d0271cc', 'hamden', DATE '2026-04-21', null, 'Tire shine usage is very high. They are using more out front because of the bigger brushes they are using. Everything else is working well. Bug is coming out nice but not using on every car. Springfield borrowed 22 gallons of tire shine, hence why only 8 gallons was "delivered". '),
  ('27d0fa18-7daa-4473-8e2f-fcbe452a215b', 'hamden', DATE '2026-05-05', null, 'Everything is looking good. They are having issues with the final rinse but Carlos knows about it. '),
  ('c3b2a544-f912-4cca-8c00-4181657c7d46', 'hamden', DATE '2026-05-19', null, 'Upon arrival infusions was empty and it stopped the lo Phoam from pulling through the Y-Splitter. I told Carlos to make sure he has infusions in the reservoir or it could happen again. Everything is working well besides that. Cars coming out dry. '),
  ('64dfda21-3470-492f-961f-d6b8fe87da62', 'hamden', DATE '2026-06-03', null, 'Everything was running real smoothly here. Cars were coming out dry so no need to up the drying agent. I let Carlos know if he sees cars coming out a little wet to turn it up on the VD. '),
  ('e812258e-1a75-4093-b3f6-4bc3441dc151', 'hamden', DATE '2026-06-15', null, 'Everything is working well and looks good for the show. Tire shine sometimes get complaints but are hitting the target and just being hand applied if questioned. They did not want to turn it up. '),
  ('36329a37-4a41-4b30-9b9c-8527e285fda0', 'hamden', DATE '2026-07-01', null, 'No issues. Car wash is looking good. Functions are working well. Bug remover is pulling high but I will monitor to see if the trend continues. '),
  ('37169dea-9e50-4216-9b0b-6f476e5fdb79', 'hamden', DATE '2026-07-14', null, 'Tipped down the bug remover from green to dark brown. We will monitor to see usage for next visit. Changed protect VD from 16 to 15.5 to lower usage. Show looks great. Everything is working well, cars are coming out dry. '),
  ('dfc262a8-b4fe-4cf4-88e9-45a674a89cb5', 'hamden', DATE '2026-07-29', null, 'Added the slipstream ceramic to the tunnel replacing 461. Also, infusions was empty upon arrival because of the split it doesn''t pull the lophoam near as much when the infusions is empty. Wanted as little of a drop off as possible. '),
  ('b2111522-fbf5-4c73-8f6c-ed3c2f19ad72', 'hamden', DATE '2026-08-12', null, 'Show looks good. HWS wasn''t pulling correctly, cleaned out the VD and filter and live pulls were 8mls. Also turned down the air because it was too high. Turned down the protect 0.5 on VD to lower usage. Cars are coming out dry so no need to increase the X55 at this time. '),
