  ('53d23811-72e7-486d-9f14-770fa3de97f6', 'guilderland', DATE '2025-10-17', null, null),
  ('c9241183-52b4-4388-bf68-09e7f64b7651', 'guilderland', DATE '2025-10-31', null, null),
  ('f76a1a42-0602-43b0-b69a-fb86b0b68d79', 'guilderland', DATE '2025-11-14', null, null),
  ('76303f43-7b39-4ab4-9ae1-f53d7130ab99', 'guilderland', DATE '2025-12-11', null, 'Graphen- Function is turning on for every car. Informed manager and Noah of the issue. DO extra Bug remover from Wash Boss'),
  ('12538b1b-117b-448f-a4b4-0bbfd1444b27', 'guilderland', DATE '2025-12-19', null, null),
  ('010c6fd6-a09d-420a-bb1a-46721a926a09', 'guilderland', DATE '2026-01-09', null, 'Sealant: Fixed leaking line with coupling. Reset flipped breaker for passenger gloss boss brush. Brush was not turning. Missing report from 1/9/26. Did car count from 12/19/25. Report  may not be as accurate over that length of time. '),
  ('b052d542-f895-459e-9712-08affdd27d02', 'guilderland', DATE '2026-02-21', null, 'Dropped of generator insert and check valves. Help manager replace a few banana foamers for triple foam, for a better application.'),
  ('eb56d975-e491-4b86-aaf3-bb03becdf151', 'guilderland', DATE '2026-03-03', null, 'Triple Foam Dash:

Installed new check valves for the Hydroflex system.

Installed additional check valves at the generators in the tunnel to prevent water from receding back into the line.

Blue Foam:

Replaced the 1.0 GPM (red) injector with a 1.5 GPM (orange) injector because the product was not applying properly.

Increasing the water volume improved the chemical application and foam performance.

Red Foam:

A 1.5 GPM injector was not available during this visit.

We will bring and install one on the next service visit.'),
  ('4b1452f8-b53a-4353-a919-e91bd8f2f101', 'guilderland', DATE '2026-03-27', null, null),
  ('b5a5e6a1-394f-47aa-a43e-8068d2fe71ef', 'guilderland', DATE '2026-04-20', null, null),
  ('287f9923-a230-4e62-9a6e-a42b4d5040be', 'guilderland', DATE '2026-05-11', null, 'Reduced Tire shine dwell time to .6 seconds for front brushes- tire shine was building up on the ground. Tire shine is being applied on every car. '),
  ('eb63b747-bbba-4b29-ba70-d00f232b5e8d', 'guilderland', DATE '2026-05-28', null, 'Tire shine: dwell time- .5 seconds/ skips 0 cars Graphene: installed container dosatron 1:500'),
  ('02fcf708-3462-4584-877b-6bab1699f9a0', 'guilderland', DATE '2026-06-22', null, 'Tire shine:Leaking fitting was wasting chemical on the ground. Replaced fitting. Triple Foam: Red application was watery. Replaced generator inserts for Red Foamers. Old generators were solidified and missing mesh.'),
  ('9dd654a9-433c-4e79-a20b-4ddb836e2b07', 'guilderland', DATE '2026-07-06', null, 'Tire shine: Driver side- Replaced leaking 3/8th union that was dripping product on the floor. Replaced chemical line. '),
  ('309ed83d-71f0-402b-a452-227c82853822', 'guilderland', DATE '2026-07-30', null, 'Polish blue- reduced VD to 14 to bring usage closer to target. Presoak: Reduced VD to 17; bringing usage closer to target.'),
