  ('33a4e371-e574-46c0-b3d6-eb2066d730f8', 'maple_shade', DATE '2026-05-19', null, 'Initial site setup. They are currently using t and e tire shine'),
  ('360f1dc4-bd2e-4396-83fa-9e5255795f0a', 'maple_shade', DATE '2026-06-26', null, null),
  ('627dadba-8ff6-41b2-85c9-518ab9bb1848', 'maple_shade', DATE '2026-07-22', null, 'The Cta''s are not working due to a mechanical issue. Most of the high cost items on this report are not controled by a machine. It is hand applied tire shine which is out of my control.'),
  ('fe752fbb-a6ea-4f3b-8411-48646809bd31', 'maple_shade', DATE '2026-08-13', null, null),
  ('37545609-038e-4f19-8bb9-67e77587df97', 'milford', DATE '2025-05-13', null, 'Bug remover usage seemed high, dosatron was 1:128. Shawn (Manager) says everythings been running good. No complaints from customers. '),
  ('ed4c021b-01a6-40a9-8acb-a59559b8fdf9', 'milford', DATE '2025-05-22', null, 'Didn''t count some boxes in cabinets (LoPhoam, Performance, Peak Lo) '),
  ('c4ceca14-b24c-4da0-a74a-62146806f372', 'milford', DATE '2025-05-29', null, 'Triple foam lowered. Soap was sticking in the mirrors. Everything else is good. '),
  ('c407bc1e-394a-4a86-bc8c-7551cf078146', 'milford', DATE '2025-06-11', null, null),
  ('7cc974a5-7c07-4c8b-b886-f574f7a4acf4', 'milford', DATE '2025-06-19', null, 'Everything looks good usage wise. Tunnel looks good as well. Tire shine is a little high but want to look at it next week. Shawn thinks it''s on for too long. '),
  ('00771664-2af0-462c-bbdb-283921f23d82', 'milford', DATE '2025-06-27', null, 'Everything was working good. No issues at all. '),
  ('f3d6f199-f106-40d0-ae9f-a8ab4970bd76', 'milford', DATE '2025-07-02', null, 'Sean didn''t think Protect was working well. Line into the tunnel doesn''t look clean. Will keep an eye on it. '),
  ('f71e34c1-7cdf-4936-8f12-d2b4731d8561', 'milford', DATE '2025-07-15', null, 'Derby had to borrow 5 gal of Flash Wax - reason it''s showing high usage. '),
  ('886bfabf-7faa-499b-8ca9-61f5084da223', 'milford', DATE '2025-07-24', null, 'Protect not turning off. It stays on for extended time. Has to be a timing issue. '),
  ('240d20d9-c41d-494f-9649-8ab57095312f', 'milford', DATE '2025-08-04', null, 'Live pulls of flash wax were pulling 7-8 ml (VD 8). Sean was not here. Cars were coming out dry show looked good. No issues with anything. '),
  ('2e265c61-adb7-4ae1-95c4-2a1bd5202aaa', 'milford', DATE '2025-08-11', null, 'There was a $5 works sale that happened over the weekend. Stopped in to make sure they were good with chemical. No issues. Dropped off a little bit of chemical. Will be back next week. '),
  ('80771a84-6dfa-4377-b61d-005c674315e9', 'milford', DATE '2025-08-20', null, 'Sean was on vacation and the protect (VD 14) and bug remover (1:50) were turned up and that''s why the usages are high. We turned them back to what the original settings were because the cars were coming out clean and dry. (Bug 1:100) (Protect VD 7)'),
  ('c39d87ff-cc74-4643-9d6f-a3ce1b14a40b', 'milford', DATE '2025-08-25', null, 'Micrologics wasn''t working so we couldn''t get car counts. Will be back next week. '),
  ('6db1a7fd-f2a7-443b-ba10-ada83d51244f', 'milford', DATE '2025-09-05', null, 'Everything was working well. No issues. '),
  ('6404ca87-6952-4e31-a583-80c4c75b7b1b', 'milford', DATE '2025-09-16', null, 'Sean said the Protect was leaking out overnight so usage is high. He fixed the problem. Had an issues with cars not drying. Said the soaps were extra foamy, the problem was fixed by lowering the VD on Peak Lo, Lo Phoam, and Performance. Don''t know why everything was more soapy than before. Using pumpkin spice infusions as well. '),
  ('05cea3f0-b350-4c2f-9533-03926f4f59f0', 'milford', DATE '2025-09-29', null, 'Not using the infusions currently because they have pumpkin spice. Giving away free ceramics with other sign up packages so that''s why usage looks high. Everything else is pretty close to spot on. Cars are coming out dry. Show looks good as well. '),
  ('f9e223fe-5af1-49eb-8b79-2f06253cd8ab', 'milford', DATE '2024-10-15', null, 'Turn up ceramic from 14 to 16 on VD. Turn up peak lo from 12 to 15 on VD for live pulls of 5 ml. Everything looks really good. Cars are coming out dry. Graphene is already being used here. HWS gummed up throughout the reservoir and the line. Sean cleaned it out. Colors are coming out strong so no need to change. Also, they are using pumpkin spice scent so that''s why usage is 0 for infusions. '),
  ('df6f6ed7-8321-41a2-9822-48ef07dc6073', 'milford', DATE '2025-10-28', null, 'Not using infusions. Need hot wax to be higher for show. Live pulls of Lo Phoam are 5 mls. Turned up peak lo from 15 to 16 and live pulls were 6 ml. Using protect on 2 functions. '),
  ('ac422b02-dd4a-4ca9-9408-88fdabf79e72', 'milford', DATE '2025-11-12', null, 'East Haven borrowed some Tire Shine, reason for the negative delivery. No issues with anything everything seems to be working really well. Show is good. '),
  ('049b58ef-aa92-40a5-96e0-649dcd455b6c', 'milford', DATE '2025-11-25', null, 'Cars are coming out dry and beading up very nice. Turned up red and blue from 12 to 13 for a little higher usage. '),
  ('eb1b276d-7d0b-477a-bd81-eb113587ad20', 'milford', DATE '2025-12-10', null, 'Turned up Blue and Red to from 13 to 14 on VD. Turned ceramic up from 18 to 22. '),
  ('498be02e-9297-4273-b37f-17a02d117323', 'milford', DATE '2025-12-22', null, 'Turned up blue and red up to 15 from 14 and gold up to 13 from 12 on VD. Peak lo pulling 5-6 mls per car on test'),
  ('b7b80c12-d5da-4b21-893b-184d5e4a9001', 'milford', DATE '2026-01-08', null, 'Live pull of peak lo was 5 ml. Lo Phoam is crystallized/crusted up and stopped working, Sean cleaned the line and it''s working well again (not sure if something else was put into it)'),
  ('4c2f404b-cdee-4c48-8f81-b6ba6f1641d6', 'milford', DATE '2026-01-20', null, 'Live pull on drying agent is 9 mls. Cars are looking good. Everything seems to be working well. '),
  ('22f8a895-36c7-4ae0-a9ad-f4bd0a01714a', 'milford', DATE '2026-02-01', null, 'Everything was working really well. Cars are still coming out dry with using less drying agent. Live pulls were 7-8 mls per car. Site is very busy, did over 1000 cars the past 3 days and almost 1300 on saturday. '),
  ('0bb8643f-601f-4d4b-98ed-f53234cf97c1', 'milford', DATE '2026-02-18', null, 'Cars are coming out great. No issues. Drying agent was 7.5 mls live pull but cars are beading up and coming out dry ')
on conflict do nothing;

insert into inventory.site_visits (id, location_code, visit_date, submitter, notes) values
  ('6496003c-5877-486b-abd3-e0a56c83d2e3', 'milford', DATE '2026-03-03', null, 'Cleaned out the filter on X55 and is pulling a little bit higher and working a little better. Peak lo was turned up 1 on the VD to 16 for better show. '),
  ('c6995d33-891d-440d-be5c-f415c16b85a7', 'milford', DATE '2026-03-19', null, 'Track speed was raised so Sean turned up performance and peak lo. I told him he could turn it up more if needed. I changed the X55 from 22 to 23. Everything else looks good. Sean may adjust if there are any issues because of the increased track speed. '),
  ('1b4c9287-2c22-4b32-9c0f-9264d75d9f2e', 'milford', DATE '2026-04-01', null, 'Everything was working great and is right in line. I turned up the performance from 16 to 17 to get a little bit more soap on the car, but otherwise everything is great. '),
  ('ad9ed6ad-84fc-45aa-8131-e96191b7872b', 'milford', DATE '2026-04-14', null, 'One of the blowers is down so it''s leaving a little wetness on the cars. Chemical is all on targets and working well. '),
  ('145ed2bf-4932-486b-81de-44815c45e75c', 'milford', DATE '2026-04-27', null, null),
  ('139f538a-6ce7-4dae-a443-48925d323791', 'milford', DATE '2026-05-12', null, 'No adjustments necessary. Everything is working well. '),
  ('bab93824-1f84-4a02-9277-981e6e9a16c1', 'milford', DATE '2026-05-29', null, 'Turned down the HWS 1 on the VD. Cars were coming out dry and shiny. '),
  ('014390ad-894d-409b-a1de-1f9feb0d535c', 'milford', DATE '2026-06-09', null, 'Everything was working well. All numbers are being hit. They have been very busy. '),
  ('958a3561-368a-4046-87f1-1247eedaec9b', 'milford', DATE '2026-06-23', null, 'Cars are coming out shiny and dry. Peak lo needs to be a little higher for the show and getting the sides of the car. '),
  ('cf95330f-1091-43f8-a488-9a118d62c208', 'milford', DATE '2026-07-08', null, 'No car counts due to Kevin being on vacation just drop off. '),
  ('9e41e6c3-5332-4ab2-94dc-6bade75ab25f', 'milford', DATE '2026-07-22', null, 'Will monitor the numbers. Wash looks great. No issues. '),
  ('000ba9ce-0c48-4ef3-a5c5-fec7d4f7cbc0', 'milford', DATE '2026-08-04', null, 'Turned down peak lo. Was pulling 7-8 mls on live pulls '),
  ('d5d3c5ad-6a85-4026-a66e-0cecc2030b05', 'newhaven', DATE '2025-06-10', null, null),
  ('8df7a1d3-b61e-499e-8944-055f3acdbd20', 'newhaven', DATE '2025-06-18', null, 'Computer was down and couldn''t run car counts. Everything working well. Didn''t see any cars go through because of rain. Not using Flash Wax, Performance or Ceramic still. '),
  ('27fcc68d-8e94-4359-8c73-f887b2e78b4e', 'newhaven', DATE '2025-06-26', null, 'Starting inventory was incorrect. Will start with these numbers. Did not get car counts. '),
  ('cefafc57-45e6-439c-91d1-da52ddd72cf5', 'newhaven', DATE '2025-07-02', null, 'Dropped off product and did not update the inventory. Will prepare for numbers next visit. Usage numbers are incorrect. Computer was down on last visit and couldn''t run reports. '),
  ('78265634-1d89-484a-a521-4ea73815a6ec', 'newhaven', DATE '2025-07-14', null, 'Didn''t update starting quantities. Made drop offs after entered. Will add slipstream ceramic next visit. Tire Shine was empty before being changed. Tested Blue and it was coming out good in the tunnel. '),
  ('e3018809-cf7a-4690-b944-163a5efafb3f', 'newhaven', DATE '2025-08-04', null, 'Monitor the colors. Maybe wrong color was put into the wrong reservoir or it was miscounted. We are having a new starting point because the packages were incorrect. '),
  ('c03b945a-9deb-4019-9710-c64c2a757409', 'newhaven', DATE '2025-08-13', null, 'Changed the gold to a different purple tip. Will check in 2 weeks to see if usage is lower. Also changed performance from aqua tip to purple tip to lower usage. Will check on that as well. '),
  ('fc2f680d-4bb1-4693-9637-5df970a636bd', 'newhaven', DATE '2025-08-27', null, 'Put a pink tip into the gold instead of the purple tip because usage was still high. Performance usage came back down after being high. '),
  ('42607870-0a4f-43ea-ae71-484738b142e1', 'newhaven', DATE '2025-09-09', null, 'Wanted me to drop off as little as possible, they did run out of stuff and had to make an extra stop because they didn''t want too much. Hooked up the ceramic because they ran out of 461. '),
  ('307c6d17-f670-43be-8ce2-a38aaefffc02', 'newhaven', DATE '2025-09-24', null, null),
  ('fecbc01a-f945-428b-aa13-91a424388ed6', 'newhaven', DATE '2025-10-09', null, 'Added infusions (pink tip - live pull 2-3 ml) to the performance hi hydrominder. Also dropped off Graphene. Tire shine usage was very high. William didn''t know of any issues. Will monitor next visit. Nothing excessively spilling on the floor. Will continue monitoring the colors. They are coming down from where they were. '),
  ('1f659066-bee2-4308-918f-dc2e54378553', 'newhaven', DATE '2025-10-22', null, null),
  ('e610444f-eab2-41a5-a1a8-63f99a8aa8b5', 'newhaven', DATE '2025-11-03', null, 'Something leaked into the X55. Might have to turn up (William knows about it now, did not before) to get it working better because it''s now mixed with water.  Tipped down infusions from pink to ultra lean pink tip. Tipped down performance from purple to pink tip'),
  ('6fe9de7e-c120-44c9-8817-d3ae67fa9f59', 'newhaven', DATE '2025-11-19', null, 'Everything was running well. Computer was unavailable will get the numbers from William to check usages on everything. '),
  ('e27741e9-d83e-483b-9ac6-417b3e51decd', 'newhaven', DATE '2025-12-02', null, null),
  ('fe1685db-311b-4f36-8c21-efc6c3441979', 'newhaven', DATE '2025-12-16', null, 'Tip down the infusions from ultra lean pink to ultra lean purple. Tip up Perfomance from pink to purple. '),
  ('08678710-37d9-4a38-a322-17fc92c7ab55', 'newhaven', DATE '2026-01-03', null, 'Changed the performance tip back from a purple to pink. Changed the gold tip from pink to ultra lean light purple. Still wants little as possible drop offs'),
  ('9be2dbe6-0511-4838-9f6a-c218bb3077b5', 'newhaven', DATE '2026-01-13', null, 'Everything was working well. No changes were made. Tire shine usage was high. '),
  ('14b93b65-d91a-44f5-bb08-f37703da9525', 'newhaven', DATE '2026-01-27', null, 'Turned down drying agent because it was pulling high and wasn''t doing anything different when it was turned down lower. Performance came down. And colors look pretty good as well. '),
  ('e744df14-478b-4870-97a5-c50fc9aa416b', 'newhaven', DATE '2026-02-10', null, 'Ran top package for every car on William''s day off (about 450 cars). Also said red turned on every package. I told him to clean the generators for the colors. Cars are coming out dry. Everything is running pretty well. '),
  ('c16def83-015b-48e7-bfa6-53d138265c4c', 'newhaven', DATE '2026-02-25', null, 'Dosatron for x55 is not working anymore, so that is being replaced. Everything besides is working pretty well. Still wants as little as drop off as possible. I encouraged him to get a bigger drop off 1 time and he didn''t want it. '),
  ('0b4c4109-190e-4a90-bd19-7fed67c6e4c7', 'newhaven', DATE '2026-03-10', null, 'New dosatron is working great. Beading on cars really nicely. Turned down the flash wax a little bit. Show looks good. No issues. Tire shine is always a little high but doesnt look good if it''s lowered'),
  ('66fa00b2-53f1-46d8-af17-5dedccfaf025', 'newhaven', DATE '2026-03-24', null, 'Let William know to clean out the wax bar. But the show looks better than it has before and cars are coming out nice and dry '),
  ('3d873a8b-db10-4059-a8fc-05408ffb941b', 'newhaven', DATE '2026-04-07', null, 'Thumb gun for bug remover broke. Also the hot wax air regulator wasn''t working so it was only shooting out the sides. Rain bar was just cleaned. William said he had one and would change. Tried changing the check valves but that didn''t work. '),
  ('454df28e-aba0-4444-9f76-abb7e529a966', 'newhaven', DATE '2026-04-21', null, 'Will keep an eye on the performance. Did change the foot valve because it was going bad and suggested to clean out the generator. Tire Shine usage was really high. Everything else is working well. '),
  ('138ee2eb-42fa-455c-af82-b94c3e579fc6', 'newhaven', DATE '2026-05-05', null, 'Red wasn''t working. Lowered the air and now it''s working well. Flash wax is still having issues of full car coverage. Tire shine usage is high but turning it down will not result in good coverage. '),
  ('3a889ec5-5efc-4840-8c9d-07f6b594ae52', 'newhaven', DATE '2026-05-19', null, 'Changed a fitting and check valve because of a leak and also changed the foot valve on the lo phoam. Seems to be working a lot better than it was. Everything else is working pretty well. '),
  ('d39f732c-47ce-49ff-95fe-34e10f7c11ff', 'newhaven', DATE '2026-06-03', null, 'Live pulls on lo Phoam were at 9-10 mls. Not sure why it''s low. HWS timing was off. I let Aaron know. '),
  ('0128b201-4756-42b6-a8bd-c4686b40fcc4', 'newhaven', DATE '2026-06-15', null, 'Put a new air regulator on the flash wax because it wasn''t working and also cleaned out the rain bar but flash wax looks a lot better now.Also changed the foot valve on the infusions. Cars are coming out dry not going to change dosatron. '),
  ('fc748566-9f9d-45ab-870c-3284c6dd1528', 'newhaven', DATE '2026-07-01', null, 'Turned up the X55 and lo Phoam because of low usage. Live pulls of drying agent are right around 10 mls. '),
  ('86fd3ffc-3ac3-44a5-b521-ff47a596ff2c', 'newhaven', DATE '2026-07-14', null, 'Drying agent isn''t coming through on all the nozzles but Aaron knows and is working on it. Definitely a pressure issue for that arch. Changed the performance tip up from pink to purple because of low usage and now the show is a lot better. Tire shine usage is high as always. '),
  ('dc152207-c74d-47b4-a065-2dfdaa7a1a50', 'newhaven', DATE '2026-07-29', null, 'Solenoid for drying agent and wasn''t working. Is now fixed so usage should be back to normal next visit. Turned down the flash wax. Aaron will adjust the air pressure on the tire shine, they were cleaning out the tunnel. '),
  ('9d7728bf-4560-41c2-84d1-e72c6baa3327', 'newhaven', DATE '2026-08-12', null, 'Tipped up the HWS because of lower usage. Show looks pretty good. Tire shine usage is always high here. Drying agent is a little low but cars are coming out dry and the water is beading up nicely. '),
  ('001164f1-034f-453c-9e28-1de3fc83fd60', 'newark_ii', DATE '2026-05-18', null, 'initial site setup'),
  ('1528d8c6-39aa-4a64-9a42-aaa9eb1d5680', 'newark_ii', DATE '2026-06-01', null, 'Turned the drying agent down to recommended usage.'),
