  ('ea8f6fd7-3953-4173-862a-c9fb2420cf3b', 'newark_ii', DATE '2026-07-24', null, 'I replaced the flo jet on the white triple foam. Tire shine use is high due to it being applied by hand.'),
  ('054c5b39-9a93-4083-b92f-b22d7a69c025', 'norwalk', DATE '2025-05-16', null, 'Online- Drying agent, sealant, Foamer, Wax, Offline- Triple colors, Bug remover,'),
  ('f686c8bc-a270-4d7d-a42e-db18b427fc66', 'norwalk', DATE '2025-06-05', null, null),
  ('07521fce-8da1-45b6-9508-50dbc3ef22b7', 'norwalk', DATE '2025-06-20', null, 'Protectant: High Usage. Lowered VD to 10. '),
  ('ea2e9f9b-e7a3-4b15-89a0-55e621448e02', 'norwalk', DATE '2025-07-03', null, null),
  ('4a997f59-80f8-4acb-9328-f74d3f82267d', 'norwalk', DATE '2025-07-18', null, 'Wheel cleaner (Thumb guns): Increased tip size from green to blue. Workers complained product was not cleaning. This change should help. Ceramic: In order to use up the remaining Lustra 461, I connected product to the hotwax application. '),
  ('ef6f11c7-b2bd-456d-93f9-fd2e275b1a42', 'norwalk', DATE '2025-08-01', null, null),
  ('0155f9e3-eb47-41be-adab-dc4c3975b634', 'norwalk', DATE '2025-08-14', null, null),
  ('52a710c8-1c8f-4f1e-8783-952fe65e2dac', 'norwalk', DATE '2025-08-28', null, null),
  ('81c1327d-dd84-4c9d-a59d-f2f3f29a8c72', 'norwalk', DATE '2025-09-12', null, 'Wax: Lowered VD from 16 to 10 to bring us closer to targets. Foamer: Increased loPhoam slightly, while remaining aware of a chemical reaction issue with a worker in prior months. Moderating usage and results. '),
  ('aef0c781-b1f7-4e30-816e-7be3eb79054a', 'norwalk', DATE '2025-09-25', null, null),
  ('2fd923ce-7351-4c6d-ba4f-128959661c2f', 'norwalk', DATE '2025-10-14', null, null),
  ('aeb57297-f856-400a-aa38-be5194267e3c', 'norwalk', DATE '2025-11-07', null, null),
  ('3ff417c6-8c23-4354-8d28-e03d9353479c', 'norwalk', DATE '2025-11-21', null, null),
  ('89b29231-c483-42b2-8bcb-02ae35f39f2a', 'norwalk', DATE '2025-12-05', null, 'Hot Wax: Found usage at 45mls on arrival. Lowered Air pressure and reduced usage to 10mls. Application is working normally. Triple Polish: Lowered air pressure to 10psi. Spoke with German (manager) about cleaning our foaminator to improve show. Drying agent: Increased VD to 20. Usage at 10mls. Cars drying improved after this change. '),
  ('f2341675-4cfe-4877-8d0f-c20f6f18b4b1', 'norwalk', DATE '2025-12-18', null, 'Turned up lo Phoam from 27 to 28 on VD live pulls 11 ml. Turned up X55 from 10 to 12 on VD live pulls of 10 mls'),
  ('2f333dc8-cfd5-4423-8557-feb112d61f2a', 'norwalk', DATE '2025-12-30', null, 'Turned X55 from 20 to 22 to help dry and bead up on the cars. Also changed the foot valve, line, and filter for VD on ceramic to get it working again. It was having an issue pulling the chemical before. '),
  ('49da5069-9a15-4bed-94fb-71756779bc48', 'norwalk', DATE '2026-01-15', null, 'Turned lo Phoam up from 29 to 30 on VD. Flash wax pulled 8 mls live and looked pretty good. Colors need to monitor usage but small changes in amounts is hard to track. Put the ceramic into Sonnys reservoir - reason for the small adjustment. '),
  ('07d31bee-5cc6-436f-bb9f-7b3338d6a5e6', 'norwalk', DATE '2026-01-29', null, 'Turned lo Phoam from 31 to 32 on VD for better show. Pulling 13 mls. Turned flash wax from 8 to 9 on VD for better show. Protect was turned up from 17 to 18 on VD for higher usage. Cars were beading up nicely. '),
  ('bbab21af-4b3f-4e8a-86f2-76df0ec9e454', 'norwalk', DATE '2026-02-12', null, 'Not going to change HWS. I don''t think it''s being used every car still coming out strong from thumb gun. Not using as much tire shine because of the cold weather. Show looks pretty good otherwise. '),
  ('f50649fd-3ba1-4440-8da8-7fa3346d3cb5', 'norwalk', DATE '2026-02-26', null, 'Show looks pretty good. Live pulls of the flash wax are around 10 mls. Show looks good. Set up Graphene, hooked up new versadial. '),
  ('78476f29-655c-4b42-9f1f-0efb43489952', 'norwalk', DATE '2026-03-12', null, 'Will monitor the gold. It was coming out fine. Could have been a misread last visit. Shortened the X55 line and turned up from 22 to 23. Not using the bug remover'),
  ('82424a3f-2e12-413b-aa92-2f4436726494', 'norwalk', DATE '2026-03-26', null, 'Turned the air down on hot wax, it was turned up way too high. Told German to clean out the generator on the left side. Show was good and cars were coming out dry. '),
  ('512e2703-3b6a-47b9-b432-8ac784955dfe', 'norwalk', DATE '2026-04-10', null, 'Having issues with the tire shine and wants to switch to perfect shine. Will keep an eye on the colors but such low amounts are hard to track. Cars are coming out dry. Lo Phoam needs to be higher for the show. '),
  ('d1a4337c-6ac7-4f21-956c-c94895979f48', 'norwalk', DATE '2026-04-23', null, 'Everything is going well. they are starting to use more of the bug remover. Small car counts on colors but will keep an eye out on them. '),
  ('ee7919d6-b63d-4f85-9489-d697cd0d2d36', 'norwalk', DATE '2026-05-07', null, 'Turned drying agent down 1 on VD. Turned lo Phoam down .5 on VD but still needs to be higher for show. Flash wax looks good on show. Colors are pulling good they look high because of very little movement. '),
  ('b1408a49-6374-4208-b0cd-4c483d0b4cd6', 'norwalk', DATE '2026-05-21', null, 'Going to turn lo Phoam VD down 0.5 to lower usage. Still need higher usage for the show. Will monitor the triple foam. It looks pretty good but it is clogged a little bit. '),
  ('44d296df-4478-47a4-a571-3c692b5d9457', 'norwalk', DATE '2026-06-04', null, 'Lo Phoam live pull was 14 mls. Turned down X55 a half on VD. Turned down blue from 18 to 17 on VD. Wash looked pretty good. German will be changing the injector for the flash wax because its not working well and is going bad. '),
  ('f5037cc8-6715-43f9-a5ab-893c5dd0d223', 'norwalk', DATE '2026-06-18', null, 'I believe the colors were a miscount. Will monitor for next visit. Lo phoam has to have higher usage for the show. Transitioning back to Total Shine. '),
  ('e33207e7-42d8-4597-a0ed-5d722157c6cd', 'norwalk', DATE '2026-07-02', null, 'Small amounts for colors so I''m not going to change them. Turned down the protect and X55. Lo Phoam is getting used in buckets for prep so numbers look higher. '),
  ('68c25f25-9248-43d3-8b83-7dac78480bca', 'norwalk', DATE '2026-07-16', null, 'Turned down lo Phoam and x55 0.5 on VD to lower usage. Colors are also high because of kids guns. '),
  ('840d1786-9328-4842-8573-640166636ab0', 'norwalk', DATE '2026-07-30', null, 'Wash looks good. Everything is working well. No issues. Lo phoam has come down a little bit but will still be higher because of the show. '),
  ('1b5b6b00-25e4-4265-b2f7-2606d190c120', 'plattsburgh', DATE '2025-06-05', null, '5/16-6/4 Car count. '),
  ('8a647461-1bdd-4074-a2e5-33922fcfc2ab', 'plattsburgh', DATE '2025-06-18', null, 'bug prep usage is high and ineffective, will talk to the team about an alternative. '),
  ('535a29a5-9c65-4a9e-91a9-6cbdcd44ac57', 'plattsburgh', DATE '2025-07-02', null, '-pHWS2x still not hooked up.- Red and yellow Adjusted to pull 3mls'),
  ('3d3ceb0e-37c2-428b-8c0a-585c75150e32', 'plattsburgh', DATE '2025-07-22', null, '-Peak lo versadial was turned up to 20, not sure who made that adjustment, but I turned it back down to hit our target. - cars looked dry for the most part - They Prep the cars a lot here, working on adding banana foamers for the side of the cars, hopefully with this addition we dont have to depend so much on prepping. '),
  ('1cc42bd7-f677-43ff-9975-cc49b909c2df', 'plattsburgh', DATE '2025-08-06', null, '-Brown(dark) tip put in to replace Tan tip for bug prep. -yellow polish dailed down to hit 3mls -performance dialed down to hit 6mls'),
  ('473fda17-96e3-490f-9991-dae88b4cbb70', 'plattsburgh', DATE '2025-08-26', null, '-505 still online -tire shine dropped off, electrical, air and chemical lines still need to be installed- lava bar looked really bad, changed out the versadail and it did help it come out more consistant, rain bar need to be taken down and  cleaned.- lophoam swapped in for performace Hi --red polish turned up'),
  ('7923535b-da1f-4ef5-a6f5-b66c72bf8b47', 'plattsburgh', DATE '2025-09-15', null, '-Blue polish was faint turned up to 3mls -First foamimg rainbar(LoPhM) really struggling, Rainbar needs to be taken down and cleaned. - PLopH turned down - Tireshine still not operational -Undercarriage will use SaltX'),
  ('e39bdac4-0ad5-4ea5-9653-b2cb8de573fb', 'plattsburgh', DATE '2025-10-03', null, 'Performance not hooked up until banana foamers are installed for side application- HWS still offline- - ceramic shield installed - tire shine online now, air was off and lines had no foot valves'),
  ('f33ef59b-a5de-4559-81de-6a453d9bd844', 'plattsburgh', DATE '2025-11-04', null, '-PLC adjusted to skip 2 cars instead of one - blue polish increased - Lophm(LAVA) increased'),
  ('50601f92-aa78-4c93-9f54-84929e01ea8f', 'plattsburgh', DATE '2025-12-03', null, 'New arch for drying agent was put in and setting was turned up to 28, set at 21 pulling 10mls. Bugger wanst working, seems like it not getting enough water p[ressure, seal changed,yellow injector swapped in, new flo jet installed and still nothing. Will contact Steve and see if he can take a look at it.Triple foam turned up. -LoPhM increased.'),
  ('f3fc787f-f10a-45eb-867d-f64f55aa12fe', 'plattsburgh', DATE '2025-12-19', null, 'Graphene was installed at 6 mls dial set at 24, was breaking well, cars looked great. my concern is the position of the side blowers. Need to be adjusted up and pointing down on an angle.-footvlave for one tire shine line was above the chemical inside the drum. Water pressure  drops causing hydrominder for bug prep to be inconsistent.'),
  ('2eb54a8b-ff3a-434a-b184-3d9e01fd83cb', 'plattsburgh', DATE '2026-01-08', null, 'Still waiting on numbers'),
  ('e2878c2b-025f-4fff-a31a-8d65402a92ff', 'plattsburgh', DATE '2026-01-21', null, null),
  ('e8dcad82-118f-49be-8c07-638ef92b1965', 'plattsburgh', DATE '2026-02-05', null, 'Blue polish spilled in the back room, supposdly container was over filled. Tire shine inonsistent, breaker trips. Managers are aware. bugger si working team is just not using it, presoak arch is available, Steve will run air and chemical lines for it. Drying agent turned down to VDS 24.'),
  ('611f25da-62d3-4a61-843d-2fdc2a1a7417', 'plattsburgh', DATE '2026-02-24', null, 'blowers are down, side blowers need to be adjusted as well. cars coming out wet. Drying agent pulling 10mls'),
