  ('3acfc3c0-c05a-4dae-8b24-5f52999e1022', 'plattsburgh', DATE '2026-04-02', null, 'manager says she was putting vds down and up because chemicals were coming out too soapy; she also touched the air pressures. '),
  ('b1814d22-7010-42a3-bc90-64c88d398c6c', 'plattsburgh', DATE '2026-04-23', null, 'Cars were coming out soapy, installed and adjusted nozzles on drying agent arch, After the change i didnt see any more soapy cars. Arch was also leaking chemical, added a check valve on chemical line, fixed the issue. X55 was pulling 20 mls, adjusted to 10mls VDS 21. '),
