  ('9f0f7f1e-50ee-4d26-b4db-7592858fe3c3', 'randolph', DATE '2026-05-13', null, 'IF-5 usage was very low, cleaned the lines and VDS, now pulling normally, also  manager stated they just recently started to use Bug remover. '),
