  ('18f25f92-beda-4089-b0af-92853800fd07', 'rutland', DATE '2025-06-04', null, '-Bug remover usage is high, due to versadail setting not being changed to new setting once it was placed online.- next report will be more accurate now that everthing is hooked up.-cars look great,with a great show.'),
  ('858c5cb1-d41f-4a9e-b80c-c48dc0718322', 'rutland', DATE '2025-06-19', null, '-PHipH container needs to be dumped due to cross contamination, causing lines to clog. - tunnel still smells bad when reclam system is on. Manager was told to dump Topline Resolve into the trench every hour to fight the smell. -30% Hydrogen Peroxide currently online.-Manager is occasionally shutting off reclaim system to stop the smell. '),
