  ('1feece8a-a032-47bb-8ad7-9500fe26a0fc', 'rutland', DATE '2025-11-10', null, 'Eyesight for Presoak 1(PHipH) was completly covered with a slush like substance. Bottom of the conatiner is also full of it causing the chemical to not flow up the tube. 2nd time performance has done this. Will email Noah about this issue. Water pressure also seems to be inconsistent here. discharge preesure reading below 50psi'),
  ('21d6027a-bcef-450e-a24b-0d65ec442ebb', 'rutland', DATE '2025-11-26', null, 'New container put in for perfromance, cleaned and working great. Dialed down to hit target of 8mls. Bug sprayer usage is high, i believe its due to the floor spayers having a leak, during these colder months i think it would be better to shut the functions off so the lines dont freeze.'),
  ('88d8f2f8-55c4-46e2-b6d6-1f85410b8dad', 'rutland', DATE '2025-12-19', null, null),
  ('ad17f9d7-0446-4c28-8ef0-16a453011199', 'rutland', DATE '2026-01-08', null, 'PeakLo wasnt pulling due to a clogged versa-dial tip. New line and versa-dial filter put in for PeakLo, pulling 5mls VDS@9, function is working now. Will continue to monitor. Car count given after visit, no adjustments made.'),
