  ('c88532ff-c21c-4cb0-a283-b3adf1d18443', 'rutland', DATE '2026-02-16', null, 'Lophm increased, VDS set to 30.  PLopH wasnt pulling, Dial was set at 9, adjusted to pull 5mls VDS 16. Drying agent was only pulling 3mls, Injector size was to big, vchanged to 3.0gpm(light Blue) , now pulling 10mls. No Perfromance Hi dropped off, will switch to Peak lo once it runs out. Due to Crystalization with perfromance Hi.'),
  ('d5b0f710-1de8-4e49-8163-4f6af9ba102d', 'rutland', DATE '2026-03-05', null, 'CTA and drying agent function needs a new MAM rebuild kit, functions stays open. To busy to install.Will have Terrence install after hours.'),
