  ('faa7ae27-2a23-4c81-81f6-e20884768a76', 'rutland', DATE '2026-05-15', null, 'Inventory was taken from Rutland to Shelburn, number are off. next report will be accurate.'),
  ('3ed5f5e3-1c4b-426a-adf7-c73bc6e21e54', 'rutland', DATE '2026-05-26', null, 'Travis hooked up new chemicals in hopes to fix bad reclaim smell, this test will run for a few weeks. '),
  ('3daceb90-fe77-4612-bace-da00e69d8921', 'shelton', DATE '2025-06-04', null, null),
  ('5bd2ec10-1423-4dd9-b51e-508b4915225d', 'shelton', DATE '2025-06-11', null, 'High Tire Shine and Gold usage. Low protect usage'),
  ('b2c7f2cd-1a88-47e8-827f-ec574a2182c3', 'shelton', DATE '2025-06-19', null, null),
  ('e613cb01-5758-4a53-92fb-b87768274c88', 'shelton', DATE '2025-06-27', null, 'Changed bug to bug remover (thumb guns) dosatron setting 1:64. Total shine must have been miscounted. Darwin said there''s no issues'),
  ('397690af-6b4d-4c9d-8fb0-b9e62a78a671', 'shelton', DATE '2025-07-02', null, 'Hot wax is pulling 20 mls (VD 9) on live pulls . I changed the VD to 6 and it was at 6 mls'),
  ('02597352-469a-4abb-b8ee-3258c43ae3af', 'shelton', DATE '2025-07-15', null, null),
  ('664d95ab-42d3-4762-9c6e-610d4ea66b9f', 'shelton', DATE '2025-07-24', null, 'Hooking up HWS per Darwin. Also, wants the powder for laundry detergent instead of liquid. Changed Flash Wax VD from 4 to 3 because of high pulls.  '),
  ('3b4916bf-51bd-499e-82de-79f3115ef300', 'shelton', DATE '2025-08-04', null, 'Changed tip for HWS from Yellow to Dark Brown (was too watery). Darwin changed X55 VD from 22 to 24 (on Express side). Dropped off 2 flojets to replace 1 on tire shine and 1 on kid guns (lo Phoam). Will keep an eye on total shine, they are also using it for every detail (not tracked) '),
  ('778fdd84-abc6-44a1-b8e6-70bbe91f8ead', 'shelton', DATE '2025-08-20', null, 'Kids gun hydrominder is splashing out and spilling into the flash wax, HWS, and Bug Remover causing inaccurate numbers. The functions are working correctly. I confirmed when cars went through the tunnel. Tire shine usage is high because it''s used on every detail. '),
  ('c67a7f43-ae94-465b-ac90-3e987cd91ac1', 'shelton', DATE '2025-09-05', null, 'Tipped HWS up from brown tip to Orange tip. Bug remover is pulling. Had no issues with it according to Darwin. '),
  ('980bb62a-108b-4ba9-8f8d-e49f8892ab4a', 'shelton', DATE '2025-09-18', null, 'Turned VD for Protect to 8 in express and 11 in hand wash to up the usage. Live pull was 2-3 ml for express and hand wash respectively. '),
  ('d7950bb7-26c9-434c-b8be-1e53996fba96', 'shelton', DATE '2025-09-29', null, 'Tipped up HWS from orange to green to help with the soap concentrate. Everything else is working well. '),
  ('6e91ea5b-336f-4d81-8eb4-102c390354e4', 'shelton', DATE '2025-10-15', null, 'Main water line to the express hydro flex board has a hole in it. Water leaked into the Red, Blue, Gold, and Flash Wax. Spoke to Sherif he is fixing it tonight, just got the new line in today. We will use the chemical from those reservoirs completely before adding anything new. Will drop off next week when line is fixed. Have not received the dual injector for fusions as of today. '),
  ('011d5854-63fe-4588-9b47-344a8ad17cdc', 'shelton', DATE '2025-10-22', null, 'X55 turned up from 16 to 19 on express and turned up from 25 to 27 on hand wash. Turned flash wax up from 6 to 8 on express side. Did not get car counts because the inventory numbers are off due to water getting into some of the products. '),
  ('b5425819-2583-4c4b-bef3-a419024b99e8', 'shelton', DATE '2025-10-29', null, 'New VD on X55 hand wash. It wasn’t pulling much chemical. Might have been clogged (264)
FWW 15 ml at 14
Red, Blue, Yellow - up to 18 on VD express 
Blue, red - up to 18 on VD Hand wash
Yellow - Up to 17 on VD hand wash
1 generator is missing the sealer so it’s leaking out of the cap on the drivers side. Sherif was made aware.
Bug is not being used. Watched 10+ cars and it wasn’t used 1 time. Everyone says they are using it. Protect was turned up to 10 on express and 13 on hand wash.'),
  ('4691fe5c-9d15-4a94-b204-90e51ce1a49d', 'shelton', DATE '2025-11-12', null, 'Turned up lo Phoam to express to 32 per Dave (17 ml live pull) and turned air down for more foam. X55 was turned up over the weekend, cars are beading up well. Bug remover still not being used much. Colors are high because they are already diluted. '),
  ('a7d770b5-41b1-4ff0-be0e-cc6070eb89a3', 'shelton', DATE '2025-11-25', null, 'Siphon break was leaking on X55 which could have resulted in skewed numbers. I''ve replaced that and turned it up from 15 to 17 on VD. Turned blue and Red up from 18 to 20'),
  ('942c240a-6d31-4701-9f70-3602b16bc7a3', 'shelton', DATE '2025-12-10', null, 'Blue red and gold all turned up 1 on VD both sides. X55 valve was closed and not pulling chemical (they had issues but never checked). They are pouring HWS into buckets on hand wash side. Hand wash X55 was not pulling chemical, replaced the VD, foot valve, and injector and its pulling chemical. Replaced the tip on HWS from green down to orange. Lo Phoam live pull was 20 ml'),
  ('9e789190-22d6-4d77-af42-993ba9c8f3e6', 'shelton', DATE '2025-12-22', null, 'Someone turned on perfect tire shine and lost a lot of product. They want to switch to perfect shine for both sides as well. X55 is struggling to work on exterior side. It wasn''t working on 12/22 and did work on 12/23. Noah suggested uncapping one of the nozzles. '),
  ('de255974-19d7-4277-838f-b4f144ef1135', 'shelton', DATE '2026-01-08', null, 'Told them to take off the caps on the drying agent nozzles. It''s still not pulling much. Need higher flash wax for show. Not using total shine anymore all perfect shine and issues with it leaking. Replaced hand wash flash wax VD. Added Graphene to both dosatrons for hand wash and express'),
  ('fc471625-b27c-46d8-9863-0953fb16038e', 'shelton', DATE '2026-01-21', null, 'Was a leak on exterior side so the usage is high for the perfect shine. Something different was dumped into the HWS. Told them to keep an eye on it, but im changing the line. Not using bug remover on every car why usage looks low. Switched lines from hand wash to exterior on x55 and is pulling on both sides '),
  ('d371e757-cb27-474d-86c8-0a0ff1ee6748', 'shelton', DATE '2026-02-03', null, 'Live pull of drying agent express is 10 mls. Live pull of flash wax on express is 10 mls. Turned all triple foam down, blue and red was turned down to 15, gold is 16. X55 was turned down on hand wash side to pull 10 mls. Tire shine usage is way high but Noah is speaking to John about correct programming. Also, customer ran over the lines and broke them off '),
  ('982004e0-3eb7-4364-9bd9-072f86fcaf3d', 'shelton', DATE '2026-02-18', null, 'Ran out of lo Phoam and didn''t notify me until same day and put Gold into the lo Phoam. They aren''t using the bug remover. Flojet doesn''t work for the CTA so that''s why usage is low (they ordered flojets). Set up the slipstream ceramic with new lines and foot valves, also had to change the check valve on the siphon break. Graphene on exterior wasn''t pulling, changed the foot valve. Turned protect down on exterior from 25 to 15. '),
  ('686e82cf-4ebb-48e9-aabf-5f150e6c6186', 'shelton', DATE '2026-03-03', null, 'Turned up drying agent to 24 on VD for higher usage on the express, hand wash didn''t need to be turned up. Drying agent looks a lot better to dry cars now. Everything else seems to be pretty good. '),
  ('e55ec7a5-4804-45c1-b7e6-efae1ca25018', 'shelton', DATE '2026-03-19', null, 'Replaced the foot valve and line on HWS because it was clogged up. We may need to dump the HWS because something got mixed in there. Also changed the foot valve on the X55 because the line wasn''t holding chemical. Will keep my eye on blue. It was working well. May have missed a 2.5 gal jug. '),
  ('e997b592-55b7-4be9-ab49-c96f383353e5', 'shelton', DATE '2026-04-01', null, 'Turned up blue and red from 15 to 16 on VD (Express). Cars are drying well. The protect line was pulled up so it wasn''t pulling on the express side thats why the usage was so low. Show is looking pretty good. '),
  ('7c43bf25-97e3-4f2d-a756-f66ff78371f0', 'shelton', DATE '2026-04-14', null, null),
  ('7ceda2b4-db1d-4f4c-9686-81187c02c0ac', 'shelton', DATE '2026-04-27', null, 'Everything is looking good. No issues with anything. Not using as much HWS as they should or could. Cars are drying well. Show is looking good. Noticed a blower was out and let Darwin know and him and Dave were able to fix it and get it working again. '),
  ('d0b0a12b-4f0f-4365-a18b-f6a86993714e', 'shelton', DATE '2026-05-12', null, 'Thumb gun was down for the HWS so the number is low. Turned down the X55 on express side from 30 to 25 because it was using way too much chemical and it was just as effective with it lower. Everything else was working well. Not using the bug remover currently. '),
  ('13f04444-8dd0-4caf-8b94-14126e0b0209', 'shelton', DATE '2026-05-29', null, 'Everything was working well. No issues. Switched back to Total Shine per Noah. Not using the bug remover. '),
  ('253e426b-3ae2-4e39-9b40-4dc7a2fb97e2', 'shelton', DATE '2026-06-07', null, 'Dosatron isn''t working for the bug remover. Changed the diaphragm on the hydrominder for the kids guns and added a check valve because there was backflow into the reservoir. Darwin doesn''t like the HWS but it''s coming out well. '),
  ('1d6eef50-a930-434b-8bf2-3816acff6f38', 'shelton', DATE '2026-06-23', null, 'Bug remover dosatron was not changed. Tire shine was empty upon arrival but they did have a backup. '),
  ('524b862b-ac3a-4815-952c-9268fe349da7', 'shelton', DATE '2026-07-08', null, null),
  ('04ea0e86-f408-4dc0-984a-63e9a739a389', 'shelton', DATE '2026-07-21', null, 'Turned down flash wax on VDs for both tunnels due to high usage. Otherwise wash is looking good. No other issues, have slowed down. '),
  ('4f4a63b4-c87f-4835-82d4-305f82cf5460', 'shelton', DATE '2026-08-04', null, 'Turned down flash wax on express side. Also, the injector where the versadial goes into is broken and leaking air (I let Darwin know). Turned down the air pressure on lo Phoam for the handwash side because it was too high. '),
  ('a4e5b89f-ff5f-4d81-8ced-053c8a4057db', 'southbury', DATE '2025-08-13', null, 'Set up X55 but it is not being used currently. Waiting till we run out of the 400. Setting up for the first time - no car counts just starting inventory for next visit. '),
  ('fa6f1694-7fa4-4f1c-ac63-8b2dc1fedcc0', 'southbury', DATE '2025-08-27', null, 'Still need to dial in the numbers this is the first week of showing. Tire shine is getting put on every detail and it''s all by hand application. I will check all usage again next visit. '),
  ('6258a96a-034e-4ca5-abe3-d7a344669e14', 'southbury', DATE '2025-09-07', null, 'Tire Shine usage is always high because they use it for all details and put it in 5 gallon buckets. Probably another 8-10 gallons still unused. Turned down the 3700 on dosatron to not show 640 anymore probably around 800:1. Didn''t turn down the x55 cars werent coming out dry when it was turned down. '),
  ('1605e973-f6f8-4172-8642-3ba2528a879b', 'southbury', DATE '2025-09-26', null, 'Will turn down the 3700 from 63 to 50. Tire shine they have about 10-15 gallons off in 5 gallon buckets around the site that are not counted. Changed tip in 222 from orange to Dark brown '),
  ('700727e9-3985-4329-8528-e0cee4dda0f5', 'southbury', DATE '2025-10-10', null, 'Turned down the 3700 to 44 on the dial. Still running a little high. Tire shine is spread throughout the site in 5 gallon buckets. Usage has been pretty consistent. Higher drying agent is needed to have the water bead up. '),
  ('63dba587-9153-4dbf-8c78-92ff07e39c23', 'southbury', DATE '2025-10-23', null, 'Tipped up the 427 from a pink to purple. Need the usage for X55 to bead up and 3700 for the show. No complaints from customers '),
  ('0494d644-9663-4fa8-bb5a-0141b905f553', 'southbury', DATE '2025-11-05', null, 'For the tire shine, they have it throughout their whole car wash in 5 gallon pails. Going forward I''m only going to count what remains in the drum because usage will be all over the place if I miss a 5 gallon bucket. '),
  ('fd529191-6ac1-4887-bb7f-9c90141af1f3', 'southbury', DATE '2025-11-19', null, 'Turned down the X55 a hair. Has to be higher to bead up on the car. Tire shine is high because it''s hand applied so they are using more. '),
  ('43bd1373-b168-4cad-a86d-d3dd09fafb91', 'southbury', DATE '2025-12-03', null, 'Turned down the 3700 a little bit. Will be back next week. '),
  ('ed0c8f03-eb0a-435b-a349-41cfbdf00fa9', 'southbury', DATE '2025-12-11', null, '222 for wheel cleaner wasn''t working. Aaron said he would clean it out and replace anything not working. He didn''t need any parts. Didn''t want me to do it. The main blower in the middle is also not working currently. '),
  ('c9c8341d-d18e-4595-9e2b-9648187282d1', 'southbury', DATE '2025-12-23', null, '222 had a huge clog in the line. Aaron cleared it out in between visits. Will look for usage to increase going forward. '),
  ('258f3adb-08a8-4c40-b2f7-7817126a3774', 'southbury', DATE '2026-01-07', null, 'Aaron said the 222 was clogged again. He will clean it out. Tire shine is also always high because it''s hand applied. Main blower is barely working so it''s not pushing the water off cars but water is beading up. '),
  ('982aa200-f05e-4f77-beca-656e366138a5', 'southbury', DATE '2026-01-21', null, 'Issues with the 222 line crystallizing because of the reclaim water. Aaron is working on fixing the lines. Did not want tire shine. Main blower isn''t working but drying agent was working pretty well beading up. Set up the Flash Wax for 427 but did not start using yet. '),
  ('c936ee19-a94f-4ec0-97d9-0922c6d51b0c', 'southbury', DATE '2026-02-03', null, 'Switched the flash wax over for 427. Computers had issues so the 3700 had to be left on manually for 2 days. Will not adjust it and will monitor next visit. 222 line should be unclogged next week. Drying agent working but the main blower doesn''t work well. Barely blowing any air '),
  ('65658983-f955-46ad-94c0-3180dde90512', 'southbury', DATE '2026-02-16', null, 'Changed the line and foot valve on the 3700. I also asked Ryan to clean the generators out. They are too busy to clean them out while I was there. Fixed the hydrominder for the 222 (diaphragm and injector as well as the line and foot valve). Tipped up flash wax to yellow tip'),
  ('a568ec9a-63fa-4c2b-879f-a267f11aa7b6', 'southbury', DATE '2026-03-05', null, 'The are fixing the 222 so it''s not online right now. Reason for no usage. 3700 was turned on override because they were having issues with it not working. Will monitor on next visit. '),
  ('7081258f-1386-4753-8854-44e1b6b7e865', 'southbury', DATE '2026-03-17', null, 'Going to keep the flash wax there because it looks good. Soap is working better than ever according to managers. Always on the higher end of the tire shine usage. Main blower still doesn''t work so the sides of the car are dry but the middle of the car is not. '),
  ('90981203-0c3d-403f-9c4d-e632bf657c2c', 'southbury', DATE '2026-04-02', null, 'Changed the hot wax tip down from yellow to aqua to lower usage. Pretty slow. Apply the tire shine by hand so it''s always high usage here. Cars are beading up pretty nicely. '),
  ('cc1f15f0-3532-4a79-b0dc-ae425f97c516', 'southbury', DATE '2026-04-16', null, 'Turned down the 3700 a little bit, counted wall cleaner as 3700 last visit, it was mixed in extra boxes and didn''t notice. Going to leave the flash wax where it is. It doesn''t give much of a show at the lower tip. Will monitor the soap as well. '),
  ('123a871c-41d7-4f74-8655-a5b171e29e27', 'southbury', DATE '2026-04-30', null, 'We have to run things a little higher here because they have such few products so you need it for the show. Main blower isn''t working well but water is beading up nicely. '),
  ('4aea5c1a-7a0e-42d5-8293-d7b85efc46e9', 'springfield', DATE '2026-05-07', null, '-Protect(Sealant) was only pulling 2mls, adjusted to 6mls VDS:14 - Warp foam pulling 20mls adjusted to 6-7mls VDS 13'),
  ('ee88cfc0-4893-483d-88b2-c4bda053f76b', 'springfield', DATE '2026-05-19', null, null),
  ('6b5e2779-8c9f-4d25-b757-f0ae6cc1eea1', 'springfield', DATE '2026-06-01', null, '-Infusion Fresh(Scent) turned up to VDS 23. -yellow polish looked faint, turned up - Reclaim additive dropped off - There was another leak at the solenoid for the tire shine, Anibal was able to catch it, Working properly now, no adjustments made on the PLC. Cars look great!'),
  ('5d969753-9a1c-4553-9bd4-8f2694767423', 'springfield', DATE '2026-06-10', null, 'Air adjusted for LoPhM, set at 0.2'),
  ('2ee560ba-551c-43ca-8e0b-204c435076c2', 'springfield', DATE '2026-06-13', null, 'PLC adjusted to .4 .4 .3 .3 1skip will be back Thursday to follow up on tire shine usage.'),
