  ('2dac1560-d11a-484e-ab0a-9eb61c133cb1', 'stamford', DATE '2026-06-20', null, 'First Foamer: Check valve was leaking. Mentioned this to Manager (Osvin) and he said he would replace after store closes. Gave him a few check valves for leaking antisiphon. Spoke about running a seperate line for first Banana foamers to allow for more chemical to be used for the first foamer, in order to create a thicker application. '),
