  ('07984a40-c1bc-4bc3-9238-5ba329b5f81e', 'rensselear', DATE '2025-06-27', null, 'Wax -Lowered FWW slightly. VD set at 14 to reduce usage. Triple Foam- Reduced Yellow foam slightly. VD set at 12. Presoak (HI Peak)- Cleaned Versadial tip. More product is being used. Around 5mls.'),
  ('a59a8c2e-c746-4aaa-8c0c-9962c65c83ce', 'rensselear', DATE '2025-07-10', null, 'Using up the remaining 505 for the CTA''s and Topline C4 Ceramic for Ceramic application.'),
  ('995ddbcf-1da6-4531-9cca-d9c9afd3e91b', 'rensselear', DATE '2025-07-24', null, null),
  ('478e717b-3a63-4c0b-a437-73be5df4f114', 'rensselear', DATE '2025-08-07', null, 'Wax Bar: Bar was clogged. Removed and cleaned bar and generator. Application is working normal again. Reduced VD to 9.  CTA: Sent video to Chris (manager.) CTA''s are turning on late. Cars are drying well. Tire Shine bar/brushes need cleaned. Manager said he will clean these. '),
  ('0fef1a24-fdfe-460c-b2b9-ed40bf5d3f6d', 'rensselear', DATE '2025-08-21', null, 'Yellow Polish: High Usage. Lowered VD to 10. Tire Shine: Brush was ran over by customer. Brush drip lines need replaced. '),
