  ('9a3993d5-0d34-4f77-a207-5121ebb94f66', 'rensselear', DATE '2026-01-31', null, 'Ceramic- Ceramic appears mixed with another product. Told manager of this issue. Bringing more ceramic on the next visit. 2nd Foamer: Replaced broken nozzle on banana foamers. '),
