  ('62504553-e43a-46bc-b03d-a65f3f863186', 'rensselear', DATE '2026-04-20', null, 'Presoak: Cleaned Clogged nozzles. CTA: Informed managers that CTA''s are not activating for any wash. Tire Shine: Both brushes clumpy and excessive tire shine. Turned down dwell time to .2 and .3 seconds per car.  '),
  ('5a8c57ff-d1f0-44d9-91ee-6af360434d09', 'rensselear', DATE '2026-05-11', null, null),
  ('3dffad8b-008c-4489-a113-d7cd1c6b2327', 'rensselear', DATE '2026-05-28', null, 'Bug prep: Thumb gun was spraying water. Cleaned tip on hydro minder. Funciton is working again. Presoak: Bumped up VD slightly.'),
  ('9b870a11-63de-40f4-9d19-db600cceb0f9', 'rensselear', DATE '2026-07-06', null, 'Gloss Boss: Cleaned manifolds and replaced broken 3/8ths fittings. Rotated manifolds upright for proper application. Told manager to order to drip manifolds for the driver side; many are bent and some are missing fittings.'),
  ('5eaa6da4-d500-495a-aa7c-6f7e4b17dc65', 'rensselear', DATE '2026-07-30', null, 'Presoak: hi ph- Lowered VD from 18 to 16. Usage is closer to targets. Dropped off 427 as replacement for peak low. Noah will make final connections.'),
  ('696dbd18-e450-436d-af2a-60fecf48cf31', 'middletown', DATE '2025-05-06', null, 'All Diamon Shine products are online except. 3rd Foamer and Yellow Tri Foam. '),
  ('727f01e9-eb4f-495f-809d-3aa645e82903', 'middletown', DATE '2025-05-12', null, 'Made final hook up for Foamer 3 and Yellow Polish on this visit. CTA: Mangaer mentioned that wheels were not cleaning well. Increased VD from 18 to 23. Using around 4mls. '),
  ('fed7774a-df92-42c1-b669-50b3702eb782', 'middletown', DATE '2025-05-21', null, 'Notes: Dropped  off 10g of wall cleaner. Wax(FWW): High usage. Lowered Vd for Bubblizer from VD13 to 10. Target usage around 4mls. This product is also being used by 2nd foamer.Fragrance: Low usage Increased Vd from 10 t012. Target usage around 2mls. Presoak: High Usage. Lowered both presoak VD from 22 to 14. Using around 7mls between both functions. (not including 3rd foamer)'),
  ('692ad5ac-8f7e-4ef4-8fe8-2f178362caaa', 'middletown', DATE '2025-05-28', null, 'Dropped off 2 Tunnel Cleaners. Ceramic- Replaced Ceramic Punch with Slip Stream Pro.  Increased Injector size from 1.5 to 2.0. Set Vd to 20. Using 7mls. Removed red mesh in generator and replaced with foaming stick. Rainbar application applies much better. '),
  ('a147b517-9785-48fe-926c-382757dcd42e', 'middletown', DATE '2025-06-03', null, 'Tunnel has a bad oder to it. Replaced all Peak Loph applications with Performance Hi ph, (includes Presoak Back, and 2nd Foamer.)  LoPhoam is the only Lo ph product going into the reclaim system. If this switch doesn''t resolve the issue, the next step would be to remove the Lophoam also. Triple Colors: Yellow product tip was clogged. Cleaned tip and function is working normally. '),
  ('94192bef-1559-4cb1-a50f-e53afe9838b0', 'middletown', DATE '2025-06-12', null, 'Lava Foamer: Swapped LoPhoam product for HiPH. Testing to see if this change reduces tunnel smell. Cars are drying well. Triple Foam: Yellow was not working. Removed line check valve and cleaned and replaced tip. Yellow is working normally again.'),
