  ('2413d14c-5531-45bd-a05d-6b63cd14dece', 'middletown', DATE '2025-08-04', null, 'Triple Polish: Yellow was not applying. Tip was clogged on chemical line check valve. Cleaned tip, application is working again. First Banana Foamers are not applying. After a replacing a few check valves and testing a few line we discovered an issue with the airline between Air Gauge and the air exiting the hydraflex board. Tyler is addressing this issue after car wash hours. '),
  ('696fac39-964e-499e-b5bc-758c273fccb7', 'middletown', DATE '2025-08-13', null, 'Manager mentioned wheels are not cleaning well. Upped the usage for Ultra Tire Cleaner. Set VD at 18. Polish: Replaced Broken 1/2 elbow on Yellow generator. Product was leaking out the line. '),
