  ('2e84239c-2871-4502-950b-54d538c20202', 'middletown', DATE '2025-08-27', null, 'Tire Shine: Reporting shows little to no usage for tire shine. Manager had turned application down to every 3rd car at .7sec. Brushes are lubricated and cars have tire shine on the tires. Marked drum with the date and told manager to monitor the usage over the next day or 2 to make sure its applying correctly. '),
