  ('4ebffa3d-1196-476d-abab-9700188271aa', 'middletown', DATE '2025-10-15', null, 'Hot Wax: Application was watery. Increased Versadial (VD) from 12 → 14 to improve consistency.

Wheel Cleaner (HWS): Noticed low chemical usage. Increased VD from 15 → 17.

Ceramic: Lowered VD from 27 → 25 to align closer with target usage levels.

Triple Foam – Red: Application appeared watery. Cleaned tip and check valve; still not drawing chemical. Replaced Versadial, set at 15. Flow measured at 2 mL; application now looks good.'),
  ('cc8515b9-63b2-4ba9-836c-cde203a61f76', 'middletown', DATE '2025-10-23', null, 'Protect: Increased Versadial to 10, bringing us closer to target usage.
Ceramic: Application was not working due to a clogged foot valve and Versadial. Removed and cleaned parts. Increased Versadial to 25 — application is now functioning normally.
