  ('98d535d5-e90b-4ecf-8437-406314bb8bad', 'middletown', DATE '2026-05-27', null, 'Foamer (Clean Foam): Bumped VD down from 10 to 9. Closer to target usage. Show looks good. Ceramic: Funciton was not turning on. Replaced broken solenoid valve coil. Funciton is working again. '),
