  ('e13631f8-2bd6-4ce3-800e-15e70cc15ee3', 'montogomery', DATE '2026-06-12', null, 'Tire Shine: High usage. Reduced dwell time on PLC from 1.4 sec to 1 sec to reduce product usage. Application is good. Triple Foam: Upped usage from 14 to 16 for a more colorful application. '),
  ('9de7e73e-fd40-4d7f-99f0-ad0d835a2610', 'montogomery', DATE '2026-06-25', null, 'Tire Shine: Adj. drip manifolds upward and adj. directional valves to allow for an improved/even applicaiton. First Foamer: Increased air to enhance foaming consistency. '),
  ('c0a235d4-1b66-4c41-8ea7-9c20cc285466', 'montogomery', DATE '2026-07-09', null, null),
  ('604fbe73-3d0c-4eb1-a05e-79a50922c158', 'montogomery', DATE '2026-06-23', null, 'Made adj to bring usages closer to target. Bug remover: Reduced dosatron to 1:100. First Foamer: Mam valve was sticking open after function was off but booster pump was on. It would close after booster pump shut off. Replaced with mam valve and spring repair kit. Function is working normal again.'),
  ('27ccbc40-7392-4d4a-9e86-90de965b5774', 'montogomery', DATE '2026-08-04', null, null),
  ('f7c3c578-26f5-4410-9e8f-d26459e82830', 'newburgh', DATE '2025-11-13', null, null),
