  ('e8d65fea-ee3b-4cd1-986f-a8a8a46634d0', 'newburgh', DATE '2026-02-18', null, 'Presoak: Tip was clogged preventing chemical from being used. '),
  ('f0b7d344-8c08-4058-ba11-ffab42477075', 'newburgh', DATE '2026-03-04', null, '2nd Foamer: Function is staying on to long. Notified manager. '),
  ('845ef061-bae5-4354-b8ad-c774d073f311', 'newburgh', DATE '2026-03-25', null, null),
  ('4e722bec-d36b-44c6-b7fa-91f989cccf05', 'newburgh', DATE '2026-04-09', null, null),
  ('b4b11137-5e46-439f-a4e8-6b706d6ad68b', 'newburgh', DATE '2026-04-23', null, 'Scent: Low usage. Cleaned tip. S'),
  ('6387d2ca-6051-4ac7-95e8-6118cf4242ac', 'newburgh', DATE '2026-05-07', null, 'Previous report is missing'),
  ('4cb54ddb-e114-46c1-80ad-e256245ec149', 'newburgh', DATE '2026-05-20', null, 'Notified Andrew that drying agent high pressure is turning on 7 seconds too soon, Wasting product. Bottom presoak foamers need to stay on longer. Tyler was onsite to make these changes. Tire Shine Usage was slightly high. Lowered Parameters to measure .6 sec for front brush and .4 sec for back brush-applying every 3rd car.'),
  ('e0601a90-634e-47de-9e1f-3f9cbd3be6f5', 'newburgh', DATE '2026-06-05', null, null),
  ('d18ffa59-4cae-4258-b8dc-f7dc684172b5', 'newburgh', DATE '2026-06-18', null, '2nd Foamer- Watery application. Cleaned clogged tip. Application is normal.'),
  ('c7946001-ada5-4cdb-8a6b-f9afed9c37c8', 'newburgh', DATE '2026-07-02', null, null),
  ('397eb3e4-8bc8-4cd1-8bc0-b42eacb8605f', 'newburgh', DATE '2026-07-16', null, 'Drying Agent: High usage- Lowered VD from 23 to 21. Bug Remover: Lowered Dosatron from 1/64 to 1/100 to bring usage closer to target. 2nd foamer: Chemical was not being used. Blew out clogged tip. Presoak: No chemical was being used because line wax not properly submerged in chemical. Tire Shine: Lowered air pressure from 60 to 50psi and to apply every other car instead of every 3rd car. '),
  ('4fec9ce2-e897-4b30-ae6f-2f7657336062', 'newburgh', DATE '2026-08-13', null, null),
