  ('458bb4e4-7ec4-4677-ada4-d419c14d85fe', 'westhaven', DATE '2025-07-03', null, null),
  ('25eda36b-e383-42e1-82b0-8eecf8c2a6f9', 'westhaven', DATE '2025-07-14', null, 'Water spilled into the performance and peak lo from a broken flojet. It was changed by Milton. Also, set up Blue, Gold, and HWS is ready to go when 505 runs out. Car counts aren''t important because the inventory numbers were off'),
  ('37d300dd-a98e-43cc-8687-76f93c47636e', 'westhaven', DATE '2025-07-29', null, 'Performance live pulls was 12 ml turned VD to 12 and got them around 6 ml. X55 live pulls were 10 ml. Lo Phoam live pulls were 20 ml (VD - 30) changed VD to 25 and pulls were 10 ml '),
  ('92d38d87-3400-4170-beb7-015d182f0181', 'westhaven', DATE '2025-08-11', null, 'Set up the bug remover in place of presoak acid. It was finally soaping up. Milton said it wasn''t soapy at all with the presoak acid from slipstream. '),
  ('d0ee0f45-3f21-4cf8-a8ed-b3be85a38e17', 'westhaven', DATE '2025-08-25', null, 'Micrologics was down so I couldn''t get car counts. Thumb gun needs to be changed it has leaks in it. I turned the bug remover up on the dosatron to get more soap to come out. Lo Phoam live pulls were pulling 10 ml but Brandon said it was coming out very watery so they turned the Versadial up to 27 Still using slipstream for the red and have 505 for HWS and have 431 for Flash Wax. Ceramic is being used for different functions. '),
  ('e5b52b3b-7e61-4d03-99ec-43f99de744a8', 'westhaven', DATE '2025-09-09', null, 'Functions are working well. Cars are coming out pretty dry as well so no need to turn up X55. Milton has no complaints with the chemicals or how they are working '),
  ('7228bee2-e650-4ed7-9771-6e2cafb2c5ce', 'westhaven', DATE '2025-09-24', null, 'Ceramic is pulling for Protect and Sealant. Also miscounted 1 5 gal drum. It was Graphene not Ceramic. Went over the report with Brandon. Everything is running smoothly. Blowers were fixed. Cars are coming out very dry. Water is breaking. Having issues with Tire Shine, one side won''t work. So it was turned off. '),
  ('1c02917d-1041-4cd3-8d7b-343d6c983b5a', 'westhaven', DATE '2025-10-09', null, 'Turned bug remover up on the dosatron, also turned gold and blue VD to 13 from 11 because of low usages. Looks a lot better now. Turned drying agent up from 14 to 15 on VD. Everything else is working well. Dropped off infusions but don''t have dual injectors and they have Graphene. '),
  ('bed7847a-87f7-4d1a-9f0d-aefdc31733d6', 'westhaven', DATE '2025-10-21', null, 'Used ceramic for hot wax and still using it for the sealant. Live pull of x55 was 10 ml at 16 on VD. Frank and Kevin fixed the HWS also upped the usage on the lo Phoam, X55, Blue, Gold, and HWS. Fixed a valve on the HWS versadial. '),
  ('dccd6029-0460-4df0-a383-d083f3d32ab3', 'westhaven', DATE '2025-11-03', null, 'More ceramics were given out for free. So the ceramic count is not accurate. Lo Phoam needs high usage to get the foaminator to sheet. Tire shine is not working well. Milton knows. Turned up infusions from 14 to 19. Not smelling anything. Turned flash wax down from 14 to 12 to get 10 ml and still a good show. Thumb gun is working well for the bug remover I encouraged to use more on the cars. Colors are coming out nice. Not going to change. Set up red. Done with slipstream. '),
  ('b4bb141e-b1ca-4faf-9af2-b7815339f782', 'westhaven', DATE '2025-11-18', null, 'HWS timing is off. Milton knows and said IT has to set up the timing. Hot wax bubblelizer isn''t turning on. The peak lo line was getting pulled out and not pulling chemical. Turned up X55 from 16 to 19 (live pull 10 mls). Turned blue and red up from 20 to 21 on VD. Bugs working well. They aren''t covering cars. Maybe a 1-2 second spray. Tire shine was working. Brushes has tire shine on them. '),
  ('931b076c-0266-4fcd-801b-b351345df539', 'westhaven', DATE '2025-12-02', null, 'Turned X55 from 19 to 22. Turn flash wax from 16 to 14. Need higher usage for show. Bug remover is used sparingly on every car. Turned blue up from 21 to 22. '),
  ('7ce3480d-38e5-4047-a264-217918a2db61', 'westhaven', DATE '2025-12-16', null, 'Turned up drying agent from 22 to 24 (10 ml live pull). Turned up infusions from 22 to 23 on VD. Can definitely smell it in the tunnel. Sold some hot wax add ons so the number looks more inflated but it needs to be higher for the show. Bubbleizer is not working for the hot wax. '),
  ('28c28602-a15a-4d7e-b6de-fd9ad6540cab', 'westhaven', DATE '2025-12-29', null, 'Turned infusions up from 23 to 25. Live pulls of performance were 4-5 mls. Live pulls of triple foam were 3-4 mls, won''t adjust anything. Turned up drying agent up from 23 to 24. '),
  ('8ff1e0cc-70c2-409b-aba4-6b6b7660181b', 'westhaven', DATE '2026-01-13', null, 'Turned the performance up from 19 to 20 on VD. Triple foam pulled at 2-3 mls each on live pulls. Show looks good. X55 replaced the filter on VD and pulling 10 mls and beading nicely. Ceramic is always high because its being used as sealer wax as well. '),
  ('27ed2389-1d4c-47dd-9d8c-2e99c1dbff15', 'westhaven', DATE '2026-01-27', null, 'Cleaned out the VD filter and shortened the line and X55 seems to be working a lot better and using 9-10 mls on live pulls. Turned down the flash wax 2 on VD from 14 to 12 and show still looks good. '),
  ('b9ca13a0-81f2-4694-9415-691bbcbb11cd', 'westhaven', DATE '2026-02-10', null, 'Turned up performance from 20 to 21 for 6 mls per car. HWS was pulling 7 mls per car. Colors look good. Flash wax needs to be that high for the show. Drying agent and HWS were empty upon arrival. Replaced the VD and injector for x55 and set to 21. Pulling 10 mls. Very busy almost doubled the car count. '),
  ('80604721-a25b-4ce5-ad28-a82bf8c5b52d', 'westhaven', DATE '2026-02-20', null, 'Ceramic is being used as sealer wax as well. Peak lo is working well. Drying agent is beading up nicely. Switched the injector on the red because it wasn''t pulling great and the siphon break was leaking water so I switched that check valve. '),
  ('97095b2f-26c6-4b69-a322-0dc424202c57', 'westhaven', DATE '2026-03-10', null, 'Using the ceramic as sealer wax currently. Had an issue with the blue where it wasn''t working and the reservoir overflowed. Frank came over and changed the check valve by the injector and it''s working well now. Cars are coming out pretty dry. Will monitor the other colors. '),
  ('7ed88d49-581e-4210-902c-fe954af47583', 'westhaven', DATE '2026-03-24', null, 'Using ceramic as protect still. So usage will show high. Replaced the check valve and foot valve on bug remover because it wasn''t pulling or staying in the line. Cars were drying nicely. Everything else looks good. '),
  ('ae6484ad-8cab-43e4-9cb9-4af23d0372ff', 'westhaven', DATE '2026-04-07', null, 'Line was pulled out of the eye site for X55 so the line was empty. Not sure how long it was like that. Cars are coming out dry now. Triple foam wasn''t working. Milton and I changed the MAM valve because it wasn''t getting pressure and now is working well. We changed the versadial for the red because it wasn''t working and now it''s working great. Turned flash wax down a little but need higher usage for the show. '),
  ('5b662ba9-e415-424a-a780-163ea79d10fc', 'westhaven', DATE '2026-04-21', null, 'Tire shine drum was empty upon arrival. They have an extra one at the location. Everything seems to be working well with no issues. I cleaned out the VD filter on the ceramic and sealer wax. Cars are coming out dry. '),
  ('4a8c871a-37fd-4fd0-855b-f23c8c51cfac', 'westhaven', DATE '2026-05-05', null, null),
  ('6e1b2355-6c4b-4ac9-b570-b9ac4a89357a', 'westhaven', DATE '2026-05-19', null, 'Hot wax is showing low but pulling normal and looks good. Must have been an issue that no one noticed. Everything else is working well. Cars are coming out shiny and dry. Tire shine is finally working due to maintenance fixing it. '),
  ('93f5c3ff-267d-44d0-a6e1-df79683e57ad', 'westhaven', DATE '2026-06-03', null, 'Cars are looking good. Turned up the flash wax from 11 to 12 on VD for a better show. '),
  ('620c5c0a-d0db-40c4-a8cf-9c6b8e0dc294', 'westhaven', DATE '2026-06-15', null, 'Tire shine brush looks really worn on drivers side, Milton knows and let maintenance know. Also, drum was empty upon arrival but they have another drum. Bug remover looks good out of the thumb gun. Turned flash wax down 2 on VD from 12 to 10. '),
  ('c0d9f889-f112-4324-b760-4aad5ebb9f91', 'westhaven', DATE '2026-07-01', null, 'Changed the foot valve on the HWS because it wasn''t staying in the line. Changed the lines for the Ceramic and Sealer Wax (also using the Ceramic currently) because they weren''t pulling. The ceramic I did have to put a new versadial in because it wasn''t pulling chemical. '),
  ('f5b09289-60d9-4b93-b44b-ea8ff9816993', 'westhaven', DATE '2026-07-14', null, 'HWS live pulls are 8 mls, no adjustments needed. Turned down the peak lo and drying agent on VD. Turned up the bug remover. Ceramic is high usage because its being used as the sealer wax as well. Wash is looking good. Functions are working well. '),
  ('aa604975-744b-4170-8dba-bcd3e54ca8a0', 'westhaven', DATE '2026-07-29', null, 'Bug remover had a pinched line so it might have restricted the usage. The infusions foot valve was off so I added that back on. Turned down the peak lo and drying agent because of high usage. The second blowers are turning on but not moving the water on the car. Luis reached out to Anniba on the matter. '),
  ('7470e278-26d2-4581-ad52-deb5b5dd35f0', 'westhaven', DATE '2026-08-12', null, 'Turned down flash wax, x55, and peak lo because of high usages. Upon arrival, there were multiple reservoirs not pulling correctly because the line was out of the liquid or they were empty. I told Luis to check it every morning to make sure nothing runs out. '),
  ('e919a2c6-616b-48ea-9967-69de5c990179', 'westport', DATE '2025-06-02', null, null),
  ('d16987d7-4b39-4400-9728-7115bed9e683', 'westport', DATE '2025-06-20', null, null),
  ('4ceffab6-8d59-4846-a925-bbf428f59141', 'westport', DATE '2025-07-03', null, null),
  ('c1137acf-59b5-4d5b-a326-6c7b942e134a', 'westport', DATE '2025-07-18', null, 'Lustra Triple Foam products are still being used up before switching new product. Ceramic: 1.5 gallon left of 461. Dropped off Slip Stream 5g as future replacement.'),
  ('f514a6e0-d9c6-4119-992b-eda6da0c3dbf', 'westport', DATE '2025-08-01', null, 'Triple Polish: Replaced hydro minder valve. Function is working normal again. Ceramic: Replaced 461 with Slipstream.'),
  ('d3b10699-7ab6-489f-87cf-0a6a486fc69e', 'westport', DATE '2025-08-14', null, null),
  ('8c78d91d-12de-4f01-abff-d3397a239599', 'westport', DATE '2025-08-28', null, 'Triple Polish: Blue foam application broken. Replaced damaged check valve on generator. Function is working again. Wax: Usage was high. Turned down dosatron to 1:1500 to bring us closer to target. '),
  ('b32108fc-5202-4d9f-be09-a9ed647d08b5', 'westport', DATE '2025-09-12', null, null),
  ('10878970-a8f0-4145-bd97-cbd07e7da3b5', 'westport', DATE '2025-09-25', null, null),
  ('7d23d57c-e658-463e-b757-a5c99151f0b7', 'westport', DATE '2025-10-14', null, 'First Foamer: '),
  ('f6c65d00-5317-4e75-8121-0d58b6b87cac', 'westport', DATE '2025-10-23', null, null),
  ('0eda1960-6636-4ab8-bd39-d617ba03fdfe', 'westport', DATE '2025-11-07', null, null),
  ('25edd8b8-46c9-4445-9fa3-64804fde0a9a', 'westport', DATE '2025-11-21', null, null),
  ('b497ece3-8462-44e3-8c7e-aa9308873b29', 'westport', DATE '2025-12-05', null, null),
  ('cdf3dba3-7bb1-48c1-8327-925d186e1a86', 'westport', DATE '2025-12-18', null, 'Drying agent valve was closed on reservoir, that''s the reason for the low usage. Not much scent used but can smell it in the tunnel. '),
  ('1b666687-24ed-44b2-963b-f43458cccc27', 'westport', DATE '2025-12-30', null, 'Lo Phoam live pulls are 8 mls may have miscounted. Turned drying agent up 4 to get a dryer car. Turned down sealer wax due to high usage. Turned up the peak to get live pulls of 8 mls. '),
  ('56e10a62-d4fe-4fc2-97e5-8b869175d161', 'westport', DATE '2026-01-15', null, 'Turned X55 up a little to help get a dry car. Peak live pulls were 8 ml. Dropped off 6 crush power bottles and triggers per request. Turned down the sealer wax because of high usage. '),
  ('c572189b-5d34-4d4a-bd49-2a0d97174963', 'westport', DATE '2026-01-29', null, 'X55 was pulling very very slowly. Spoke to Noah and Enrique about it and Noah said they would replace the pulsatron and he would put in a maintenance request. Drying agent was way too inconsistent. Turned down the Peak Lo and protect due to high usage. '),
  ('bdea7aef-90cb-4a7f-b479-a49ddd546ef0', 'westport', DATE '2026-02-12', null, 'Enrique says they don''t use tire shine because of the cold. They aren''t using much HWS says he doesn''t like the product so it''s rarely used. Drying agent seems to be working well again. The reservoir was moved closer to the pulsatron but only thing that was changed. Turned the flash wax and protect up a little bit. Triple foam looks good and red usage is only 3-4 mls per car '),
  ('569004c6-32d5-429b-9b87-3d874296c4c1', 'westport', DATE '2026-02-26', null, 'Turned up the peak lo to give a better show. Turned down the protect because usage was high. Changed the eductor and tip on the red but need to clean the generator. Blue flojet isn''t pumping fully and needs to be replaced. '),
  ('c0bf8b92-565e-4ee2-b8f7-c248032b637c', 'westport', DATE '2026-03-12', null, 'Not using the HWS consistently. Turned the peak up just a little bit and it had really good coverage. Changed the red to a different pink tip. Current tip looked blown out a little '),
  ('d6b66255-b8fc-4add-8f09-f59ea02a3934', 'westport', DATE '2026-03-26', null, 'Final rinse isn''t turning on every car. Spoke to Enrique he knows about it and they are going to replace the solenoid. Cars are coming out dry. Turned up the lo Phoam a little to better the show. Show looks good otherwise'),
  ('9f777f4c-f167-4a6a-9718-36fb1e55f443', 'westport', DATE '2026-04-10', null, 'The drying agent doesn''t turn on for ever car. It''s very inconsistent. Jerry said they had someone look at it a couple different times. Will monitor the red. I think they put a lo Phoam in the red. '),
  ('c4ff6725-de43-43a7-8d02-15bbc6f28850', 'westport', DATE '2026-04-23', null, 'Turned up the hot wax and lo Phoam a little bit to get a better show. Cars are coming out pretty dry but the side nozzles aren''t turning on every car, they knew. Turned the protect down because they are using a lot. Also having an issue with their water and maintenance is coming back at some point. '),
  ('70eb0644-50eb-4af6-b4b1-5b412c0589db', 'westport', DATE '2026-05-07', null, 'They aren''t using much of the HWS from the thumb gun. Some guys aren''t using it at all. Drying agent has to be overridden to on for it to be effective. Turned down the protect. '),
  ('c08e1f9f-f6a0-4218-962b-96442a199f73', 'westport', DATE '2026-05-21', null, 'Noah is putting in a maintenance request for the drying agent. Is working better than upon arrival but not much pressure into the tunnel. Turned up the dosatron for the peak and infusions up a little bit. '),
  ('262c1cc4-9001-45cd-89b7-ff298dabe9be', 'westport', DATE '2026-06-04', null, 'Drying agent is working a little bit better than last visit. Everything is working well. Smell is coming through the peak lo. '),
  ('3a30d74a-70a8-4617-a7b8-e3ea051fbaa4', 'westport', DATE '2026-06-18', null, 'Small amount of cars getting the colors so the numbers are off a little bit. They look good in the tunnel. Turned up the drying agent and peak lo for better usage. HWS looks good out of the thumb gun. '),
  ('81818cd5-5df4-4388-9c4a-a282c5748d96', 'westport', DATE '2026-07-02', null, 'Good show. Products are working well. No complaints. Will monitor Peak Lo to see if it needs to be turned down next visit. '),
  ('aa28dc32-6e74-4d4b-ac1e-6277c0a034aa', 'westport', DATE '2026-07-16', null, 'Final rinse bar isn''t turning on for every car so there''s some soap left on the car on some cars. Colors are hard to monitor with such little usage. They look good in the tunnel. '),
  ('f67e6106-763d-4678-a270-cc0c440e7491', 'westport', DATE '2026-07-30', null, 'Final rinse isn''t turning on so it''s not washing a lot of the soap off of the car. '),
  ('c5b53836-f846-4c43-a259-921ef4f51f3f', 'westport', DATE '2026-08-13', null, 'Protect was turned up as high as it goes on the pulsatron. I turned it down significantly. The X55 was forced on since last week (Enrique said it wasn''t working unless it was forced on).I will monitor the usage on the triple polish.  Flash wax needs to be a little high for the show. '),
