  ('6aea5765-6518-4baf-ab18-8bc6b2a489e2', 'wilton', DATE '2025-06-03', null, null),
  ('ede0ac60-8f4e-421c-91ef-83ef8fbd0dda', 'wilton', DATE '2025-06-20', null, null),
  ('4fae37c0-0797-4378-a3a3-eba8ec09f3c4', 'wilton', DATE '2025-07-03', null, null),
  ('6c7beb6d-b218-4d07-9677-6cb8365910ff', 'wilton', DATE '2025-07-15', null, null),
  ('2afd554e-2560-43ae-ae9c-ce81c4ca4e09', 'wilton', DATE '2025-07-29', null, null),
  ('ec5743cb-c7ad-4183-9e80-bcaf33078171', 'wilton', DATE '2025-08-12', null, null),
  ('b9a436db-8c91-48ab-85ff-8262dbaea8db', 'wilton', DATE '2025-08-26', null, 'Connected Sonny''s products for Wax and Polish Red. Yellow polish is the only remaining Lustra product online. '),
  ('558a97a0-f2c9-4115-8b52-9ef91ba7995c', 'wilton', DATE '2025-09-09', null, null),
  ('33741d8b-c41f-48f8-8ec9-72e9c25f5ba5', 'wilton', DATE '2025-09-22', null, null),
  ('7c0b460b-8023-4ede-8568-b68f7bb28dd4', 'wilton', DATE '2025-10-20', null, null),
  ('a57926dc-6802-4891-b16c-3b7bd0fd71f3', 'wilton', DATE '2025-10-21', null, null),
  ('16491d6e-4a80-454e-843f-68c7793224a6', 'wilton', DATE '2025-11-04', null, null),
  ('a63f1ddf-347a-4ca8-957e-f15e7efbadc5', 'wilton', DATE '2025-11-21', null, null),
  ('06734943-81ea-46e2-9b6e-a4a810b68bf3', 'wilton', DATE '2025-12-05', null, null),
  ('667397c0-1db3-46d1-9b16-80795b38c3b0', 'wilton', DATE '2025-12-18', null, 'Turned up drying agent from 16 to 17 on VD for 10 mls live pull. Turned protect up from 12 to 13 '),
  ('b371cad7-ec41-43cb-9075-c12e553a8b18', 'wilton', DATE '2025-12-30', null, 'Turned up VD on drying agent from 17 to 18. Turned up VD on Lo Phoam from 22 to 23 for a better show. Colors look good for the show will keep an eye on them. '),
  ('d57a7371-5746-4c4b-998e-e642c3af3d39', 'wilton', DATE '2026-01-15', null, 'Turned X55 up from 17 to 18 on VD. Turned Lo Phoam up from 25 to 26 on VD. HWS was high usage because dosatron spilled water and they had to clean the reservoir because the product was watered down. '),
  ('399e089c-6907-47b3-9478-0125acb03998', 'wilton', DATE '2026-01-29', null, 'Turned up X55 from 18 to 21 to dry cars better. Replaced dosatron for HWS thumb gun but the line was frozen per Wilsons request. Track was frozen so functions were on for longer than normal. Turned up protect because of low usage. '),
  ('176ecd87-9fc6-4579-b8c0-248913c73f64', 'wilton', DATE '2026-02-12', null, 'Foot valve was pulled completely out of X55 when I arrived. They didn''t notice anything with cars coming out wet which is hard to believe but I put the foot valve back in and it was pulling 10 mls per car. Turned up protect from 13 to 15 on VD. Turned up performance from 17 to 18 on VD. Colors look good coming out will monitor on here'),
  ('c2a9587c-9d8a-45a8-bd03-d36c264b4a6f', 'wilton', DATE '2026-02-26', null, 'Triple polish red was put in lo Phoam. So red usage is showing high. Lo Phoam live pulls are 12 mls per car. Turned flash wax and protect up 1 on VD. Turned the air up on Lo Phoam and it''s more foamy now. Cars are drying well. '),
  ('48195744-517b-47e8-90a7-287611026dad', 'wilton', DATE '2026-03-12', null, 'X55 was empty upon arrival. I let Wilson know they need to be checking it. Who knows how long it was empty for. Line was not full at all. Turned up HWS to 21 on VD but I missed a box of HWS last visit. Turned up X55 to 22 on VD'),
  ('6094be3c-347c-4dee-8443-f690571e7098', 'wilton', DATE '2026-03-26', null, 'Everything was working well. Turned up the performance from 18 to 19. Also the Graphene dosatron was missing the check valve in the bottom so I told Wilson and gave him a repair kit that has the check valve. Graphene had bad back flow '),
  ('1ae45e46-37c0-493b-994d-135c37165e23', 'wilton', DATE '2026-04-10', null, 'They are using the HWS in buckets inside the tunnel so usage is really high. Also have tire shine on all details which are not accounted for. Show looks good. X55 was empty upon arrival, not sure for how long. '),
  ('81b55ff1-6c3d-4674-9f46-45b8bc8511bc', 'wilton', DATE '2026-04-23', null, 'Tire shine is high but all details are not included. '),
  ('23fe6649-a0b0-4064-8316-2837a0b5e674', 'wilton', DATE '2026-05-07', null, 'Live pulls of X55 are 11 mls. It was empty upon arrival with backups already here. Probably need to replace the graphene but will let it run for a little bit to see if it gets any better. Put a check valve into the dosatron so the backflow should stop on the Graphene. Asked them to replace it weeks ago. Besides that the show looked good. Cars were drying off. '),
  ('6881ac3f-29e1-4fc5-b6c1-70d0b9e0b0fb', 'wilton', DATE '2026-05-21', null, 'HWS is high because of them dumping it into buckets in the tunnel. Everything looked good. '),
  ('a39eb873-e464-4bbe-b85d-f39e3ac66b8a', 'wilton', DATE '2026-06-04', null, 'HWS is being used for all the details so that''s why usage is high. Show looks good. Cars are coming out dry and shiny. '),
  ('cd34c385-b4b6-4891-b19a-89bddd5922e1', 'wilton', DATE '2026-06-18', null, 'The wash is looking good. Cars are coming out dry. HWS is being used in the tunnel, which is why its showing high. '),
  ('e66c5289-a969-4882-8a5a-7e358c137368', 'wilton', DATE '2026-07-02', null, 'Turned down the lophoam 0.5 on VD for both of them. They taking HWS and dumping it into the a bucket in the tunnel. So thats the reasoning for the high usage. But turned down the VD for the function. '),
  ('306652be-05ed-4f72-8bf4-5f83a45c6d24', 'wilton', DATE '2026-07-16', null, 'Tire shine is all hand applied and the details aren''t included. They use HWS in buckets in the tunnel so usage is high. Turned down the X55 to 21.5 on VD and turned down the lophoam to 26 on VD '),
  ('7c8c7b15-f1bd-44fa-8ec6-d49f58240bef', 'wilton', DATE '2026-07-30', null, 'Tire Shine is always high. HWS is being used in buckets in the tunnel so its a little high. Turned down the Protect and X55 to lower usage. Live pulls of performance were 5-6 mls. '),
  ('5e6e3721-2caf-4be0-b3ab-3f89a91b816c', 'wilton', DATE '2026-08-13', null, 'Live pulls of the HWS were 5-6 mls. The high usage is from them bringing it into the tunnel and putting it in buckets for car prep. I turned down the lo phoam and the x55 due to high usage. '),
  ('8c236825-4440-4128-9896-e2bad4597039', 'shelburne', DATE '2025-05-16', null, null),
  ('c499c09d-ad0e-4c8b-9351-5c7db93d3131', 'shelburne', DATE '2025-05-30', null, null),
  ('56c467d4-25e0-4bef-9081-2031e30c389a', 'shelburne', DATE '2025-06-18', null, 'drying agent doesnt seem to be coming on all the packages, cars that are not getting drying agent look really bad. will send an email in regards to this.'),
  ('3f36d101-c2a6-4a11-8acd-01082b53e8f8', 'shelburne', DATE '2025-07-02', null, null),
  ('85e23003-f950-4eec-9df1-71fccf6cb4f0', 'shelburne', DATE '2025-07-22', null, '-drying agent is now on every package, cars are coming out great.,pulling 10mls - Noticed the Ulra package is not getting Clear coat(Protect) when it should. Will send an email in regards to that.'),
  ('2f8db5cd-6f73-4391-8c80-af83d33d3bfd', 'shelburne', DATE '2025-08-06', null, null),
  ('61bd346f-6508-4342-b7ee-75a977e4d97c', 'shelburne', DATE '2025-08-26', null, '-bug remover turned down'),
  ('580ec6c8-d7e9-4ebf-9318-401d4f4afe0f', 'shelburne', DATE '2025-09-15', null, null),
  ('598ee0c6-021e-480d-ae6e-22128c5e9b01', 'shelburne', DATE '2025-10-03', null, '-no duo injector, scent is ready to be plugged in.'),
  ('1e0a00ef-cd85-4219-b27f-b3433f1df93f', 'shelburne', DATE '2025-11-04', null, '-versadail for protect was replaced, pulling now - Duo injector installed with Performance(Presoak1) goes on every car, smells great customers should be happy- Graphene left on site, applicator still not up.-triple foam turned up '),
  ('836cfddf-ca5a-48f3-b9ad-4b5f1e245f43', 'shelburne', DATE '2025-12-03', null, null),
  ('b743467a-845b-4cb7-a19f-57d85b410c06', 'shelburne', DATE '2025-12-19', null, 'PC still down, Maintenance waiting for part, reason why CTAs and Protect arent working. -Drying Agent turned up. Rain day didnt see top package wash.'),
  ('ddd5eafa-6dd2-4016-af0b-3e6f9481db8b', 'shelburne', DATE '2026-01-08', null, 'Protect and CTA still down, will reach out to Noah to see why its taking so long to get the part. two tire shine lines were missing footvalves. Cars are coming out great despite missing functions.'),
  ('ca619288-9d91-496f-a30a-d272a8f8a7bc', 'shelburne', DATE '2026-01-21', null, 'waiting on car count -Tire shine valve would stay open causing inrease usage in tire shine. Mantience is fixing this issue today, air is shut off until its fixed.'),
  ('e60d3d50-3e69-4dfe-b99d-daa2a2836bfb', 'shelburne', DATE '2026-02-05', null, null),
  ('b2514569-a167-411d-98df-0568cf86c51f', 'shelburne', DATE '2026-02-24', null, null),
  ('0f642164-184e-4363-92de-574e7ad0c623', 'shelburne', DATE '2026-03-10', null, null),
  ('1355caed-1921-42c3-8db5-13266177a9f3', 'shelburne', DATE '2026-04-01', null, null),
  ('893ccf93-f673-46da-aa4a-01f8607139a9', 'shelburne', DATE '2026-04-23', null, 'Upon arrival Triple foam was coming out like shaving cream, Versdails were turned up to 19,17,15 pulling more than our target. Triple foam has been dialed back. Red VDS-14, Yellow VDS-12 Blue VDS-12. Must have just happend since high usages did not reflect on the report.  X55 was pullung 16mls VDS was at 25, adjusted to pull 10mls VDS at 19.'),
  ('0c0f7010-82c2-42bd-9d32-38e7e24e55c4', 'shelburne', DATE '2026-05-12', null, 'Flash Wax was pulling 17.8mls which is too much. VDS was set at 20, lowered down to 18. '),
